  <para style="h">Udiana Ñwed Krọnikịd</para>
  <para style="toc1">Udiana Ñwed Krọnikịd</para>
  <para style="toc2">Udiana Ñwed Krọnikịd</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Krọn</para>
  <para style="mt1">Udiana Ñwed Krọnikịd</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Sọlọmọn Abeeñe Aniọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 1:1" />Sọlọmọn ayịn Defid amaasịn ñkam anyʌñ anie nsọọñọnda akara abio amọ, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ amaaba ye anye anyʌñ anam anye akpon eti-eti.<verse eid="2CH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 1:2" />Akem Sọlọmọn atañ ikọ anọ afịd Isrel, anọ mme adaiso ekọñ ke mme tọsịn (1,000) ye mme adaiso ekọñ ke mme ikie (100), mme abiideikpe ye afịd mme adadusʌñ ke Isrel, mme iwuod ufọk; <verse eid="2CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 1:3" />ndin Sọlọmọn ye afịd esob emaekaa ke ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ke Kibiọn, sia atayad mbono Abasi akeba do, ake Moses awo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akenamma ke anaan. <verse eid="2CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 1:4" />Idahami Defid amaakeben akebe edioomo Abasi ke Kiriad Yerịm adọọk adi ke itie ake anye akenamma anịm anọ anye, sia anye amaawuuk atayad anọ anye ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 1:5" />Ado akpokoro uwa akpoho ake Besalel ayịn Uri, ayịn Họọ, akenamma akeba ke Kibiọn ke iso tabanakịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ndin Sọlọmọn ye esob ado emaebịp ebaña anye ke udo. <verse eid="2CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 1:6" />Sọlọmọn amaadọọk akaa ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke akpokoro uwa akpoho ke atayad mbono anyʌñ akewa ufọfọb uwa tọsịn keed (1,000) do.<verse eid="2CH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 1:7" />Ke akonayio ado Abasi amaabiọññọ anọ Sọlọmọn anyʌñ abo anye, “Beeñe se afo akpeyeyem nọ ami unọ fiin.”<verse eid="2CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 1:8" />Sọlọmọn amaabọọrọ Abasi abo, “Afo amaawọt ekamba mfọnido ye ete mmi Defid anyʌñ annam miin adidem ke itie amọ. <verse eid="2CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 1:9" />Idahami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi, yak se akenwọñọ anọọ ete mmi Defid asọọñọ ada, sia afo amennam miin adidem anọ mbon awo ake ewakka nte ntan ke isọñ. <verse eid="2CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 1:10" />Nnọ miin aniọñ ye ifiọk, se ndiikama ndat mbon ami usʌñ, sia anie awo akeme adikara utọ atu awo mfo ami?”<verse eid="2CH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 1:11" />Abasi amaabo Sọlọmọn, “Sia ami adooho uduak esịd mfo ndin afo ukubeeñeke uforo, inie me ukpono, me adiyem mme asua mfo ekpañña, ndin sia afo umuubeeñeke anyan uwem ado aniọñ ye ifiọk adikaara mbon mmi ake ami ñkenamma afo ado adidem, <verse eid="2CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 1:12" />ke ntoro eyaunọ fiin aniọñ ye ifiọk. Ndin ñyaanyʌñ unọ fiin uforo, inie ye ukpono ñkọrọ, utọ a-adooho akenaanam adidem ndomokeed se ikiba mbemiso afo ikinieghe ndin ndomokeed se iduukeene fiin idiinyʌññọ inie.”<verse eid="2CH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 1:13" />Akema Sọlọmọn amaato ke ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ke Kibiọn akaa ke Yeruselem, ke iso atayad mbono. Ndin anye amaakara Isrel.<verse eid="2CH 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 1:14" />Sọlọmọn amaanie mme sariọd ye mme enañmbakara; anye akenie sariọd tọsịn keed mme ikie inaañ (1,400) ye enañmbakara tọsịn duob mme iba (12,000) ake anye akenyʌññọ abono ke mme abio sariọd ye adidem ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 1:15" />Adidem amaanam silfa ye kold awak ke Yeruselem nte ñkaña itiad, ndin eto sida awak nte mme eto fik-sikamọ ke mme mben abod. <verse eid="2CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 1:16" />Eketobo mme enañmbakara Sọlọmọn eto Iyib ye Kue; mbon unyam udua adidem ekedep ammọ eto Kue<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido Silisia</char></note> ke ekọmudua idaha ado. <verse eid="2CH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 1:17" />Ammọ emaetobo sariọd keed eto Iyib ke ekọmudua sekel silfa ikie itiokeed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 6.9</char></note> (600), ye enañmbakara keed ke ikie keed mme aba mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 1.7</char></note> (150). Ammọ emaenyʌñ esịññe ammọ enọ esọk afịd ndidem mbon Hed ye ake mme Aram.<verse eid="2CH 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="2CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mbeeñeidem Adibọp Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">2: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru 2 Kr 2:1 ewet 2 Kr 1:18, ñko 2 Kr 2:2-18 ewet 2 Kr 2:1-17</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 2:1" />Sọlọmọn amaanọ uyio ate ebọp tembịd enọ Anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye akwere abọọñ enọ anye ke idem amọ. <verse eid="2CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 2:2" />Sọlọmọn amaadat ideen tọsịn ata mme duob (70,000) nte mme abiom mbiomo ye tọsịn anaañ (80,000) nte mme akpịkke itiad ke mme abod ye tọsịn ita mme ikie itiokeed (3,600) nte mme adaiso nnọọ ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 2:3" />Sọlọmọn amaanọ etob ami esọk Hiram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru Huram asʌk ado Hiram, se ñko ke 2 Kr 2:11 ye 12</char></note> adidem ke Tai:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:3">Nọ usasiak eto sida ensọk miin kpa naña afo akenam ye ete mmi Defid ke ini afo akenọọhọ sida esọk anye nọ edat ebọp itieidʌñ adidem enọ anye adʌñ. <verse eid="2CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 2:4" />Idahami ami ñyem adibọp tembịd nnọọ Anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi ñnyʌñ ñyaak anye nnọọ nte itie adidat mfọp inem ufịk insensi ke iso amọ, ke adisio uyo emaekediọñ asaña-asaña nnịm ke afịd ini, ke adinyʌñ nnam ufọfọb uwa afịd ubakusen ye ndubiayio ye ke mme Sabad, ke mme Ufa Afiọñ ye ke adimek mme usọrọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn. Ami ado nsi-nsi ewʌhọ anọ Isrel.<verse eid="2CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 2:5" />Tembịd ake ami ñyemme adibọp ayaakpon, sia Abasi ñnyịn akpon akan afịd mme abasi mfen. <verse eid="2CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 2:6" />Ado anie awo anie ukeme adibọp tembịd nnọọ anye, sia mme anyọñ, kpa mme anyọñ akoñño akan, ikemeke adikem anye? Ami ndin ndo anie awo ake ñkemeke adibọp tembịd nnọọ anye, ke imiibọhọke itie se efọp uwa enọ anye?<verse eid="2CH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 2:7" />Ke ntoro, nọ awo a-anekkeke anieghe ifiọk usọ ke kold ye silfa akpəho ye ukwak, ye ke ndad-ndad, ididuod ye bru-bru afọñ nọ ensọk miin, a-anyʌññọ anie ifiọk adimịñ ñkpọ, yak adinam utom ke Yuda ye ke Yeruselem ye nta mbon ubọkutom mmi, ake ete mmi Defid akenịmme.<verse eid="2CH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 2:8" />Nyʌñ nọ adukpọk eto sida, yunipa ye alkọm e-etooho Lebanọn ensọk miin, sia ami mmediọọñọ ke nditọufọk mfo e-enekke ediọọñọ ukpịkke adukpọk do. Nditọufọk mmi eyaenam utom ye nditọufọk mfo <verse eid="2CH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 2:9" />edinnọọ miin uwak-uwak adukpọk, sia tembịd a-ami mbọppọ ana akpon anyʌñ atara. <verse eid="2CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 2:10" />Ami ñyaanọ nditọufọk mfo, mbon e-ekekpịkkeke adukpọk, udomo kọọs ukọkọk wiid tọsịn edịb (20,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 3,600 me metrịk tọọn 3,200 </char></note>, udomo kọọs baali tọsịn edịb (20,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 3,000 me metrịk tọọn 2,700</char></note>, udomo atu ukọd tọsịn edịb (20,000) ye udomo abañ adan ọlif tọsịn edịb (20,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte lita 440,000</char></note>.<verse eid="2CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 2:11" />Hiram adidem ke Tai amaabọọrọ ke adiwet nnọọ Sọlọmọn:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:11">“Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaha mbon amọ, anye amaunam fiin adidem ammọ.”<verse eid="2CH 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 2:12" />Ndin Hiram amaadian:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 2:12">“Itooro anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, a-akenamma anyọñ ye isọñ! Anye amaanọ adidem Defid ayịn a-anieghe aniọñ, a-anieghe ifiọk ye ikike, a-adiibọp tembịd inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye akwere abọọñ inọ idem amọ.<verse eid="2CH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 2:13" />“Ami nsʌk nnọ Huram-Abi usọk fiin, awo a-anieghe akpọsọñ ifiọk ke utomusọ, <verse eid="2CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 2:14" />eka amọ aketo Daan ndin ete amọ aketo Tai. Anye akekpeep adinam ñkpọ ke kold ye silfa, brọns ye ukwak, itiad ye eto, ye ke ndad-ndad ye abubịd ye iduod-iduod afọñ ye linen. Anye anie ifiọk abaña afịd adimịñ ñkpọ anyʌñ akeme adimịñ se utọ ñkpọ akeedodo e-enọọhọ anye. Anye ayaanam utom ye mbon unie ifiọk utom mfo ye mbon utom abọọñ mmi, Defid ete mfo.<verse eid="2CH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 2:15" />“Ke ami yak abọọñ mmi anọ nditọufọk amọ abakpa ye baali ye adan ọlif ye ukọd ado anye akenwọñọke, <verse eid="2CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 2:16" />ñnyịn iyainyʌñ ikpịkke afịd ukpịd eto ke Lebanọn ake afo ayemme inyʌñ ibọọp ammọ idian inam efiọọrọ ke akpainyañ esuuk eka Yopa. Afo amekeme adikoono ammọ ndin akaa Yeruselem.”<verse eid="2CH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 2:17" />Sọlọmọn amaanam ibad afịd isenawo ekedʌññọ ke Isrel, ke ubadawo ete amọ Defid akenamma amaakeboiyo; anyʌñ akịt ke ammọ ekedo tọsịn ikie keed mme aba mme duob mme ita mme ikie itiokeed (153,600). <verse eid="2CH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 2:18" />Anye amaasịn mbon awo tọsịn ata mme duob (70,000) ke ufʌn adinam utom ubiom mbiomo ye mbon awo tọsịn anaañ nte mbon ukpịkke itiad ke mme abod, ye mbon awo tọsịn ita mme ikie itiokeed (3,600) edise ñkpọ mbaña mbon e-enamma utom ñnyʌñ ñkịt mbo ke ammọ enam utom.<verse eid="2CH 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Sọlọmọn Abọp Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 3:1" />Akem Sọlọmọn amaatọọñọ adibọp tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Yeruselem ke Abod Moria, ke itie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akewọttọ ete amọ Defid idem. Akedo ke afe ubeek abakpa Arauna awo Yebus, ke itie a-Defid akemekke. <verse eid="2CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 3:2" />Anye aketọọñọ adibọp ke ayọhọ usen iba ke ayọhọ afiọñ iba ke ayọhọ isua inaañ ke ukara amọ.<verse eid="2CH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 3:3" />Itiad idakisọñ ake Sọlọmọn akesịnne ke adibọp tembịd Abasi akedo kubid ata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte mita 27 ke unyọọñ ye mita 9 ke ukpa</char></note> (ikpad anaañ mme duob) ke unyọọñ ye kubid edịb (ikpad edịb mme duob) ke ukpa (ke edatta akaan udomo kubid). <verse eid="2CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 3:4" />Ntondʌk tembịd akedo kubid edịb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 30 me mita 9; se ñko ke 2 Kr 3:8, 11, ye 13</char></note> ke anyan ke afịd ukpa ufọk ado ye kubid edịb ke unyọọñ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 3:4">Anye amaadat ataa eti kold abịt ke esịd ufọk. <verse eid="2CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 3:5" />Anye amaadat adukpọk yunipa akọñ ke ekamba esịdufọk anyʌñ afʌk anye ke ataa eti kold amaanyʌñ akama ekpad ayob ye ñkprọñ adiọñ anye. <verse eid="2CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 3:6" />Anye amaadiọñ tembịd ye nsọñudua itiad. Ndin kold ake anye akekamake akedo kold Pafaim. <verse eid="2CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 3:7" />Anye amaadat kold afʌk ke usiid abom, mme eto udọk, mme ndibene ye mme udọk ke tembịd, anye amaanyʌñ akap serubim ke mme ndibene.<verse eid="2CH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 3:8" />Anye amaabọp Ataa Adisana Itie, unyọọñ amọ asaña akekem ye ukpa tembịd, kubid edịb ke unyọọñ ye kubid edịb ke ukpa. Anye amaafʌk esịd ufọk ke eti kold talen ikie itiokeed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 23 me metrịk tọọn 21</char></note>. <verse eid="2CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 3:9" />Mme akpohoukwak akedoppo sekel aba mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kram 575</char></note>. Anye amaanyʌñ afʌk ubeed anyọñ ye kold.<verse eid="2CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 3:10" />Ke Ataa Adisana Itie anye amaanam ubobod serubim iba anyʌñ afʌk ammọ ke kold. <verse eid="2CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 3:11" />Unyọọñ ukpa mba mme serubim akedo kubid edịb. Mba keed ake akpa serub akedo kubid ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 7 1/2 me mita 2.3; se ñko ke 2 Kr 3:15</char></note> ke anyan ndin atuuk ndibene tembịd, ke ini mba anye ako, akenyọọñọ kubid ition ke anyan, amaatuuk mba ake serub anye ako. <verse eid="2CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 3:12" />Kpa ke ukem-ukem ado mba keed ake ayọhọ serub iba akenyọọñ kubid ition anyʌñ atuuk ndibene mfen ke tembịd, ndin mba amọ anye ako, kubid ition ke unyọọñ, amaatuuk mba serub anye ako. <verse eid="2CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 3:13" />Mme mba mme serubim ami emaenyọọñ esịm kubid edịb. Ammọ ekeda ke ukod ammọ, iso ammọ ekese ekamba ufọk.<verse eid="2CH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 3:14" />Anye amaanam afọñ ikpeghe ado ke bru, iduod-iduod ye ndad-ndad udʌk ye eti linen, anyʌñ akịm serubim asịn ke esịd amọ.<verse eid="2CH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 3:15" />Ke abaña iso tembịd anye amaanam abai iba, naña iba ekedoñño kubid edịb mme duob mme ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 53 me mita 16</char></note> ke unyọọñ, ammọ keedekeed emaenie itam ke iwuod akekoñño ke kubid ition. <verse eid="2CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 3:16" />Anye amaanam mme ñkprọñ akeduyiideke asịn ke iwuod mme abai ado. Anye amaanyʌñ anam pomekrened ikie keed anyʌñ ayiit ammọ ke mme ñkprọñ ado. <verse eid="2CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 3:17" />Anye amaabọp mme abai ado adaaha ke iso tembịd, keed ke usuuk keed ñko ke adoro. Andikida ke usuuk anye akekoot Yakịn ndin andikida ke adoro anye akoot Boas.<verse eid="2CH 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkpọ Mbanaufọk Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 4:1" />Anye amaadat akpoho anam akpokoro uwa kubid edịb ke unyọọñ, kubid edịb ke ukpa ye kubid duob ke ukoñ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 30 ke unyọọñ ye ukpa ye ikpad 15 ke ukoñ me mita 9 ke unyọọñ ye ke ukpa ye mita 4.5 ke ukoñ </char></note>. <verse eid="2CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 4:2" />Anye amaadat ukwak akpoho anam Akpainyañ, anam anye ado ikara-ikara, udomo amọ akedo kubid duob tọọñọ ke mbeñ keed tutu akaa akewuọ mbeñ mfen ye kubid ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 7 1/2 me ñkpọ nte mita 2.3</char></note> ke ukoñ. Ekedat udʌk a-adooho kubid edịb mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 45 me mita 14</char></note> edidomo anye ñkanna. <verse eid="2CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 4:3" />Ke idak mben ado, emaewet mbid ñyaaraenañ ekanna anye ekʌk, duob ke kubid keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho sentimita 14</char></note>. Emaetat udịm ñyaaraenañ iba ke itie keed ye Akpainyañ ado.<verse eid="2CH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 4:4" />Akpainyañ ado akedoro ke anyọñ ñyaaraenañ duob mme iba, ita esak iso ese adoro, ita ese usobutịn, ita ese usuuk ndin ita ese usakkautịn. Akpainyañ ado akedoro ke edem ammọ, ndin ukod edem ammọ akewọt ufọọd. <verse eid="2CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 4:5" />Udob amọ akedo ekaubọk keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte sentimita 7.5</char></note>, ndin mben amọ aketie nte mben kọọb, nte nseghe lili. Anye akedọñọ abañ mmọọñ tọsịn ita (3,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte lita 66,000</char></note>.<verse eid="2CH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 4:6" />Akem anye amaanam besịn duob se edat eyeet ñkpọ anyʌñ anịm ition ke ñkañ usuuk-usuuk ye ition ke ñkañ anyọñ-anyọñ. Ekesidat ammọ eyeet mme ñkpọ se ekama enam ufọfọb uwa, ado mme aku ekesidat mmọọñ ekamba abesịn eyeet ñkpọ.<verse eid="2CH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 4:7" />Anye amaanam ñkpọ uwuuk utuenikañ duob ke kold nte asañake akekem ye aduuk ammọ anyʌñ anịm ammọ ke tembịd, ition ke usuuk-usuuk ndin ition ke anyọñ-anyọñ.<verse eid="2CH 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 4:8" />Anye amaanam akpokoro duob anyʌñ anịm ke tembịd, ition ke ñkañ usuuk-usuuk ye ition ke anyọñ-anyọñ. Anye amaanyʌñ anam usan usiime mmọọñ ikie keed ke kold.<verse eid="2CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 4:9" />Anye amaanam esa anọ mme aku, ye ekamba esob ye mme usʌñ ke esob ado, anyʌñ afʌk mme usʌñ ke akpoho. <verse eid="2CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 4:10" />Anye amaanịm mmọọñ ekamba abesịn ke ñkañ usuuk-usuuk, ke inuuk usuuk edem usobutịn.<verse eid="2CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 4:11" />Ndin Huram amaanyʌñ anam mme ako ye mme udọk mbakara ye mme usan usiimeñkpọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:11">Ndin Huram amaakweeñe ubiọñutom anye akenamma anọ Adidem Sọlọmọn ke tembịd Abasi:<verse eid="2CH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 4:12" />mme adaaha iba;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:12">mme mbuod iba e-ebaaha nte ntəño usan ke anyọñ mme adaaha;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:12">mme ukpakpakka ñkpọ iba edatta ebana mme mbuod iba e-ebaaha ke anyọñ mme adaaha;<verse eid="2CH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 4:13" />pomekrened ikie inaañ (400) a-anieghe ukpakpakka ubonoñkpọ iba (udịm pomekrened iba ke ukpakpakka ubonoñkpọ keedekeed ebana mme mbuod iba e-ebaaha nte ntəño usan e-ebaaha ke anyọñ adaaha);<verse eid="2CH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 4:14" />mme udodñkpọ ye mme besịn ammọ;<verse eid="2CH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 4:15" />Akpainyañ ye ñyaaraenañ duob mme iba ke idak amọ;<verse eid="2CH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 4:16" />mme ako, mme udọk mbakara, mme akuum ye afịd ñkpoduoho utom se isaña ye ammọ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 4:16" />
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:16">Afịd ñkpọ se Huram-Abi akenam anọ adidem Sọlọmọn ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedo ake nti brọns. <verse eid="2CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 4:17" />Adidem amaanam etat ammọ ke udomoñkpọ aduañ ke unaisọñ Yọdan ke ufọọd Sukọd ye Saretan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru Seredata asʌk ado Saretan</char></note>. <verse eid="2CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 4:18" />Afịd mme ñkpọ se Sọlọmọn akenam emaesọñ udua eti-eti tutu awo ikanna ibat udob brọns.<verse eid="2CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 4:19" />Sọlọmọn amaanyʌñ anam afịd ñkpọ mbana ufọk a-akebaaha ke tembịd Abasi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 4:19" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:19">akpokoro uwa e-enamma ke kold;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:19">mme akpokoro udod Uyo Iso Abasi;<verse eid="2CH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 4:20" />mme udodutuenikañ ake ataa eti kold ye mme utuenikañ ammọ, yak asak ke iso ata esịd adisana itieukpono naña ekebiere;<verse eid="2CH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 4:21" />mbana ñkpokpoñ ake kold ye mme utuenikañ ye ufadikañ (ekenam ammọ ke ataa eti kold);<verse eid="2CH 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 4:22" />ekedat ataa eti kold enam ufad afọñikañ, usan usiimeñkpọ, mme usan ye mme usan insensi; ye mme usʌñ kold ke tembịd: mme usʌñ ke esịd Ata Adisana Itie ye mme usʌñ ke akpan afe.<verse eid="2CH 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="2CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 5:1" />Ke afịd utom se Sọlọmọn akenam ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakekweeñe, anye amaakoono mme ñkpoduoho se ete amọ Defid akenịm asaña-asaña adidọñ mme ñkpọ mbana ake silfa ye ake kold, ndin anye amaabono ammọ ke ekpurikpu ke tembịd Abasi.<verse eid="2CH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eben Akebe Edioomo Abasi Edi ke Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 5:2" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaakoot mme ñkpisọñ ke Isrel edi ke Yeruselem, afịd mme adaiwuod ke mme esiin ye mme mbọọñ ke mme ufọk mbon Isrel, yak ammọ ediben akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> edọọk eto ke Saiyọn, Abio Defid. <verse eid="2CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 5:3" />Ndin afịd nditọ Isrel emaedisoobo keed ebịne adidem ke ini usọrọ ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba.<verse eid="2CH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 5:4" />Ke ini afịd mme ñkpisọñ ke Isrel emaekediwuọ, mme Lifai emaeben akebe edioomo, <verse eid="2CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 5:5" />ndin ammọ emaeben akebe edioomo ye atayad mbono ye afịd ndisana ñkpọ mbana ufọk ke esịd amọ. Mme aku Lifai emaekoono mme ñkpọ ami edọọk; <verse eid="2CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 5:6" />ndin Adidem Sọlọmọn ye afịd esob Isrel e-ekediighe edisoobo ye anye ekeba ke iso akebe edioomo, esʌk ewa uwak-uwak edọñ ye mme enañ ake awo imiikikanna adiwewet me adibabat.<verse eid="2CH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 5:7" />Mme aku ndin emaeben akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ekaa itie amọ ke ata esịd ubeed tembịd, Ata Adisana Itie, ekenịm anye ke idak mme mba serubim. <verse eid="2CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 5:8" />Mme serubim emaetat mme mba ammọ ke anyọñ itie akebe edioomo emaenyʌñ efʌk akebe edioomo ye mme mboi edatta eben anye. <verse eid="2CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 5:9" />Mme mboi ami emaenyọọñ tutu utịd ammọ, akesannake akpọñ akebe edioomo, amaado se eda ekịt ke iso ata esịd ubeed, ado awo ikikịtte ito anwa Adisana Itie; ndin ammọ mmọdo esʌk eba tutu mfịn ami. <verse eid="2CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 5:10" />Ñkpọ ndomokeed ikisịneke ke akebe edioomo ikan itiadñwed iba ake Moses akesịnne ke Họreb, ke itie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenamma edioomo ye mbon Isrel ke ammọ emaekewuọñọ eto Iyib.<verse eid="2CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 5:11" />Akem mme aku emaediwuọñọ ke Adisana Itie. Afịd mme aku se ikibañña do emaenam idem ammọ asana, ikeeneke me ubakka ñka ammọ ado akee. <verse eid="2CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 5:12" />Afịd mme Lifai ake ekedooho mbon ukwọ ikwọ: Asaf, Heman, Yedutun ye nditọ ammọ ye mbon ammọ ewanake ñkpọ emaeda ke ñkañ edem usakkautịn akpokoro uwa, esiine ata nti linen enyʌñ ebre mme simbal, mme ekpa ye mme ndidoudʌk. Mbon se ikisaña ye ammọ ekedo aku 120 (ikie keed mme edịb) ekesʌkọ efịt mme adukpoñ. <verse eid="2CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 5:13" />Mbon ufịt adukpoñ ye mbon ukwọ ikwọ emaedian uyio keed enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> itooro ye ekọọm. Mme adukpoñ emaediana, ye mme akpañkpañ ye mme ñkpọ mbre mbon mfen, mbon ukwọ ikwọ emaenekke ebenne uyio ke adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> itooro ke adikwọ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 5:13">“Anye afọn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 5:13">ima amọ ada ke nsi-nsi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 5:13">Akem tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayọhọ ye ntọñanyọñ, <verse eid="2CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 5:14" />ndin mme aku ikikanna adinam utom ammọ ke ntak ntọñanyọñ, sia ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayọhọ tembịd Abasi.<verse eid="2CH 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 6:1" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaabo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ke imọ idiidʌñ ke ñkịm-ñkịm ntọñanyọñ; <verse eid="2CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 6:2" />Ami mmebọp ñwuọnda uyaiya tembịd unọ fiin, itie se afo adʌñ ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="2CH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 6:3" />Ke ini afịd esob Isrel ekesʌkkọ eda do, adidem amaawọññọ anyʌñ adiọñ ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 6:4" />Ndin anye amaabo:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 6:4">“Itooro anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, a-adooho anye adat ubọk amọ anam se anye akedat inua amọ anwọñọ anọ ete mmi Defid. Sia anye amaabo, <verse eid="2CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 6:5" />‘Tọọñọ ke usen ake ami ñkebenne ikọd mmi nsio ke Iyib, Ami mmekke abio ke atu esiin Isrel nọ ebọp tembịd ake Anyịñ mmi adiiba do, me adimek awo ndomokeed nọ ado andikara mbon mmi Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 6:6" />Ado idahami ami mmemek Yeruselem nọ Anyịñ mmi aba do, mmenyʌñ mmek Defid adikara mbon mmi Isrel.’<verse eid="2CH 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 6:7" />“Ete mmi Defid amaakere ke esịd amọ adibọp tembịd nnọọ Anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 6:8" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo ete mmi Defid, ‘Afo amaanam eti-eti adikere ke esịd mfo adibọp tembịd nnọọ Anyịñ mmi. <verse eid="2CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 6:9" />Kpayeado, idooho afo uduudo andibọb tembịd ado, ado ayịn mfo, abʌk ye iyiib mfo, anye adiido andidiibọp tembịd inọ Anyịñ mmi.’<verse eid="2CH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 6:10" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anịm enwọñọ ake anye akenamma: ami mmedat itie Defid ete mmi ndin idahami ami ntie ke ebekpo Isrel, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọ, ndin ami mmebọp tembịd ado nnọ Anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 6:11" />Ami mmenịm akebe edioomo ke ndo, a-asịneke edioomo ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenamma ye mbon Isrel.”<verse eid="2CH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akam Adidiọñ ake Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 6:12" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaada ke iso akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke iso afịd esob Isrel, atat ubọk amọ. <verse eid="2CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 6:13" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaananam udodukod brọns, kubid ition ke unyọọñ, kubid ition ke ukpa ye kubid ita ke ukoñ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 7 1/2 ke unyọọñ ye ke ukpa ye ikpad 4 1/2 ke ukoñ me ñkpọ nte mita 2.3 ke unyọọñ ye ukpa ye mita 1.4 ke ukoñ</char></note>, ndin amaanịm anye ke ufọọd isọñ anwaesiin. Anye amaadọọk ada ke udodukod ado ndin anye atọọñọ edọñ ke iso afịd esob Isrel anyʌñ asio ubọk amọ atat awọt anyọñ. <verse eid="2CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 6:14" />Anye amaabo:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 6:14">“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, Abasi mfen ibaaha nte afo ke hefịn ke anyọñ me ke isọñ; afo ake anịmme edioomo ima mfo ye mbon mfo ake esʌkkọ esaña ke afịd esịd ammọ ke usʌñ mfo. <verse eid="2CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 6:15" />Afo amenịm enwọñọ mfo anọ awo mfo Defid ete mmi, ke inua mfo amenwọñọ ndin ke ubọk mfo amenam anye asu, kpa naña anye ado mfịn ami.<verse eid="2CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 6:16" />“Idahami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, nịm nọ afʌnadeen mfo Defid ete mmi mme enwọñọ a-afo akenamma anọọ anye idaha afo akebooho, ‘Afo uduutreke adinie adiaakpa se idiitie ke iso mmi ke ebekpo Isrel, akpekapado ubon mfo eyaekpeme ke afịd se ammọ enam ke edisaña ke iso mmi ñkeene mbed mmi, kpa naña afo anam.’ <verse eid="2CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 6:17" />Ndin idahami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, yak ikọ afo akenwọñọke anọọ afʌnadeen mfo Defid ete mmi asu ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="2CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 6:18" />“Ado me Abasi ke akpanikọ ayaadʌñ ke isọñ ye mme awo? Anyọñ, kpa anyọñ ake akoñño akan ikemeke adukem fiin. Die ndin ke tembịd ake ami mbọppọ aduukem fiin! <verse eid="2CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 6:19" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi sʌk nọ ñkpañutọñ ke akam ye ñkpeubọk afʌnadeen mfo nyʌñ tua mbọm. Kop aseeme ye akam ake afʌnadeen mfo abọññọ ke iso mfo. <verse eid="2CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 6:20" />Yak anyen mfo atara ase tembịd ami ke uweemeayio ye akonayio, itie ami a-afo akebooho ke imọ iyaisịn Anyịñ imọ do. Kop akam ake afʌnadeen mfo abọññọ ase itie ami. <verse eid="2CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 6:21" />Kop mme akam ñkpeubọk afʌnadeen mfo ye ake ikọd mfo Isrel ke ini ammọ ebọññọ akam ese itie ami. Kop ke anyọñ, itieidʌñ mfo, ndin umaukop, feen.<verse eid="2CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 6:22" />“Awo ndomokeed amaadue mbọhọidʌñ amọ ndin ado ana anye ata unwọñọ ndin ammọ edi mi enyʌñ enwọñọ unwọñọ ado ke iso akpokoro uwa mfo ke tembịd ami, <verse eid="2CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 6:23" />ndin tie ke hefịn nyʌñ tịppe ñkpọ nam. Biere ikpe ke ufọọd ikọd mfo, sua nọ mbon se idue ke adisuuk se ammọ ekenam ndoot ammọ ke iwuod, ndin saana mbon unana ndudue yaak nyʌñ nam ye ammọ nọ asaña akekem ke unana ndudue ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 6:24" />“Ke ini asua akanna mbon mfo Isrel sia ammọ udue fiin, ndin ke ini ammọ etịmmeke edem edi enyʌñ enọ anyịñ mfo itooro, ebọñ akam enyʌñ enam ñkpeubọk ke iso mfo ke tembịd ami, <verse eid="2CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 6:25" />ndin kop ke anyọñ nyʌñ feen ndudue ikọd mfo Isrel ndin ben ammọ tịmme nyọñ di ke isọñ ake afo akenọọhọ ammọ ye mme eteete ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 6:26" />“Ke ini emaekʌk mme enyọñ ndin edịm ideppe sia mbon mfo udue fiin, ndin ammọ ebọñ akam ese itie ami enyʌñ enọ anyịñ mfo itooro enyʌñ etịmme edem ekpọñ ndudue ammọ sia afo amemia ammọ ufen, <verse eid="2CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 6:27" />ndin tie ke anyọñ kop nyʌñ feen ndudue ikọd mfo, mbon mfo Isrel. Kpeep ammọ adisaña ke nnen-nnen usʌñ, nyʌñ nam edịm adep ke isọñ ake afo akenọọhọ mbon mfo ke udeeme.<verse eid="2CH 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 6:28" />“Adieke akañ me udọñọ nsobo adʌkkọ isọñ, me ikañekpo me mfuud, me mme ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ me mme ataktak, me idaha mme asua ekannake mme abio ammọ ekʌk, se utọ nsobo me udọñọ akpededi, <verse eid="2CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 6:29" />ndin ke ini awo akeedodo ke atu mbon mfo Isrel abọññọ akam me anamma ñkpeubọk, ke ekịtte ukuud ye ubiak ammọ, enyʌñ etat ubọk enyan ke tembịd ami, <verse eid="2CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 6:30" />nyʌñ kop to anyọñ, itieidʌñ mfo. Feen, nyʌñ nam ye afịd awo akeene afịd se ammọ enam, sia afo amediọọñọ esịd ammọ (sia afo ikpọọñ adiọọñọ esịd afịd awo), <verse eid="2CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 6:31" />nọ ato do ammọ uteeñe fiin enyʌñ esaña ke ñkobitem unọ fiin ke afịd ini uwem ammọ ke isọñ ake afo akenọọhọ mme eteete ñnyịn.<verse eid="2CH 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 6:32" />“Amaado asenawo ake imiitooho ubon mfo Isrel ado ato anyan idịd ke ntak ekamba anyịñ mfo ye akpọsọñ ubọk mfo ye adibenne ubọk mfo, ke ini ammọ ediighe edibọñ akam ke tembịd ami, <verse eid="2CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 6:33" />nyʌñ kop to anyọñ, itieidʌñ mfo. Nam se adodo ake asenawo ado ubeeñeke fiin, nọ afịd awo ke ekondo ediọọñọ anyịñ mfo enyʌñ uteeñe fiin, kpa naña mbon mfo Isrel enam, enyʌñ ediọọñọ ke ufọk ake ami mbọppọ mi akere Anyịñ mfo.<verse eid="2CH 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 6:34" />“Ke ini mbon mfo ekaaha ekọñ ye mme asua ammọ, itie akeedodo ake afo adọññọ ammọ, ndin ammọ emaebọñ akam unọ fiin ese abio ake afo amekke ye tembịd ake ami mbọppọ nnọ Anyịñ mfo, <verse eid="2CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 6:35" />ndin tie ke anyọñ kop akam ye ñkpeubọk ammọ, nyʌñ nọ ammọ se ido unen ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 6:36" />“Ke ini ammọ emaudue fiin, sia ibaaha awo ndomokeed ammiinamma idiọọkñkpọ, ndin afo ayat esịd ye ammọ anyʌñ ayaak ammọ anọ asua, a-amʌmmọ ammọ nte ifʌn akaa ke isọñ a-anyọọñọ usʌñ me a-akpereke; <verse eid="2CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 6:37" />adieke ammọ ekappake esịd ke isọñ e-emʌmmọ ammọ ukad, ekpọñ idiọọk, enyʌñ enam ñkpeubọk ye afo ke isọñ e-emʌmmọ ammọ ukad ete, ‘Ñnyịn iminam idiọọkñkpọ, iminam idue, iminyʌñ inam se ideghe’; <verse eid="2CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2CH 6:38" />ndin adieke ammọ etịmmeke ukeene fiin ke afịd esịd ye ukpọñ ammọ ke isọñ e-eketañña ammọ eka, enyʌñ ebọñ akam ese isọñ a-afo akenọọhọ mme eteete ammọ, ese abio a-afo akemekke enyʌñ ese tembịd a-ami mbọppọ nnọ Anyịñ mfo; <verse eid="2CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2CH 6:39" />ndin tie ke anyọñ, itieidʌñ mfo, kop akam ye ñkpeubọk ammọ, nyʌñ toppo ammọ ikpe. Nyʌñ feen nọ ikọd mfo ake udueghe fiin.<verse eid="2CH 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2CH 6:40" />“Ke ami, Abasi mmi, anyen mfo akpekap atara, utọñ mfo anyʌñ anie ñkpañutọñ ke mme akam ake ebọññọ ke itie ami.<verse eid="2CH 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2CH 6:41" />“Idahami, dakka da, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi, nyʌñ di itie nduọkadudu mfo,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:41">afo ye akebe edioomo adudu mfo.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="2CH 6:41">Yak mme aku mfo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ekpekap esiine adinyaaña ke idem</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:41">mbon akpanikọ mfo ekpekap edaara ke mfọnido mfo.<verse eid="2CH 6:41" /></para>
  <para style="qm1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2CH 6:42" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi, kuusịn anye a-afo akeyette adan anịm.</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="2CH 6:42">Toiyo akwa ima a-akenwọñọke anọọ Defid isʌñutom mfo.”<verse eid="2CH 6:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CH 7" />
  <para style="s1">Adidiọñ Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 7:1" />Ke ini Sọlọmọn amaakekweeñe adibọñ akam, ikañ amaato ke anyọñ asọiyọ adita ufọfọb uwa ye mme uwa, ndin ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayọhọ ke tembịd. <verse eid="2CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 7:2" />Mme aku ikikanna edidʌk ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> sia ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayọhọ ke esịd. <verse eid="2CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 7:3" />Ke ini mbon Isrel ekekịtte ikañ naña asọiyọ adi ye ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> naña adoro ke tembịd, ammọ emaetọọñọ edọñ ke mbood ye iso ammọ ke isọñ, ndin ammọ emaekpono enyʌñ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ekọọm, ebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 7:3">“Anye afọn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 7:3">ima amọ aba ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="2CH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 7:4" />Akem adidem ye afịd mme awo emaewa uwa ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 7:5" />Ndin adidem Sọlọmọn amaawa uwa ke iwuod enañ tọsịn edịb mme iba (22,000) ye mme edọñ ye mme ebod tọsịn ikie mme edịb (120,000). Ndin adidem ye afịd awo emaediọñ tembịd Abasi. <verse eid="2CH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 7:6" />Mme aku emaedat itie ammọ, kpa naña mme Lifai ekenam ye mme ndido mbre ikwọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ake adidem Defid akenamma nọ esikama etooro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ekenyʌññọ esikama ke ini anye akenọọhọ ekọọm, abo, “Ima amọ asʌk abaaba ke nsi-nsi.” Ke nsakiso mme Lifai, mme aku emaefịt adukpoñ, ndin afịd mbon Isrel ekedaada.<verse eid="2CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 7:7" />Sọlọmọn amaasio ufọọd itie esa ke iso tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anịm asaña-asaña adiọñ, ndin ke itie ado anye amaanam ufọfọb uwa ye uwa akpọñ unam ewuana, sia akpokoro uwa e-ekenamma ke brọns ikikanna adidọñọ ufọfọb uwa, uwa ñkpasi ye mme uwa akpọñ unam ewuana.<verse eid="2CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 7:8" />Ntoro ke Sọlọmọn akenam usọrọ ke ini ado ke usen itiaba, ndin afịd Isrel ekeba ye anye, ataa ekamba esob, mme awo emaeto ke Lebo Hamad tutu asịm ke Wadi ke Iyib edi. <verse eid="2CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 7:9" />Ke ayọhọ usen itiaita ammọ emaenịm esob, sia ammọ emaedia usọrọ adidiọñ akpokoro uwa ke usen itiaba enyʌñ enam usọrọ ke usen itiaba mfen. <verse eid="2CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 7:10" />Ke ayọhọ usen edịb mme ita ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba anye amaanam mme awo enyọñọ ufọk ammọ, edaara enyʌñ enem esịd ke mme nti ñkpọ ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenamma anọ Defid ye Sọlọmọn ye mbon amọ Isrel.<verse eid="2CH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abiọññọ Anọ Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 7:11" />Ke Sọlọmọn amaakekweeñe tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ufọkadidem, akenyʌñ anam afịd se anye akenie ke akikere amọ adinam ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mfọn-mfọn ye ke ufọkadidem amọ, <verse eid="2CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 7:12" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayaara idem awọt Sọlọmọn ke akonayio amaanyʌñ abo:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 7:12">“Ami mmekop akam mfo ndin mmenyʌñ mmek itie ami nnọ idem mmi nte tembịd se ekama enam mme uwa.<verse eid="2CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 7:13" />“Ke ini ami mmaasiit mme hefịn nọ edịm imiideppe, me ndọñ mme ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ nọ ata isọñ me ndọñ idiọọk udọñọ ke atu mbon mmi, <verse eid="2CH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 7:14" />adieke mbon mmi, e-ekoodo edian anyịñ mmi, ediisuuhọ idem ammọ enyʌñ ebọñ akam enyʌñ eyem iso mmi enyʌñ ediañña idem ekpọñ mme usʌñ ibak ammọ, ndin ami ñyaatie ke hefịn ñkop, ñyaanyʌñ mfeen idiọọkñkpọ ammọ ñnyʌñ ñkọk udọñọ ke isọñ ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 7:15" />Ke ami, anyen mmi ayaatara ñnyʌñ ñkpañutọñ mmi nnọ mme akam se ebọñ ke itie ami. <verse eid="2CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 7:16" />Ami mmemek ñnyʌñ nsio tembịd ami nnịm asaña-asaña ndiọñ nọ ato do Anyịñ mmi aba do ke nsi-nsi. Anyen mmi ye esịd mmi ediiba do ke afịd ini.<verse eid="2CH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 7:17" />“Amaado afo, adieke afo asañake ke iso mmi ke akpanikọ naña Defid ete mfo akesaña, anyʌñ anam afịd se ami utemme, anyʌñ anịm mme ewʌhọ ye mbed mmi, <verse eid="2CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 7:18" />ami ñyaanam ebekpo ubọọñ mfo asọọñọ ada, kpa naña ñkedioomo ye Defid ete mfo ke ini ami ñkebooho, ‘Afo uduunanake awo ake adiidat itie mfo ke adikara Isrel.’<verse eid="2CH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 7:19" />“Ado adieke afo awọññọke akpọñ anyʌñ asịn mme ewʌhọ ye mme item ake ami unọọhọ fiin anyʌñ awuọ akenam ñkpọ anọ mme abasi mfen anyʌñ akpono ammọ, <verse eid="2CH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 7:20" />ami ñyaawịppe Isrel nsio ke isọñ ake ami nnọọhọ ammọ, ñnyʌñ nsịn tembịd ake ami nnịmme asaña-asaña nnọ Anyịñ mmi. Ñyaanam anye akappa ado ñkpọ ufiid ye ñkpọ ndọk ke atu afịd mbon awo. <verse eid="2CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 7:21" />Tembịd ami ayaakappa ado itoon mbio. Afịd awo se isaña iboiyo eyaedịkke enyʌñ ebo, ‘Nsoo ñkpọ inam yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam utọ ñkpọ ami ke isọñ ami ye ke tembịd ami?’ <verse eid="2CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 7:22" />Mbon awo eyaebọọrọ, ‘Sia ammọ ewọññọ ekpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ, a-akesioho ammọ ato Iyib, enyʌñ efat mme abasi mfen, ekpono enyʌñ enam ñkpọ enọ ammọ; ami ado ntak ake anye abenne afịd ukuud ami adoot ammọ ke idem.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 7:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CH 8" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Ñkpọ Mfen se Sọlọmọn Akenam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 8:1" />Ke utịd isua edịb, idaha Sọlọmọn akedatta abọp tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ufọkadidem amọ, <verse eid="2CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 8:2" />Sọlọmọn amaamaana abọp mme idʌñ ake Hiram akenọọhọ anye, anyʌñ anam mbon Isrel ekedʌñọ ke ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 8:3" />Akem Sọlọmọn amaadakka akaa Hamad Soba anyʌñ akeben anye adat. <verse eid="2CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 8:4" />Anye amaanyʌñ abọp Tadmọọ ke akpautatan ye afịd mme abio unịm ñkpọ a-anye akebọppọ ke Hamad. <verse eid="2CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 8:5" />Anye amaamaana abọp Adoro Bed Họrọn ye Usuuk Bed Họrọn nte ñkpọsọñ abio, ye ndibene ye inuaatob ye mme ñkpahausʌñ, <verse eid="2CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 8:6" />ñko ke Baalad ye afịd mme abio ubonoñkpọ Sọlọmọn, ye afịd mme abio ake mme sariọd ye mme enañmbakara amọ, se adodo ake anye akpekeyemme adibọp ke Yeruselem, ke Lebanọn ye ke afịd itie se anye akekara.<verse eid="2CH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 8:7" />Akesʌk ababa mbon awo ekesʌhọke ke atu mbon Hed, mbon Amọọ, mbon Peris mbon Hif, ye mbon Yebus (mbon ami ikidoññoke mbon Isrel). <verse eid="2CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 8:8" />Sọlọmọn amaanyịk anyʌñ akoono mme ubon afịd mbon ekesʌhọke ke isọñ ake mbon Isrel imiikikanna isobo ima nọ enam utom enọ ammọ nte ifʌn mbon utom, kpa naña asʌk aba tutu adiwuọ mfịn. <verse eid="2CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 8:9" />Ado Sọlọmọn ikidatta mbon Isrel nte ifʌn nọ enam utom amọ; ammọ ekedoñño mme anwana ekọñ, mme etubom ukpeme amọ, ye mme etubom ukpeme mme sariọd ye mme andiwad mme sariọd. <verse eid="2CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 8:10" />Ñko ammọ ekedoñño mme ikpọ mbọọñ enọ Adidem Sọlọmọn, mme adaaha ikie iba mme aba mme duob (250) eseeghe ñkpọ ebaña mbon utom.<verse eid="2CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 8:11" />Sọlọmọn amaaben ayịn Fero awonwaan ato ke Abio Defid adi ke ufọkadidem a-anye akebọppọ anọ anye akpọ-akpọ, sia anye akebo, “Anwaan mmi inaaha adʌñ ke ufọkadidem ake Defid adidem Isrel, sia mme itie ake akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adʌkkọ edoñño adisana.”<verse eid="2CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 8:12" />Ke akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-anye akebọppọ ke iso atekke, Sọlọmọn amaawa ufọfọb uwa anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <verse eid="2CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 8:13" />naña asaña akekem ye mme ubonoñkpọ mme usen unam uwa kpa naña ewʌhọ Moses aketemme abaña Sabad, mme Ufa Afiọñ ye mme usọrọ ita ke isua e-edooho: Usọrọ Uyo ake yiis imiisịneke, Usọrọ mme Udua ye Usọrọ mme Tabanakịd. <verse eid="2CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 8:14" />Ke adikeene ido ake ete amọ Defid akenịmme, anye amaamek mme ikpeghe mme aku anọ ammọ mme utom, ndin mme Lifai nọ edat usʌñ ke itooro enyʌñ enwam mme aku nte asañake akekem ke mme utom usen keedekeed. Anye amaanyʌñ amek mme akpeme inuaatob ke mme ikpeghe anọ nsio-nsio inuaatob, sia ami ado se Defid awo Abasi aketemme. <verse eid="2CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 8:15" />Ammọ ikikpọññọ item ake adidem akenọọhọ mme aku me akenọọhọ mme Lifai ke ñkpọ akeedodo, kpa ye anye a-akebañake mme itie unịm ñkpọuto.<verse eid="2CH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 8:16" />Emaenam afịd utom Sọlọmọn, tọọñọ ke usen ekesịnne itiad idakisọñ ake tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> tutu ekweeñe.<verse eid="2CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 8:17" />Akema Sọlọmọn amaakaa Esiọn Keba ye Elad ke esʌk Edọm. <verse eid="2CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 8:18" />Ndin Hiram amaanọ mme nsʌñikañ ake mbon amọ ekedooho mme adaiwuod esọk anye, mme awadinyañ ekediọọñọke akpa. Mbon ami, ye mbon Sọlọmọn, emaewat ekaa Ọfia enyʌñ ekeben talen kold ikie inaañ mme aba mme duob (450)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 17 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 15</char></note> enyọñ edi, a-ammọ ekeyaaha enọ adidem Sọlọmọn.<verse eid="2CH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Abọọñanwaan Seba Adise Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 9:1" />Ke ini akwa abọọñanwaan Seba akekoppo etob abaña Sọlọmọn, anye amaadi Yeruselem adidomo Sọlọmọn idomo ye ñkpọsọñ mbuume. Ke anye adisịmme ye ataa uwak udịm mbonisañ, ye mme kamel e-ebiommo mme anemufịk mfiọññọ, uwak ibad kold, ye mme nsọñudua itiad; anye amaadi abịne Sọlọmọn anyʌñ adineme ye anye abaña afịd se ikisịne anye ke esịd. <verse eid="2CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 9:2" />Sọlọmọn amaabọọrọ afịd mbuume amọ; ibaaha se ikisọñ ikan anye adinam nọ anwaña anye. <verse eid="2CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 9:3" />Ke ini akwa abọọñanwaan Seba akekịtte aniọñ Sọlọmọn, akọrọ ye ufọkadidem a-anye akebọppọ, <verse eid="2CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 9:4" />ndidia ke akpokoro amọ, naña mme adaaha amọ etie, mme nditọufọk ye mme nsiine ammọ, mbon ukama kọọb ye mme nsiine ammọ ye mme ufọfọb uwa ake anye akenamma ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, idem amaakpa anye ataa eti-eti.<verse eid="2CH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 9:5" />Anye amaabo adidem, “Mbʌk a-ami ñkekoppo ke idʌñ mmi mbaña mme ñkpọ se afo anam ye aniọñ a-afo anieghe ado akpanikọ. <verse eid="2CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 9:6" />Ado ami ñkinịmme se ammọ eketañ tutu ami ndi ndikịt ke anyen mmi. Ke adinekke ntañ, awo ikindọkkọke kpak mbakka iba naña aniọñ mfo akpon; amenekke aka anyan akpọñ mbʌk ake ami ñkekoppo. <verse eid="2CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 9:7" />Ana ado mbon mfo enekke ekop ataa inemesịd! Mme adaaha mfo, e-edaaha ke iso mfo afịd ini enyʌñ ekop aniọñ mfo, e-ekop ataa inemesịd! <verse eid="2CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 9:8" />Itooro anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo, ake anemme esịd ye afo anyʌñ unịm fiin ke ebekpo amọ nte adidem adikara nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo. Ke ntak ima a-Abasi mfo anieghe anọ Isrel ye uduak amọ adimʌm ammọ ñkama ke nsi-nsi, anye anam afo ado adidem anọ ammọ, nọ afo anam unen ye adinenido esọọñọ eda.”<verse eid="2CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 9:9" />Akem anye amaanọ adidem talen kold 120 (ikie keed mme edịb)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 4 1/2 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 4</char></note>, ataa uwak anemufịk mfiọññọ, ye mme nsọñudua itiad. Kpaanaanam ikibaaha utọ mme anemufịk mfiọññọ e-ebaaha nte mbon ake akwa abọọñanwaan Seba akenọọhọ adidem Sọlọmọn.<verse eid="2CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 9:10" />(Nditọufọk Hiram ye nditọufọk Sọlọmọn emaeben kold eto Ọfia edi; ammọ emaenyʌñ eben eto alkọm ye mme nsọñudua itiad edi. <verse eid="2CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 9:11" />Adidem amaadat mme eto alkọm anam mme usaña ndọọk ufọk ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ke ufọkadidem, anyʌñ adat anam mme ekpa ye mme ndidoudʌk anọ mbon ikwọ. Kpaanaanam utọ mme eto alkọm ado, awo ikikịtte ke Yuda.)<verse eid="2CH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 9:12" />Adidem Sọlọmọn amaanọ abọọñanwaan Seba afịd udọñ esịd amọ ye se anye akebeeñe; Adidem Sọlọmọn amaanọ anye ñkpọ se iwak ikan se anye akedinọ adidem. Akem anye amaakpọñ anyʌñ atịmme edem ye udịm amọ anyọñ abio amọ.<verse eid="2CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inie Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 9:13" />Udob kold se Sọlọmọn akebọọ kwa isua akedo talen ikie itiokeed mme ata mme itiokeed (666)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 25 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 23</char></note>, <verse eid="2CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 9:14" />isịneke akʌk se mme mbon mbịn ye mme anyamudua ekeben edi. Ñko afịd mme ndidem Arebia ye mme adaukara mme idịd emaeben kold ye silfa esọk Sọlọmọn.<verse eid="2CH 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 9:15" />Adidem Sọlọmọn amaanam ikpọ atuekọñ ikie iba ekedatta kold enam; ekekama sekel kold ikie itiokeed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 6.9</char></note> enam atuekọñ keed. <verse eid="2CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 9:16" />Anye amaanyʌñ anam ntək-ntək atuekọñ ikie ita kpa ke umemịñ kold, ekekama sekel kold ikie ita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 3.5</char></note> enam atuekọñ keed. Adidem amaabono ammọ ke Ufọkadidem ake Akai Lebanọn.<verse eid="2CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 9:17" />Ndin adidem amaadat nnʌkeniin anam ekamba ebekpo anyʌñ adat ataa eti kold afʌk anye. <verse eid="2CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 9:18" />Ebekpo akenie ikpeghe usaña ndọọk itiokeed, ndin amaanam udodukod kold ayịd. Ke edem iba ñkpọitie udodubọk amaaba, ekpe anyʌñ ada ke ñkañ ammọ keedekeed. <verse eid="2CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 9:19" />Ekpe duob mme iba emaeda ke mme utọukod ado, keed ke iwuod utọukod keedekeed. Akenaanam awo ikinamma utọ ado ke abio adidem ubọọñ ndomokeed mfen. <verse eid="2CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 9:20" />Afịd iko unwọññkpọ Adidem Sọlọmọn ekedoñño ataa adeghe kold, ñko afịd ñkpọ ufọk ke Ufọkadidem ke Akai Lebanọn ekedoñño ataa adeghe kold. Awo ikikamake silfa inam ñkpọ ndomokeed, sia ekedat silfa nte ñkpọ i-imiinekkeke inieghe ufọn ke ayio Sọlọmọn. <verse eid="2CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 9:21" />Adidem amaanie mme ikpọ ubom unyam udua ake Taasis ake nditọufọk Hiram ekedaaha iso. Akañ keed ke isua ita ke anye akesitịmme anyọñ adi, akoono kold, silfa ye nnʌkeniin, ye mme amọnidiọk ye mme ikpọkebọk.<verse eid="2CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 9:22" />Adidem Sọlọmọn amaamọinyọ ke inie ye ke aniọñ akan afịd mme ndidem mfen ke ederimbod. <verse eid="2CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 9:23" />Afịd mme ndidem ke ekondo emaeyem ediba ke iso Sọlọmọn nọ ekop aniọñ ake Abasi akesịnne anye ke esịd. <verse eid="2CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 9:24" />Isua ke isua, afịd awo se ikidi emaedat enọ edi, ñkpọ silfa ye kold, mme usesịne ñkpọ, mme ñkpọ ekọñ ye anem ufịk ufọfiọññọ ñkpọ, mme enañmbakara ye mme ñwaahadọñki.<verse eid="2CH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 9:25" />Sọlọmọn amaanie abaenañ tọsịn inaañ anọ enañmbakara ye sariọd, ye enañmbakara tọsịn duob mme iba, ake adidem akebonno ke mme abio sariọd ye ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 9:26" />Anye amaakara afịd mme ndidem tọọñọ ke Inyañ Yufretis tutu akesịm ke isọñ Filistia, anyʌñ aboiyo asịm adaña Iyib. <verse eid="2CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 9:27" />Adidem amaanam silfa awak ke Yeruselem nte ñkaña itiad, ndin eto sida amaawak nte mme eto fik-sikamọ ke mme mben abod. <verse eid="2CH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 9:28" />Eketobo mme enañmbakara Sọlọmọn eto Iyib ye ke afịd mme idịd mfen.<verse eid="2CH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 9:29" />Amaado mme edinam mfen ke ini ukara Sọlọmọn, tọọñọ ke ntọọñọ tutu asịm akpatre, nte awo iwette ammọ isịn ke mme ñwed prọfed Natan, ke ikọ prọfesi Ahiya awo Silo ye ke mme ñkukịd Iddo akịdñkukịd ke abaña Yerobuam ayịn Nebad? <verse eid="2CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 9:30" />Sọlọmọn amaatie ke Yeruselem akara ke afịd Isrel ke isua aba. <verse eid="2CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 9:31" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke abio Defid ete amọ. Ndin Rehoboam ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2CH 9:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CH 10" />
  <para style="s1">Isrel Asọñ Iwuod ye Rehoboam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 10:1" />Rehoboam amaakaa Sekem, sia afịd Isrel emaekaa do adinam anye adidem. <verse eid="2CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 10:2" />Yerobuam ayịn Nebad akekop ñkpọ ami (anye akeba ke Iyib, itie anye akefegheke akpọñ iso Adidem Sọlọmọn aka), anye amaato Iyib adi. <verse eid="2CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 10:3" />Ndin ammọ emaedọñ ekoot Yerobuam, ndin anye ye afịd Isrel emaekaa ebịne Rehoboam enyʌñ ekebo anye: <verse eid="2CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 10:4" />“Ete mfo amainọ ñnyịn ndodoppo mbiomo, ado idahami nam nsaad utom ye ndodoppo akpọnọ ake anye akinọọhọ ñnyịn afeere, ndin ñnyịn iyainam ñkpọ unọ fiin.”<verse eid="2CH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 10:5" />Rehoboam amaabọọrọ, “Ikaa, ndin itịmme idi imbịne miin ke ayọhọ usen ita.” Ndin mbon ado emaenyọñọ.<verse eid="2CH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 10:6" />Ndin Adidem Rehoboam amaakekọọk iwuod ye mme ñkpisọñ e-ekenamma utom enọ ete amọ Sọlọmọn ke ayio uwem amọ. Anye amaabịp, “Nsoo item ke ndufo ekpennọọ miin nọ mbọọrọ ibon ami?”<verse eid="2CH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 10:7" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Adieke afo uduufọn ido ye ibon ami anyʌñ anam ñkpọ se inem ammọ esịd anyʌñ anọ ammọ ibọọrọ a-afọnnọ, ammọ eyaedo mbon mfo ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="2CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 10:8" />Ado Rehoboam amaasịn item ake mme ñkpisọñ ekenọọhọ anye ndin anye amaakesoobo ye mme iwaad e-ekedooho ñka ye anye ekenyʌññọ enam ñkpọ enọ anye. <verse eid="2CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 10:9" />Anye amaabịp ammọ, “Nsoo ido item ndufo? Ñnyịn idiibọọrọ die ibon ami embooho miin, ‘Nam mbiomo ake ete mfo akinọọhọ ñnyịn afeere’?”<verse eid="2CH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 10:10" />Mme iwaad e-ekedoññoke ubọkñka ye anye emaebọọrọ, “Ibon ami edubo fiin, ‘Ete mfo amainọ ñnyịn ndodoppo mbiomo, ado nam mbiomo ñnyịn afeere.’ Idahami dọkkọ ammọ bo, ‘Etək nnuunubọk mmi akpon akan itakisịn ete mmi. <verse eid="2CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 10:11" />Ete mmi amaikọọñ ndufo ndodoppo akpọnọ; ami ñyaanam anye anenekke adoppo. Ete mmi akimia ndufo ke ikpa; ami ndiimia ndufo ke ikpeyen.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 10:12" />Usen ita akeboiyo Yerobuam ye afịd mbon awo emaetịmme ebịne Rehoboam, kpa naña adidem akebo, “Itịmme idi ke ayọhọ usen ita.” <verse eid="2CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 10:13" />Adidem Rehoboam amaabọọrọ ammọ ke iyadesịd. Asịn item mme ñkpisọñ ekenọọhọ anye, <verse eid="2CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 10:14" />anye amaadat item ake mme iwaad ekenọọhọ anye ndin amaabo, “Ete mmi amaanam akpọnọ ndufo adoppo; ami ñyaanam adoppo akan ado. Ete mmi akekama ikpa imia ndufo; ami ndiimia ndufo ke ikpeyen.” <verse eid="2CH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 10:15" />Ndin adidem ikikpañña utọñ inọ mbon awo, sia adinam ami aketo ubonoñkpọ Abasi, nọ uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ Yerobuam ayịn Nebad ato Ahiya awo Silo asu.<verse eid="2CH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 10:16" />Ndin afịd Isrel ekekịt ke adidem asịn adikpañ utọñ inọọ mmimọ, ammọ emaebọọrọ adidem:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">“Nsoo udeeme ke ñnyịn inie ye Defid,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 10:16">nsoo ubaak ke ayịn Yesi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">Inyọñọ mme atayad ndufo, Isrel!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 10:16">Se ñkpọ baña ufọk mfo, Defid!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CH 10:16">Ndin afịd mbon Isrel emaenyọñọ ufọk. <verse eid="2CH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 10:17" />Ado amaado mbon Isrel e-ekedʌññọ ke mme abio Yuda, Rehoboam akesʌk akakara ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 10:18" />Adidem Rehoboam amaadọñ Adọniram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru Hadọram asʌk ado Adọniram</char></note>, a-akedooho aseñkpọ mbaña unyenyịk utom, ado mbon Isrel emaetọọñ anye ke itiad ewot. Ado Adidem Rehoboam amaanwana akedʌk sariọd amọ abọkkọ anyọñ Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 10:19" />Ke ntoro ke Isrel asʌk ababa ke nsọñiwuod ye ufọk Defid tutu usen mfịn.<verse eid="2CH 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CH 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 11:1" />Ke ini Rehoboam akedisịmme Yeruselem, anye amaakoot Yuda ye ekpək Benyamin mme uko ñkparawa tọsịn ikie mme anaañ (180,000) edika ekọñ ye Isrel nọ emaana ebọ abioubọọñ enọ Rehoboam.<verse eid="2CH 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 11:2" />Ado ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadi abịne Semaiya awo Abasi: <verse eid="2CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 11:3" />“Dọkkọ Rehoboam ayịn Sọlọmọn adidem Yuda ye afịd mbon Isrel ke Yuda ye Benyamin, <verse eid="2CH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 11:4" />‘Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ: Kuukaa ukunwana ye nditọ ete ndufo mbon Isrel. Inyọñọ ufọk, afịd ndufo, sia ami ado ubọkutom mmi.’ ” Ke ntoro ammọ emaesuuk iwuod enọ ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ etịmme edem ke edika ñkenwana ye Yerobuam.<verse eid="2CH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rehoboam Asịn Akọ Akanna Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 11:5" />Rehoboam amaadʌñ ke Yeruselem anyʌñ abọp mme abio ndibene ke Yuda: <verse eid="2CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 11:6" />Betlehem, Etam, Tekoa, <verse eid="2CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 11:7" />Bed Sọọ, Soko, Adulam, <verse eid="2CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 11:8" />Kad, Maresa, Siif, <verse eid="2CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 11:9" />Adọraim, Lakis, Aseka, <verse eid="2CH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 11:10" />Sora, Aiyalọn, ye Hibrọn. Mbon ami ekedo mme abio se ekesịn akọ ekanna ke Yuda ye Benyamin. <verse eid="2CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 11:11" />Anye amaanam mme ndibene ammọ edoñño ñkpọsọñ anyʌñ anịm mme adaiwuod ke ammọ, ye ke adinọ ndidia, adan ọlif ye mmịn. <verse eid="2CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 11:12" />Anye amaaboon mme atuekọñ ye mme eduad ke afịd mme abio, anyʌñ anam ammọ edo ataa ñkpọsọñ. Ke ntoro Yuda ye Benyamin ekedoñño ake ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 11:13" />Mme aku ye mme Lifai ke afịd mme ikpeghe ammọ ke afịd Isrel eda ye anye. <verse eid="2CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 11:14" />Mme Lifai emaekpọñ mme abio ammọ ye udeeme isọñ enyʌñ edika Yuda ye Yeruselem, sia Yerobuam ye nditọ ideen amọ emaesịn ammọ adido mme aku nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> <verse eid="2CH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 11:15" />ke ini anye akemekke mme aku amọ aboon ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ye ke ubobod ebod ye ñyịn enañ ake anye akenamma. <verse eid="2CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 11:16" />Mbon e-eketooho afịd esiin Isrel e-ekenịmme esịd ammọ ke adiyem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, emaekeene mme Lifai ekaa Yeruselem ekewa uwa enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 11:17" />Ammọ emaenam abio adidem ke Yuda ado akpọsọñ enyʌñ eda ye Rehoboam ayịn Sọlọmọn ke isua ita, ekeene usʌñ Defid ye Sọlọmọn ke ini ami.<verse eid="2CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekpək Rehoboam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 11:18" />Rehoboam akedọ Mahalad, a-akedooho ayịn awonwaan Yerimọd ayịn Defid ye ake Abihel, ayịn awonwaan Eliab ayịn Yesi. <verse eid="2CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 11:19" />Anye amaaman nditọ ideen anọ anye: Yeus, Semaria ye Saham. <verse eid="2CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 11:20" />Akem anye amaadọ Maaka ayịn awonwaan Absalọm, a-akemanna Abiya, Atai, Sisa ye Selomid anọ anye. <verse eid="2CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 11:21" />Rehoboam amaama Maaka ayịn Absalọm akan ibaan ndọ amọ mfen ye ibaan esa amọ. Ke afịd, anye akedọ ibaan duob mme itiaita anyʌñ anie ibaan esa ata, nditọ ideen edịb mme itiaita ye nditọ ibaan ata.<verse eid="2CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 11:22" />Rehoboam amaamek Abiya ayịn Maaka nte akpan ubọọñ ke atu nditọ ete amọ, nọ anam anye adidem. <verse eid="2CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 11:23" />Anye akenam ye aniọñ, asuan nditọ ideen amọ adọñ ke afịd ikpeghe adaña ke Yuda ye Benyamin, ye ke afịd ñkpọsọñ abio. Anye amaanọ ammọ uwak ndidia anyʌñ adọ mme ibaan anọ ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Sisak Adi Ekọñ ye Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 12:1" />Ke ini emaekesọọñọ itie Rehoboam nte adidem ndin anye amaanyʌñ akappa ado akpọsọñ, anye ye afịd mbon Isrel emaekpọñ mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 12:2" />Sia ammọ ikinamma akpanikọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Sisak adidem Iyib amaanwana ekọñ ye Yeruselem ke ayọhọ isua ition ke ukara adidem Rehoboam. <verse eid="2CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 12:3" />Ye sariọd ikie duob mme iba (1,200) ye mme awad enañmbakara tọsịn ata (60,000) ye ananaibad mbon ekọñ Libia, Sukim ye mbon Kuus ekedieghe ye anye eto Iyib, <verse eid="2CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 12:4" />anye amaadat mme ñkpọsọñ abio ke Yuda anyʌñ adi tutu awuọ Yeruselem.<verse eid="2CH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 12:5" />Akem prọfed Semaiya amaadi abịne Rehoboam ye mme adadusʌñ ke Yuda ekesooboke ke Yeruselem, ke ntak ndịk Sisak akenamma ammọ, ndin anye amaabo ammọ, “Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ‘Ndufo emaeñkpọñ miin; ke ntoro, ami mme isịn ndufo idahami ñyaak nnọ Sisak.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 12:6" />Mme adaiwuod ke Isrel ye adidem emaesuuhọ idem ammọ enyʌñ ebo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado adinen.”<verse eid="2CH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 12:7" />Ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakekịt ke ammọ emaesuuhọ idem ammọ, ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ami amaadi abịne Semaiya: “Sia ammọ emaekesuuhọ idem ammọ, ami ndiisoboke ammọ ado ñyaasọp nnọ ammọ adinyaaña. Mbooho nduọk iyadesịd mmi ndot Yeruselem ato Sisak. <verse eid="2CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 12:8" />Ammọ, eyaekappa edo ifʌn enọ anye, nọ ato do ammọ ekịt ukpʌhọde a-abaaha ke adinam ñkpọ innọọ miin ye adinam ñkpọ nnọọ mme ndidem abio mfen.”<verse eid="2CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 12:9" />Ke ini Sisak adidem Iyib akenwanake ekọñ ye Yeruselem, anye amaabiom mme ñkpọuto ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asioño ye mme ñkpọuto ke ufọkadidem. Anye amaakoono afịd ñkpọ, tutu awuọ mme atuekọñ kold ake Sọlọmọn akenaññake. <verse eid="2CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 12:10" />Ke ntak ado, Adidem Rehoboam amaanam mme atuekọñ ke akpoho nọ edat itie mbon ekekoonoke do anyʌñ abakka ammọ anọ mme adaiso mbon ukpeme ekebaaha ke utom ke inuaatob ufọkadidem. <verse eid="2CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 12:11" />Ini akeedodo adidem akekaaha tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, mme mbon ukpeme emaekama mme atuekọñ, ndin ekoono ammọ ekebono ke ufọk ukpeme ke emaekema.<verse eid="2CH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 12:12" />Sia Rehoboam amaasuuhọ idem amọ, iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawọññọ akpọñ anye, ndin ikisoboke anye afịd-afịd. Ke aditịm ntañ, usʌk nti ñkpọ emaeba ke Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 12:13" />Adidem Rehoboam amaasọọñọ itie amọ mfọn-mfọn ke Yeruselem anyʌñ akaiso nte adidem. Anye akedo isua aba mme keed idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara isua duob mme itiaba ke Yeruselem, abio ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akemekke asio ke atu mme esiin Isrel nọ anịm Anyịñ Amọ. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Naama; anye akedo awonwaan Amọn. <verse eid="2CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 12:14" />Anye amaanam idiọọk sia anye ikinịmme esịd amọ ke adiyem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="2CH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 12:15" />Amaado mme edinam ke ukara Rehoboam, tọọñọ ke ntọọñọ tutu asịm utịd, ado nte awo iwette ammọ isịn ke mme ñwed prọfed Semaiya ye ake Iddo akịdñkukịd a-aseeghe ñkpọ abaña mme mbʌk emana? Ekọñ akekaaka iso aba ke ufọọd Rehoboam ye Yerobuam. <verse eid="2CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 12:16" />Rehoboam amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ ndin emaebuuk anye ke Abio Defid. Ndin Abiya ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2CH 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Abiya Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 13:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua duob mme itiaita ke ukara Yerobuam, Abiya amaakappa ado adidem ke Yuda, <verse eid="2CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 13:2" />anye amaanyʌñ akara ke Yeruselem ke isua ita. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Maaka, ayịn awonwaan Uriel ke Kibia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 13:2">Ekọñ amaaba ke ufọọd Abiya ye Yerobuam. <verse eid="2CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 13:3" />Abiya amaakama mme akobidem ideen tọsịn ikie inaañ (400,000) akaa ekọñ, ndin Yerobuam amaakama mme akobidem udịmekọñ tọsịn ikie itiaita (800,000) anwana ekọñ ye anye.<verse eid="2CH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 13:4" />Abiya akeda ke Abod Semaraim, ke abod abio Ifrem, anyʌñ abo, “Yerobuam ye afịd Isrel, ikpañ utọñ innọ miin! <verse eid="2CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 13:5" />Nte ndufo idiọọñọke ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, amaaben itie adidem Isrel anọ Defid ye ubon amọ ke nsi-nsi ke edioomo inʌñ? <verse eid="2CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 13:6" />Ado Yerobuam ayịn Nebad, adaaha Sọlọmọn ayịn Defid, amaasọñ iwuod ye eteufọk amọ. <verse eid="2CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 13:7" />Usʌk abʌd-abʌd awo emaesoobo itie keed ekanna anye enyʌñ enam ikọ ye Rehoboam ayịn Sọlọmọn idaha anye akedooho etəkayịn anana ubiere inyʌññọ inie adudu ikem adinwana ye ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 13:8" />“Ndin idahami ndufo ekere edinwana ye abio adidem ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-asịneke ke ubọk ubon Defid. Ndufo emenie ekamba udịmekọñ enyʌñ enie mme ubobod ñyịn enañ kold ake Yerobuam akenamma nte mme abasi ndufo. <verse eid="2CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 13:9" />Ado nte ndufo ikibịneke mme aku <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nditọ ideen Erọn, ye mme Lifai, isioño, ndin enam mme aku enọ idem ndufo naña mbon idʌñ mfen enam? Awo akeedodo a-adiighe adinam idem amọ asana ke ñyịn ayaaraenañ ye akukịmedọñ itiaba akeme adikappa ndo aku nnọọ se imiidooho mme abasi.<verse eid="2CH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 13:10" />“Ama ado ñnyịn, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado Abasi ñnyịn, ndin ñnyịn ikpọññọ anye. Mme aku e-enamma ñkpọ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> edoñño nditọ ideen Erọn, ndin mme Lifai esinọ ammọ unwam. <verse eid="2CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 13:11" />Afịd ubakusen ye ndubiayio ammọ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ufọfọb uwa ye anemufịk insensi. Ammọ esioño uyo edoot ke adisana akpokoro enyʌñ edomo utuenikañ edot ke uwuuk utuenikañ kold afịd ndubiayio. Ñnyịn iminịm se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ayem inam. Ado ndufo emesịn anye. <verse eid="2CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 13:12" />Abasi mmọdo aba ye ñnyịn; anye ado andidat ñnyịn usʌñ. Mme aku amọ ye mme adukpoñ ammọ eyaefịt ukood awo anwan ye ndufo. Mbon Isrel, ikiinwana ekọñ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ndufo, sia ndufo idiikịtte unen.”<verse eid="2CH 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 13:13" />Yerobuam amaadọñ mbon ekọñ ekanna ke edem, nọ ado ke ini anye adaaha ke iso Yuda mme andisịne ke ikọd emaeba ke edem ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 13:14" />Yuda amaakanna anyen ase anyʌñ akịt abo ke enwana ye mmimọ ke iso ye ke edem. Ammọ ndin emaesio ñkpo ebọñ ekoot <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Mme aku emaefịt adukpoñ ammọ <verse eid="2CH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 13:15" />mbon Yuda emaenyʌñ ekwaaha ñkpo ikọd ekọñ. Ke adibọñ ñkpo ikọd ekọñ ammọ, Abasi amaasuakka Yerobuam ye afịd Isrel ke iso Abiya ye Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 13:16" />Mbon Isrel emaefeeñe ke iso Yuda, Abasi amaanyʌñ ayaak ammọ asịn ke ubọk ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 13:17" />Abiya ye udịmekọñ amọ emaesịn ekamba nsobo ke atu ammọ, ke ntoro ñkpọsọñ awo tọsịn ikie ition (500,000) emaekpañña ke Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 13:18" />Ke adinam ado emaesuuhọ mbon Isrel, ndin mbon Yuda emaekan sia ammọ ekebuọt idem ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 13:19" />Abiya amaabịne Yerobuam anyʌñ abọ anye mme abio Beteel, Yesana ye Efrọn, ye mme ñkanñkʌk idʌñ ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 13:20" />Yerobuam ikikanna imaana ibọ ukara aba ke ini Abiya. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanyʌñ amia anye anịm ndin anye amaakpa.<verse eid="2CH 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 13:21" />Ado Abiya amaakaa iso akpon ke adudu. Anye akedọ ibaan duob mme inaañ anyʌñ anie nditọ ideen edịb mme iba ye nditọ ibaan duob mme itiokeed.<verse eid="2CH 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 13:22" />Mme adinam mfen ke ukara Abiya, se anye akenam ye se anye aketañ, edo se ewet ke mme mbʌk prọfed Iddo.<verse eid="2CH 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2CH 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">14: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru 2 Kr 14:1 ewet 2 Kr 13:23 ñko 2 Kr 14:2-15 ewet 2 Kr 14:1-14</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 14:1" />Ndin Abiya amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke Abio Defid. Asa ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem, ndin ke ayio amọ idịd amaanie emem ke isua duob.<verse eid="2CH 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asa Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 14:2" />Asa amaanam se ikifọn ye se ikido nnen-nnen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ. <verse eid="2CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 14:3" />Anye amaasịññe mme akpokoro uwa isen abasi ye mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie, aboom mme abai itiad anyʌñ akpok mme eto akpokoro uwa Asera. <verse eid="2CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 14:4" />Anye amaanọ Yuda ewʌhọ ate eyem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ, enyʌñ esuuk iwuod enọ mbed ye ewʌhọ amọ. <verse eid="2CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 14:5" />Anye amaasịññe mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ye mme akpokoro uwa insensi ke afịd abio ke Yuda, ndin abio adidem ke idak amọ amaaba ke emem. <verse eid="2CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 14:6" />Anye amaadiọñ mme ñkpọsọñ abio ke Yuda, sia isọñ amaaba ke emem. Ibaaha awo se ikinwana ekọñ ye anye ke mme isua ado, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ anye nduọkadudu.<verse eid="2CH 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 14:7" />Anye amaabo Yuda, “Yak ñnyịn ibọp mme abio ami, inyʌñ isịn mme ndibene ikanna ammọ, ye mme tọwa, inuaatob ye ñkpahausʌñ. Isọñ ami asʌk ado ake ñnyịn, sia ñnyịn imiyem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn; ñnyịn imaiyem anye ndin anye anyʌñ inọ ñnyịn nduọkadudu ke afịd usʌñ.” Ke ntoro ammọ emaebọp enyʌñ eforo.<verse eid="2CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 14:8" />Asa amaanie mbon ekọñ ekedooho awo tọsịn ikie ita (300,000) ke Yuda, emaetʌm ammọ idem ye ikpọ atuekọñ ye mme eduad, ye tọsịn ikie iba mme anaañ (280,000) ke Benyamin, ñkpọ ekọñ ammọ akedo ntək atu ekọñ ye mme utịgha. Afịd ami ekedo mme anie ukeme mbon unwana ekọñ. <verse eid="2CH 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 14:9" />Seera awo Kuus amaasịññe udịm ekọñ ke tọsịn (1,000) ke tọsịn (1,000) adinwana ye ammọ ye sariọd ikie ita (300), anyʌñ ato ko ke Maresa adi. <verse eid="2CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 14:10" />Asa amaawuọ akaa akesoobo ye anye, ndin ammọ emaedat itie ammọ ke iso ekọñ ke Abedeñ Sefata a-akpereke Maresa.<verse eid="2CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 14:11" />Akem Asa amaaseeme akoot <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ anyʌñ abo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ibaaha ake atie nte afo ke adinwam anana adudu mbaak anwana ye akpọsọñ, inwam ñnyịn, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn, sia mbuọdidem ñnyịn ado ke afo, ndin ke anyịñ mfo ñnyịn imidi adinwana ye akwa atu mbon ekọñ ami. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, afo ado Abasi ñnyịn; kuuyaak awo anwana ukan fiin.”<verse eid="2CH 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 14:12" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawot mme Kuus abono ke iso Asa ye Yuda. Mbon Kuus emaefeeñe, <verse eid="2CH 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 14:13" />ndin Asa ye Yuda emaebịne ammọ tutu ko ke Kera. Utọ ekamba ibad mbon Kuus se ikikpañña ke usen ado awo ikikanna aditịmme nnie; emaenuak ammọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye udịm ekọñ amọ. Mbon Yuda emaekoono ataa ekamba uwak mbịme enyọñọ. <verse eid="2CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 14:14" />Ammọ emaewuut afịd mme idʌñ ke ñkanna Kera, sia ndịk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaamʌm ammọ. Ammọ emaebịme mme ñkpọ ke afịd mme idʌñ ami, sia adooho uwak mbịme emaebañña do. <verse eid="2CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 14:15" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ esuan mme itie nnaa mme akpeme enañ enyʌñ ekoono mme udịm edọñ ye mme ebod ye mme kamel ewuọñọ. Akem ammọ emaetịmme enyọñọ ekaa Yeruselem.<verse eid="2CH 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2CH 15" />
  <para style="s1">Uneeñe Ñkpọ Mbono Asa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 15:1" />Sịbidịd Abasi amaadidoro Asaria ayịn Oded ke idem. <verse eid="2CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 15:2" />Anye amaawuọ akaa akesoobo ye Asa anyʌñ abo anye, “Kpañ utọñ nnọ miin, Asa ye afịd Yuda ye Benyamin. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ada ye ndufo ke ini ndufo edaaha ye anye. Adieke ndufo eyemme anye, ndufo eyaekịt anye, ado adieke ndufo esịnne anye, anye ayaisịn ndufo. <verse eid="2CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 15:3" />Sia ke anyan ini Isrel ikinieghe anam akpanikọ Abasi, inieghe aku se inọ item inyʌññọ inie mbed. <verse eid="2CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 15:4" />Ado ke ini mfịna ammọ emaetịmme ebịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, enyʌñ eyem anye, ndin ammọ emaekịt anye. <verse eid="2CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 15:5" />Ke mme usen ado ikifọnnọ awo adika isañ, sia afịd mme andidʌñ ke isọñ ekeba ke ekamba ndutịme. <verse eid="2CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 15:6" />Idịd keed amaadakka ada anwana ye mfen ndin abio keed ye mfen, sia Abasi akenam ammọ enie mme nsio-nsio mfịna. <verse eid="2CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 15:7" />Ado amaado ndufo, isọñ idem ikiinyʌñ iduọọk idodanyen, sia eyaebọ utịb utom ndufo.”<verse eid="2CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 15:8" />Ke ini Asa akekoppo mme ikọ ami ye prọfesi Asaria ayịn Oded a-akedooho prọfed, anye amaasọñ esịd. Anye amaasioño mme mbubiam abasi ubọk awo afep ke afịd isọñ Yuda ye ke Benyamin ye ke mme abio a-anye akebọọhọ ke mme abod Ifrem. Anye amaatịmme adiọñ akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-akebaaha ke nsakiso atekke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="2CH 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 15:9" />Akem anye amaabon esob afịd Yuda ye Benyamin ye mbon Ifrem, Manase ye Simiọn e-ekedʌññọ ke atu ammọ, sia ataa uwak emaeto ke Isrel edi ke ini ammọ ekekịtte ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ amaaba ye anye.<verse eid="2CH 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 15:10" />Ammọ ekebono ke Yeruselem ke ayọhọ afiọñ ita ke isua ukara Asa ayọhọ duob mme ition. <verse eid="2CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 15:11" />Ke ini ado ammọ emaewa iwuod enañ ikie itiaba (700) ye edọñ ye ebod tọsịn itiaba (7,000) eto ñkpọ mbịme ammọ ekebenne enyọñọ edi <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 15:12" />Ammọ emaedʌk edioomo adiyem iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ, ke afịd esịd ye ukpọñ ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 15:13" />Afịd mbon ake imiidiiyemme iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, eyaewot ammọ, me ado etək me ekamba, awodeen me awonwaan. <verse eid="2CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 15:14" />Ammọ emaeta unwọñọ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke uyio keed, ye ñkpo ye mme adukpoñ ye mme nnʌk. <verse eid="2CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 15:15" />Afịd Yuda emaedaara ebaña unwọñọ ado sia ammọ ekenwọñọke ke afịd esịd. Ammọ emaesịn itọñ eyem anye, ndin ammọ emaenyʌñ ekịt anye. Ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ ammọ nduọkadudu ke afịd usʌñ.<verse eid="2CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 15:16" />Adidem Asa amaadooro ekaeka amọ Maaka ke itie amọ nte eka abọọñ, sia anye amaabot mbubiam ñkpọ anọ edat ekpono ndem Asera. Asa amaakpịkke, aboom anye anyʌñ afọp anye ke Abedeñ Kidrọn. <verse eid="2CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 15:17" />Akpesʌkado anye imiikisịññeke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ke Isrel, esịd Asa amaasọọñọ ada ke adikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke afịd ayio uwem amọ. <verse eid="2CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 15:18" />Anye amaakoono mme silfa ye kold ye mme ñkpoduoho ufọk ake anye ye ete amọ ekediọññọ asaña-asaña ebono adidọñ ke tembịd Abasi.<verse eid="2CH 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 15:19" />Ekọñ ikibaaha aba tutu asịm isua ukara Asa ayọhọ edịb mme duob mme ition.<verse eid="2CH 15:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2CH 16" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Akpatre Isua Asa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 16:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme duob mme itiokeed ke ukara Asa, Baasa adidem Isrel amaadakka adọọk akaa anwan ye Yuda amaanyʌñ asọọñọ Rama adaaha mbaak awo ndomokeed adiwọwuọ me adidọdʌk isọñ Asa adidem Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 16:2" />Asa ndin amaakekoono silfa ye kold asịññe ke itie unịm ñkpọ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ke ufọkadidem amọ anọ esọk Ben-Hadad adidem Aram, a-akekarake ke Damaskọs. <verse eid="2CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 16:3" />Anye amaabo, “Yak edioomo aba ke ufọọd mmi ye afo,” “kpa naña akeba ke ufọọd ete mmi ye ete mfo. Se, ami mmenọ silfa ye kold usọk. Idahami biat edioomo mfo ye Baasa adidem Isrel nọ anye asịññe idem añkpọñ miin.”<verse eid="2CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 16:4" />Ben-Hadad amaanyịmme ye adidem Asa anyʌñ anọ mme adaiso ekọñ amọ ekenwana ye mme abio ke Isrel. Ammọ emaekan Iyon, Daan, Ebeel Maim ye afịd mme abio unịmñkpọ ke Naftali. <verse eid="2CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 16:5" />Ke ini Baasa akekoppo ami, anye amaatre adibọp Rama anyʌñ adakka akpọñ utom amọ. <verse eid="2CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 16:6" />Akem Adidem Asa amaakoono afịd ideen Yuda adi, ndin ammọ emaetañ mme itiad ye adukpọk ake Baasa akesidatta anam ñkpọ esịññe ke Rama. Anye amaadat mme ñkpọ ado abọp Keba ye Mispa.<verse eid="2CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 16:7" />Ke ini ado Hanani akịdñkukịd amaadi abịne Asa adidem Yuda anyʌñ abo anye: “Sia afo akenieghe mbuọdidem ke adidem Aram idooho ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo, mbon ekọñ ake adidem ke Aram emaebọkkọ ewuọ ekpọñ ubọk mfo. <verse eid="2CH 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 16:8" />Nte mbon Kuus ye mbon Libia ikinieghe ñkpọsọñ mbon ekọñ ye uwak ibad mme sariọd ye mme awad enañmbakara? Ado ke ini afo akebuọttọ idem ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye amaayaak ammọ usịn fiin ke ubọk. <verse eid="2CH 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 16:9" />Sia anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asañake ke afịd ederimbod adisọọñ esịd mbon e-eketuakka eda ayọhọ-ayọhọ ye anye. Afo amaanam ndisịme ñkpọ, ndin tọọñọ ke idahami kaa iso afo uduuba ke ekọñ.”<verse eid="2CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 16:10" />Asa amaayat esịd ye akịdñkukịd ami; anye amaakpakka esịd tutu asịn anye ke ñkpakọb. Ke ukem ini ado Asa amaatʌkkọ usʌk mbon awo.<verse eid="2CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 16:11" />Mme edinam ke ukara Asa, tọọñọ ke ntọọñọ tutu asịm utịd, ewet ke ñwed mme ndidem Yuda ye Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 16:12" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme duob mme usʌkkeed ke ukara amọ, Asa amaaduọ udọñọ ke ukod. Akpesʌkado udọñọ amọ akesọññọ adudu, ke nnaa udọñọ ado anye ikiyemme unwam ito <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado akebịne mme mbiaibọk kpọd. <verse eid="2CH 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 16:13" />Ndin ke ayọhọ isua ukara amọ aba mme keed, Asa amaakpa anyʌñ akeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ. <verse eid="2CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 16:14" />Ammọ emaebuuk anye ke udi a-anye akekpịkkeke asio anọ idem amọ ke Abio Defid. Ammọ emaenịm anye ke ñkpana ekefʌkkọ ye mme mfiọññọ ye nsio-nsio ñwuaha pefium, emaenyʌñ enam ekamba ebohoikañ ke ukpono amọ.<verse eid="2CH 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2CH 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yehosafad Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 17:1" />Yehosafad ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem anyʌñ asọọñọ idem amọ abeeñe abet Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 17:2" />Anye amaanịm mme udịmekọñ ke afịd akpọsọñ abio ke Yuda anyʌñ anịm mme itie ubono ñkpọ ekọñ ke Yuda ye ke mme abio Ifrem ake ete amọ Asa akewappake abọ.<verse eid="2CH 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 17:3" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaba ye Yehosafad sia anye amaakeene mme usʌñ ete amọ Defid a-akebemme anye iso. Anye ikiikaaha ikibọ uyio ito Baal <verse eid="2CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 17:4" />ado anye amaayem Abasi ete amọ anyʌñ akeene mme ewʌhọ amọ akan mme adinam Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 17:5" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam abio adidem asọọñọ ada ke ukara amọ; ndin afịd Yuda emaeben mme enọ esọk Yehosafad, ke ntoro anye amaanie ekamba uwak inie ye ukpono. <verse eid="2CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 17:6" />Esịd amọ akenekke ase usʌñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; mfen ñko, anye amaasịññe mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ye mme abai Asera ke Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 17:7" />Ke ayọhọ isua ita ke ukara amọ anye amaadọñ mme adaaha amọ Ben-Heel, Obadaiya, Sakaraiya, Netanel ye Maikaiya ate ekekpeep mme awo ñkpọ ke mme abio Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 17:8" />Ammọ ekeka ye usʌk mme Lifai, Semaiya, Netania, Sebadaiya, Asahel, Semiramod, Yehọnatan, Adọniya, Tobiya ye Tob-Adọniya, ye mme aku Elisama ye Yehoram. <verse eid="2CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 17:9" />Ammọ emaekpeep ñkpọ ke afịd Yuda, ammọ ekekama Ñwed Mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ammọ emaesaña ekanna afịd mme abio ke Yuda enyʌñ ekpeep mme awo.<verse eid="2CH 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 17:10" />Ndịk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadoro afịd abio mme ndidem ke isọñ e-ekekannake Yuda ekʌk, ke ntoro ammọ ikikaaha ekọñ ye Yehosafad. <verse eid="2CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 17:11" />Usʌk mbon Filistia emaeben mme enọ ye silfa esọk Yehosafad nte utịb, ndin mbon Arab emaeben mme ufene esọk anye: akukịmedọñ tọsịn itiaba mme ikie itiaba (7,700) ye ebod tọsịn itiaba mme ikie itiaba (7,700).<verse eid="2CH 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 17:12" />Yehosafad amaakaa iso akpon ke adudu; anye amaabọọp mme ñkpọsọñ itie ekọñ ye mme abio unịmñkpọ ke Yuda <verse eid="2CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 17:13" />anyʌñ anie ata uwak ñkpọ ke mme abio ke Yuda. Anye amaanyʌñ anịm mbon unie ifiọk ke ekọñ ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 17:14" />Ekesịn ammọ anyịñ ekeene mme ufọk ntom:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 17:14" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 17:14">Ke Yuda, ikpeghe mme adaiso ekọñ ke 1,000:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 17:14">Adna nte adaiso, ye mbon ekọñ tọsịn ikie ita (300,000);<verse eid="2CH 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 17:15" />udiana, Yehohanan nte adaiso ekọñ, ye mbon ekọñ tọsịn ikie iba mme anaañ (280,000);<verse eid="2CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 17:16" />udiana, Amasia ayịn Sikri, a-akefiọkkọfiọk ayaak idem amọ anọ adinam utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ye mbon ekọñ tọsịn ikie iba (200,000).<verse eid="2CH 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 17:17" />Ke ukañ Benyamin:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 17:17">Eliada, awo uko ke ekọñ, ye ideen tọsịn ikie iba (200,000) ekekaamake utịgha ye mme atuekọñ;<verse eid="2CH 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 17:18" />udiana, Yehosabad, ye ideen tọsịn ikie keed mme anaañ (180,000) e-eketịmme idem enọ ekọñ.<verse eid="2CH 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 17:19" />Mbon ami edo mbon e-ekenamma utom enọ adidem, akọrọ ye mbon ekenịmme ke mme akpọsọñ abio ke afịd Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 17:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2CH 18" />
  <para style="s1">Maikaiya Atañ Prọfesi Asua Anọ Ehab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 18:1" />Ke ini ntoro Yehosafad amaanie uwak inie ye ukpono, ndin anye akedian idem amọ ye Ehab ke ndọ. <verse eid="2CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 18:2" />Ke isua ifañ amaakeboiyo anye amaakaa adikikịt Ehab ke Sameria. Ehab amaawot uwak-uwak edọñ ye enañ anọ anye ye mbon awo ekebaaha ye anye anyʌñ akpeiye anye yak anwana ekọñ ye Ramọd Kilied. <verse eid="2CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 18:3" />Ehab adidem Isrel amaabịp Yehosafad adidem Yuda, “Nte afo ayañkeene miin akenwana ekọñ ye Ramọd Kilied?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:3">Yehosafad amaabọọrọ, “Ami ntie nte afo, mbon mmi nte mbon mfo; ñnyịn iyaukeene ika ekọñ ado.” <verse eid="2CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 18:4" />Ado Yehosafad amaanyʌñ abo adidem Isrel, “Ado akpa ñkpọ yem item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="2CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 18:5" />Ndin adidem Isrel amaakoono mme prọfed abon itie keed, ideen ikie inaañ (400), anyʌñ abịp ammọ, “Nte ñnyịn ika ekọñ ye Ramọd Kilied, me ke ami ñkaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:5">Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Kaa sia Abasi ayaayaak anye asịn ke ubọk adidem.”<verse eid="2CH 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 18:6" />Ado Yehosafad amaabịp, “Nte prọfed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ibaaha aba se ñnyịn ikeme ibịp nto?”<verse eid="2CH 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 18:7" />Adidem Isrel amaabọọrọ Yehosafad, “Prọfed keed asʌk aba ake ñnyịn ikemeke adibịp nto <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado ami nsuasua anye sia anye isitañña eti ñkpọ ndomokeed imbaña miin, ado asʌk ado idiọọk afịd ini. Anye ado Maikaiya ayịn Imla.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:7">Yehosafad amaabọọrọ, “Adidem ikpinaaha atañ utọ ikọ ado.”<verse eid="2CH 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 18:8" />Ndin adidem Isrel amaakoot keed ke atu mme adaaha amọ amaanyʌñ abo, “Koot Maikaiya ayịn Imla di ini keed.”<verse eid="2CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 18:9" />Ke emaekesịne mme afọñ ubọọñ, adidem Isrel ye Yehosafad adidem Yuda eketie ke mme ebekpo ammọ ke afe ubeek abakpa ke inuaatob Sameria, ye afịd mme prọfed naña esʌk etañ ñkukịd ke iso ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 18:10" />Ndin Sedekaiya ayịn Kenaana amaanam mme nnʌk ukwak ndin anye amaabo, “Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: ‘Ye mme ñkpọ ami afo ayaakuum mbon Aram tutu esobo ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 18:11" />Afịd mme prọfed mbon ñko ekesʌk etañ kpa ukem etob ado. Ammọ emaebo, “Nwana ye Ramọd Kilied nyʌñ bọ edikan, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaayaak anye asịn ke ubọk adidem.”<verse eid="2CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 18:12" />Isʌñutom a-akekaaha adikoot Maikaiya amaabo anye, “Se, afịd mme prọfed mbon ñko, isioho awo eto, esʌk ekịt edikan enọ adidem. Yak ikọ mfo asaña akekem ye ake ammọ, nyʌñ tañ inem-inem ikọ.”<verse eid="2CH 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 18:13" />Ado Maikaiya amaabo, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem, ami ndiidọkkọ anye se Abasi mmi atañ kpọd.”<verse eid="2CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 18:14" />Anye amaakedisịm, adidem amaabịp anye, “Maikaiya, nte ñnyịn ika ekọñ ye Ramọd Kilied, me ke ami ñkaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:14">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Nwana nyʌñ nie edikan, sia eyaeben ammọ usịn fiin ke ubọk.”<verse eid="2CH 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 18:15" />Adidem amaabo anye, “Akañ ifañ ke ana ami nnam nọ afo anwọñọ aditre aditañ ñkpọ ndomokeed ñkan akpanikọ kpọd innọ miin ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>?”<verse eid="2CH 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 18:16" />Ndin Maikaiya amaabọọrọ, “Ami mmaakịt afịd Isrel naña esuana ke mme abod nte mme edọñ ake imiinieghe akpemeedọñ, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, ‘Ibon ami inieghe etubom. Yak awo keedekeed anyọñ ufọk amọ ke emem.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 18:17" />Adidem Isrel amaabo Yehosafad, “Ado nte ami ñkudọkkọke mbo ke anye isitañña eti ñkukịd ndomokeed imbaña miin, kpa idiọọk kpọd?”<verse eid="2CH 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 18:18" />Maikaiya amaakaa iso abo, “Ke ntoro kop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: Ami mmaakịt <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> naña atie ke ebekpo amọ ye afịd mbon udịm anyọñ naña eda ekanna anye ke nnasia ye ke ufiin. <verse eid="2CH 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 18:19" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, ‘Anie awo idiitap Ehab adidem Isrel nọ anye akenwana ekọñ ye Ramọd Kilied ndin anyʌñ akesoobo ñkpa amọ do?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:19">“Nsio-nsio awo emaenọ nsio-nsio akikere. <verse eid="2CH 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 18:20" />Ke akpatre, sịbidịd keed amaawuọ adi, akeda ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin amaabo, ‘ami ñyaatap anye.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:20">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabịp, “ ‘Uduunam ke nsoo utọ usʌñ?’ ”<verse eid="2CH 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 18:21" />Anye amaabo, “ ‘Ami ñyaakaa ñkedo sịbidịd abiaña ke inua afịd mme prọfed amọ.’ Afo ayaanam afọn ke aditap anye, ‘Kaa nyʌñ kenam ntoro.’<verse eid="2CH 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 18:22" />“Ndin idahami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asịn sịbidịd abiaña ke inua mme prọfed mfo ami. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-abiide nsobo unọ fiin.”<verse eid="2CH 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 18:23" />Ndin Sedekaiya ayịn Kenaana amaadakka akesiak Maikaiya ufia ke iso. Anye amaabịp, “Usʌñ uke ke sịbidịd aketooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akekaa idaha anye akentooho miin aditañ ikọ ye afo?”<verse eid="2CH 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 18:24" />Maikaiya amaabọọrọ, “Afo ayaadiọọñọ ke usen se afo uduukudịbe ke esịd ubeed keed.”<verse eid="2CH 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 18:25" />Ndin adidem Isrel amaanọ uyio, “Ben Maikaiya nyʌñ nọ anye atịmme abịne Amọn adaukara ke abio ye Yoas ayịn adidem, <verse eid="2CH 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 18:26" />ndin bo, ‘Ntom ke adidem abo: Sịn awo ami ke ñkpakọb ndin kuunyʌñ unọọ anye ñkpọ mfen ukan uyo ye mmọọñ tutu ñnyọñ ndi ke ifuuro.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 18:27" />Maikaiya amaabo, “Afo ukpusʌk unyọñ udi ke ifuuro, awuọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> iboiyoke ke ami itañ.” Ndin anye amaadian, “Iwet ikọ mmi inịm, afịd ndufo!”<verse eid="2CH 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ewot Ehab ke Ramọd Kilied</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 18:28" />Ndin adidem Isrel ye Yehosafad adidem Yuda emaedọọk ekaa Ramọd Kilied. <verse eid="2CH 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 18:29" />Adidem Isrel amaabo Yehosafad, “Ami ñyaadedịp idem ndʌk ekọñ, ado afo sịne mme afọñ ubọọñ mfo.” Ndin adidem Isrel amaadịp idem amọ akaa ekọñ.<verse eid="2CH 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 18:30" />Ndin adidem Aram amaanọ mme adaiso mme sariọd amọ uyio, “Ikiinwana ye awo ndomokeed, etək me ekamba, ibọhọke adidem Isrel.” <verse eid="2CH 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 18:31" />Ke ini mme adaiso sariọd ekekịtte Yehosafad, ammọ ekekere, “Anye ami ado adidem Isrel.” Ke ntoro ammọ emaetịmme ekaa edinwana ye anye, ado Yehosafad amaasio ñkpo, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanwam anye. Abasi amaadʌt ammọ akpọñ anye, <verse eid="2CH 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 18:32" />sia idaha mme adaiso sariọd ekekịtte ke idooho anye ado adidem Isrel, ammọ emaetre edibịne anye.<verse eid="2CH 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 18:33" />Ado awo keed ke idueanyen amaadʌt utịgha amọ ntịme-ntịme ndin amaaketịgha adidem Isrel ke ufọọd usoobo ñkpaha ikpanesịd ye afọñ ekọñ. Adidem amaabo awad sariọd amọ, “Kanna iso nyʌñ mben miin wat sio ke itie anwan ami. Ennọ miin unan.” <verse eid="2CH 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 18:34" />Afịd usen ado ekọñ amaanekke asọñ, ndin adidem Isrel amaasọọñọ abere ke sariọd amọ asak iso ase mbon Aram tutu ndubiayio. Ado ke usobutịn anye amaakpa.<verse eid="2CH 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2CH 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 19:1" />Ke ini Yehosafad adidem Yuda amaaketịmme anyọñ ke akwere amọ ke Yeruselem ke ifuuro, <verse eid="2CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 19:2" />Yehu akịdñkukịd, ayịn Hanani, amaawuọ akaa akesoobo ye anye anyʌñ abo adidem Yehosafad, “Nte ana afo anwam mbon ibak anyʌñ ama mbon e-esuaha <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>? Ke ntak ami, iyadesịd Abọọñ u-udoro fiin ke idem. <verse eid="2CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 19:3" />Ado naña ado ado, afo amenie usʌk nti ñkpọ, sia afo amaasịññe mme abai Asera afep ke isọñ anyʌñ asịn esịd mfo ke adiyem Abasi.”<verse eid="2CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehosafad Amek Mme Abiideikpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 19:4" />Yehosafad amaadʌñ ke Yeruselem, anyʌñ atịmme ase awuọ asaaña ke atu mme awo tọọñọ ke Beeseba tutu ke abod abio Ifrem anyʌñ amaana awọññọ ammọ anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 19:5" />Anye amaamek mme abiideikpe anịm ke isọñ, ke mme abio ndibene keedekeed ke Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 19:6" />Anye amaabo ammọ, “Inekke itịñ anyen ikere ibaña se ndufo enam, sia ndufo ikpeeghe ikpe inọ awo ado ekpe enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-abaaha ye ndufo ke ini akeedodo andufo enọọhọ ubiere. <verse eid="2CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 19:7" />Ke ami eyak ndịk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idoro ndufo. Itịñ anyen ikpe ikpe, sia ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn ukwañ ikpe me unieawo mme ubọkedem ibaaha.”<verse eid="2CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 19:8" />Ke Yeruselem ñko, Yehosafad amaamek usʌk mme Lifai, mme aku ye mme adaiwuod ke ufọk mbon Isrel adinọ mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñnyʌñ ñkpe emem. Ndin ammọ ekedʌñ ke Yerusalem <verse eid="2CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 19:9" />Anye amaanọ ammọ mme ewʌhọ ami: “Ndufo ana nte enam akpanikọ ke afịd esịd ke mbaak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 19:10" />Ke afịd ikpe a-atooho mbon ndufo e-edʌñọke ke mme abio ake ediighe ke iso ndufo me ado uduọk iyiib me ñkpọ mfen a-asịneke ke mbed, ewʌhọ, item ye mme eduuwem, ana nte ndufo edət ammọ utọñ ebo ke ammọ edue <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; imiidooho ntoro iyadesịd amọ ayaadidoro ndufo ye mbon ndufo. Inam ami, ndin ndufo idiidueghe.<verse eid="2CH 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 19:11" />“Amaria akwa aku ayaado andise ñkpọ ibaña ndufo ke ñkpọ a-abegheke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin Sebadaiya ayịn Ismeel, adadusʌñ ke esiin Yuda, ayaado andise ñkpọ ibaña ndufo ke ñkpọ akeedodo a-abegheke adidem, ndin mme Lifai eyaenam ñkpọ nte mme adaaha ke iso ndufo. Inam ñkpọ ye ikpaab esịd, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpekap ada ye mbon e-enamma nọ afọn.”<verse eid="2CH 19:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2CH 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yehosafad Akan Mọb ye Amọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 20:1" />Ke ami amaakeboiyo, mbon Mọb ye mbon Amọn ye usʌk mbon Meun emaeditịppe ekọñ ye Yehosafad.<verse eid="2CH 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 20:2" />Usʌk awo emaedidọkkọ Yehosafad, “Akwa atu mbon ekọñ esʌk eto ke Edọm edinwana ye afo, eto ke edem ñkañ Ñkpaikpa Inyañ ako. Ammọ ebaba ke Hasesọn Tama” (a-adooho, En Kedi). <verse eid="2CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 20:3" />Akedịkke, Yehosafad amaabiide adiyem iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anyʌñ abo etie utreudia ke afịd Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 20:4" />Mbon Yuda emaedi atọ keed ediyem unwam nto <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ke akpan, ammọ emaeto afịd abio ke Yuda ediyem anye.<verse eid="2CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 20:5" />Akem Yehosafad amaadakka ada ke esob Yuda ye Yeruselem ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke iso ufa akwere <verse eid="2CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 20:6" />anyʌñ abo:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 20:6">“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ñnyịn, nte idooho afo ado Abasi a-abaaha ke anyọñ? Afo akara afịd mme ebekpo ke mme idịd. Adudu ye ukeme esịne ke ubọk mfo, ndin awo ndomokeed ikemeke adida ñka-ñka ye afo. <verse eid="2CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 20:7" />Abasi ñnyịn, nte afo ukubịneke mme awo ekedʌññọ ke isọñ ami usịññe ke iso mbon mfo Isrel unyʌñ uyaak anye unọ ubon Ebraham ufan mfo ke nsi-nsi? <verse eid="2CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 20:8" />Ammọ emaedʌñọ ke esịd amọ enyʌñ ebọp ke esịd amọ adisana itie enọ Anyịñ mfo, enyʌñ ebo, <verse eid="2CH 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 20:9" />‘Adieke ñkpọntịppe adiighe ibịne ñnyịn, me ado ubiomikpe ake akañkañ, me idiọọk udọñọ me akañ, ke ñnyịn iyaida ke iso mfo ke tembịd ami a-akereke Anyịñ mfo inyʌñ iseeme unọ fiin ke mfịna ñnyịn, ndin afo ayaakop anyʌñ inyaaña ñnyịn.’<verse eid="2CH 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 20:10" />“Ado idahami se mbon Amọn mi, Mọb ye Abod Sei, a-adooho afo ukuyakka Isrel edʌk idʌñ ammọ ke ini ammọ ekewuọñọke ke Iyib; ammọ emaekanna edem ekpọñ ammọ ikinyʌññọ isobo ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 20:11" />Se naña ammọ isio ñnyịn usiene ke adidibịne ñnyịn nsioño ke inie afo akinọọhọ ñnyịn nte udeeme. <verse eid="2CH 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 20:12" />Abasi ñnyịn, nte afo uduukpeeghe ikpe unọ ammọ? Sia ñnyịn inieghe adudu adinwana ye ekamba udịm ekọñ e-ediighe anwan ye ñnyịn. Ñnyịn idiọọñọke se ikpinam, ado anyen ñnyịn use fiin.”<verse eid="2CH 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 20:13" />Afịd ideen ke Yuda, ye mme ibaan ammọ, ye nditọ ye ntəkayịn, emaeda do ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="2CH 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 20:14" />Akem Sịbidịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadidoro Yahasiel ayịn Sakaraiya, ayịn Benaiya, ayịn Yeiyel, ayịn Matania, awo Lifai ye awo ubon Asaf, naña anye akedaaha ke esob.<verse eid="2CH 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 20:15" />Anye amaabo: “Ikpañ utọñ, adidem Yehosafad ye afịd mbon e-edʌñọke ke Yuda ye Yeruselem! Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idọkkọ ndufo: ‘Ikiifeghe ndịk ikiinyʌñ inie iduọesịd ke ntak ekamba udịm ekọñ ami. Sia ekọñ unieghe fiin, ado anie Abasi. <verse eid="2CH 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 20:16" />Ñkpọñ imia ikpad isọiyọ ikinwana ye ammọ. Ammọ ediidọdọọk ke Mfrọ Siis, ndin ndufo eyaekịt ammọ ke utịd abedeñ ke Akpautatan Yeruel. <verse eid="2CH 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 20:17" />Ndufo idiinieghe adinwana ekọñ ami. Idat itie ndufo; isọọñọ ida inyʌñ ikịt adinyaaña ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiinọ ndufo, Yuda ye Yeruselem. Ikiifeghe ndịk; ikiinie iduọesịd. Iwuọ ikaa ikinwana ye ammọ ñkpọñ, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaaba ye ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 20:18" />Yehosafad amaanyuuk iwuod ye iso amọ ase isọñ, ndin afịd mbon Yuda ye Yeruselem emaeduọññọ enọ ukpono ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 20:19" />Akem usʌk mme Lifai e-eketooho ubon Kohad ye ubon Kora emaedakka eda etooro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, ke ataa akpọsọñ uyio.<verse eid="2CH 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 20:20" />Ke usiere ubakusen ammọ emaekpọñ ekaa ke Akpautatan Tekoa. Idaha ammọ ekedakkake, Yehosafad amaada anyʌñ abo, “Ikpañ utọñ innọ miin, Yuda ye mbon Yeruselem! Inie mbuọdidem ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ndin eyaibenne ndufo; inie mbuọdidem ke ikọ mme prọfed ndin ndufo eyaenie unen.” <verse eid="2CH 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 20:21" />Ke anye amaakekọọk iwuod ye mme awo ama, Yehosafad amaamek mme awo nọ ekwọ ikwọ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ etooro anye ke adisana uyai amọ nte ammọ ewuọñọke enyʌñ edat mbon ekọñ usʌñ, ebo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 20:21">“Inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ekọọm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 20:21">sia ima amọ aba ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="2CH 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 20:22" />Naña ammọ eketọọñọke edikwọ ñnyʌñ ntooro, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanịm mbon udịbe ke ikọd ebịne mbon Amọn ye Mọb ye Abod Sei e-ekediighe ekọñ ye Yuda, ndin emaekan ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 20:23" />Mbon Amọn ye mbon Mọb emaedakka eda enwana ye mbon e-etooho Abod Sei esobo enyʌñ esuan ammọ. Ke ammọ emaekekweeñe adiwoot mbon e-etooho Sei, ammọ emaenwam edisobo emọ-emọ.<verse eid="2CH 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 20:24" />Ke ini mbon Yuda ekedisịmme itie a-asakkaiso ase akpautatan enyʌñ eda ese ñkañ itie ekamba mbon ekọñ, ammọ ekekịt akpo awo ikpọọñ nte ebono ke isọñ; awo ndomokeed ikibọkkọke. <verse eid="2CH 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 20:25" />Ke ntoro Yehosafad ye mbon amọ emaekaa ekekoono mbịme ammọ, ndin ammọ emaekịt ke atu ammọ ekamba mme ñkpọ utom ye nsiine akọrọ ye mme ñkpọuto, awakka akan se ammọ ekekan eben enyọñọ. Mbịme amaawak tutu ndin akedat usen ita adikoono mmaa. <verse eid="2CH 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 20:26" />Ke ayọhọ usen inaañ ammọ emaeboho ke Abedeñ Beraka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beraka awuọñọ itooro</char></note>, itie ake ammọ eketooroke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ami ado ntak e-ekoodo anye Abedeñ Beraka tutu mfịn ami.<verse eid="2CH 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 20:27" />Amaakekem, ke ndadusʌñ Yehosafad, afịd mbon Yuda ye Yeruselem emaetịmme enyọñọ Yeruselem ke idaara, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ ammọ ntak edidaara ke iwuod mme asua ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 20:28" />Ammọ emaekedʌk Yeruselem enyʌñ ekaa ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye mme ekpa ye mme ndidoudʌk ye mme adukpoñ.<verse eid="2CH 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 20:29" />Ndịk Abasi amaamʌm afịd mme ñkanñkʌk abio ndidem ke ini ammọ ekekoppo naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenwana akan mme asua Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 20:30" />Ndin abio adidem Yehosafad amaanie emem, sia Abasi amọ amaanọ anye nduọkadudu ke afịd usʌñ.<verse eid="2CH 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Utịd Ukara Yehosafad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 20:31" />Ndin Yehosafad amaakara ke Yuda. Anye akedo awo isua edịb mme duob mme ition idaha anye akedooho adidem ke Yuda, ndin anye amaanyʌñ akara ke Yeruselem isua edịb mme ition. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Asuba ayịn awonwaan Silhi. <verse eid="2CH 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 20:32" />Anye amaakeene ke mme usʌñ ete amọ Asa, ikinyʌññọ iwọññọ ikpọñ ammọ; anye amaanam se inen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 20:33" />Ado anye ikisịññeke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie, ndin mme awo ikisịnne esịd ammọ ke Abasi mme eteete ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 20:34" />Mme edinam mfen ke ukara Yehosafad, tọọñọ ke ntọọñọ tutu akpatre, ewet ke ñwed mbʌk Yehu ayịn Hanani, naña ewet esịn ke ñwed mme ndidem Isrel.<verse eid="2CH 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 20:35" />Akema, Yehosafad adidem Yuda amaanam unyịmme adidiana keed ye Ahasaiya adidem Isrel, a-adooho mme usʌñ amọ ekedo ibak. <verse eid="2CH 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 20:36" />Anye amaanyịmme ye anye adibọp mme udịm ubom udua aka Taasis. Ke emaekebọp ammọ ke Esiọn Keba, <verse eid="2CH 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 20:37" />Eliesa ayịn Dodafahu ake Maresa amaatañ prọfesi abaña Yehosafad, ate, “Sia afo amaakedian idem ye Ahasaiya, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaasobo se afo anam.” Mme ubom emaesịp ndin ikikanna ika mbịn ke Taasis.<verse eid="2CH 20:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2CH 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 21:1" />Akem Yehosafad amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ye ammọ ke abio Defid. Ndin Yehoram ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem. <verse eid="2CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 21:2" />Mme nditọete Yehoram, nditọ Yehosafad, ekedoñño Asaria, Yehiel, Sakaraiya, Asariahu, Maikel ye Sefatia. Afịd mbon ami ekedoñño nditọ Yehosafad adidem Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 21:3" />Ete ammọ amaanọ ammọ uwak enọ ke silfa ye kold ye mme ñkpọuto, ñkọrọ ye mme abio ndibene ke Yuda, ado anye amaayaak abio adidem anọ Yehoram sia anye akedo akpan.<verse eid="2CH 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoram Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 21:4" />Ke ini Yehoram amaakenie nsọọñọnda nte adidem ke abio ete amọ, anye amaawoot afịd nditọete amọ ke akañkañ adian ye usʌk mme adaaha ke Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 21:5" />Yehoram akedo isua edịb mme duob mme iba idaha anye akedooho adidem, amaanyʌñ akara ke Yeruselem isua itiaita. <verse eid="2CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 21:6" />Anye amaakeene usʌñ mme ndidem Isrel, naña ufọk Ehab akenam, sia anye amaadọ ayịn awonwaan Ehab. Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 21:7" />Kpayeado, ke ntak edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenamma ye Defid, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikibeeñeke idem adisobo ufọk Defid. Anye amaanwọñọ adinịm utuenikañ nnọọ anye ye ubon amọ ke nsi-nsi.<verse eid="2CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 21:8" />Ke ayio Yehoram, Edọm amaasọñ iwuod ye Yuda anyʌñ amek adidem anọ idem amọ. <verse eid="2CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 21:9" />Ndin Yehoram amaakaa do ye mme adaaha ekọñ amọ ye afịd sariọd amọ. Mbon Edọm emaekanna anye ye mme adaiso sariọd amọ ekʌk, ado anye amaadakka ada afiọnnọ abọkkọ ke akonayio. <verse eid="2CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 21:10" />Tutu mfịn ami Edọm asʌk aba ke nsọñiwuod ye Yuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 21:10">Libna amaanyʌñ anam nsọñiwuod ke ukem ini ado, sia Yehoram amaakpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 21:11" />Anye amaanyʌñ abọp mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ke mme abod Yuda anyʌñ anam mme awo ke Yeruselem enam akpara ke idem emọ-emọ anyʌñ anam Yuda awakka akpọñ usʌñ.<verse eid="2CH 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 21:12" />Yehoram amaabọ ñwedetob ato prọfed Elaiya, a-akebooho ntom:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 21:12">“Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi ete mfo Defid, atañ: ‘Afo ukukeeneke usʌñ ete mfo Yehosafad me ake Asa adidem Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 21:13" />Ado afo amekeene usʌñ mme ndidem Isrel, ndin afo amenam mbon Yuda ye mbon Yeruselem enam akpara, kpa naña ufọk Ehab ekenam. Afo amenyʌñ awoot nditọete mfo, mbon esịneke ke ubon mfo, mbon ekefọnnọ ukan fiin. <verse eid="2CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 21:14" />Ke ntoro idahami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaasobo mbon mfo, nditọ mfo, ibaan mfo ye afịd ñkpọ a-adooho ake mfo, ye ata ndoppo ita. <verse eid="2CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 21:15" />Afo ke idem mfo ayaadọñọ eti-eti ye udọñọ akpannsia ake adiikpeene, tutu udọñọ ado anam akpannsia mfo awuọñọ adi.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 21:16" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaademme usua mbon Filistia ye mbon Arab ekedʌññọ ekpere mbon Kuus anọ Yehoram. <verse eid="2CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 21:17" />Ammọ emaenam ikọ ye Yuda, ebịmme edʌk enyʌñ ekoono afịd ñkpọ se ekekịt ke akwere adidem ekọrọ ye nditọ ye mme ibaan amọ. Ayịn ndomokeed ikisʌhọke inọ anye ibọhọke Ahasaiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru Yehoahas asʌk ado Ahasaiya</char></note>, a-akedooho akpeedem ayịn.<verse eid="2CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 21:18" />Ke afịd ami amaakeboiyo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatọ Yehoram udọñọ anana nsuuk ke akpannsia. <verse eid="2CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 21:19" />Nte ini akaaha iso, ke utịd ayọhọ isua iba, akpannsia amọ amaawuọñọ ke ntak udọñọ ado, ndin anye amaakpa ke akpọsọñ ubiak. Mbon amọ ikibarake ikañ ikpo ke ukpono amọ, naña ekenam enọ mbon ekebemme anye iso eba.<verse eid="2CH 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 21:20" />Yehoram akesọñ isua edịb mme duob mme iba idaha anye akedooho adidem, anyʌñ akara ke Yeruselem isua itiaita. Anye amaaboiyo afep, awo ndomokeed iseemeke, emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke Abio Defid, ado ikidooho ke udi mme ndidem.<verse eid="2CH 21:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2CH 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ahasaiya Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 22:1" />Mbon Yeruselem emaenam Ahasaiya, akpatre ayịn Yehoram, adidem ke itie amọ, sia mme udịm ekọñ, e-ekesañake edi ye mbon Arab ekedʌkkọ itie nnaaekọñ, emaewot afịd ikpọ nditọ ideen. Ke ntoro Ahasaiya ayịn Yehoram adidem Yuda amaatọọñọ akara.<verse eid="2CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 22:2" />Ahasaiya akesọñ isua edịb mme iba idaha anye akedooho adidem, anyʌñ akara ke Yeruselem isua keed. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Atalia, ayeyịn awonwaan Omri.<verse eid="2CH 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 22:3" />Anye ñko amaakeene ke mme usʌñ ufọk Ehab, sia eka amọ amaasọọñọ anye ukod adinam idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="2CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 22:4" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña ufọk Ehab akenam, sia ke ete amọ amaakekpa ammọ emaekappa edoñño mme anọitem amọ, a-akedatta anye anọ nsobo. <verse eid="2CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 22:5" />Anye amaanyʌñ akeene item ammọ ke ini anye akekeeneke Yoram ayịn Ehab adidem Isrel adinwana ekọñ ye Hasel adidem Aram ke Ramọd Kilied. Mbon Aram emaenọ Yoram unan; <verse eid="2CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 22:6" />ndin Yoram amaanyọñ akaa Yesriil adikisọbọ unan ake ammọ ekenọọhọ anye ke Ramọd ke ekọñ amọ ye Hasel adidem Aram.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 22:6">Ndin Ahasaiya ayịn Yehoram adidem Yuda amaakaa Yesriil adikise Yoram ayịn Ehab, sia emaenọ anye unan.<verse eid="2CH 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 22:7" />Ato ke Ahasaiya adika ñkese Yoram, Abasi amaaben iduọ asọk Ahasaiya. Ke ini Ahasaiya akesịmme, anye amaawuọ ye Yoram akesoobo ye Yehu ayịn Nimsi, ami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeyette adan anịm nọ asobo ufọk Ehab. <verse eid="2CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 22:8" />Ke ini Yehu akesʌkkọ anọ ufọk Ehab ufen, anye amaakịt mme adaaha ke Yuda ye nditọ mbon ufọk Ahasaiya, e-ekenamma ñkpọ enọ Ahasaiya, ndin anye amaawoot ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 22:9" />Anye ndin amaakaa akeyem Ahasaiya, mbon amọ ekemʌm anye ke itie anye akedịbeke ke Sameria. Emaeben anye esọk Yehu ndin emaewot anye. Ammọ emaebuuk anye, sia ammọ emaebo, “Anye akedo ayịn Yehosafad, ami akeyemme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke afịd esịd amọ.” Ke ntoro ikibaaha awo ke ufọk Ahasaiya a-akenieghe adudu akem adisʌk ñkama abio adidem.<verse eid="2CH 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atalia ye Yoas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 22:10" />Atalia eka Ahasaiya amaakekịt ke ayịn imọ amaakpa, anye amaadakka akesobo afịd mbon ufọk adidem ke Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 22:11" />Ado Yehoseba, ayịn awonwaan Adidem Yehoram, amaaben Yoas ayịn Ahasaiya anyʌñ ayịp anye asio ke atu nditọ ideen adidem ke ufọk ubọọñ a-akenaaha nte ewoot anyʌñ asịn anye ye adeb amọ ke esịd ubeed. Sia Yehoseba, ayịn awonwaan adidem Yehoram akenyʌññọ ado anwaan aku Yehoiyada, akedo ayịneka Ahasaiya, anye amaadịp ayịn ado iyakka Atalia akan awot anye. <verse eid="2CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 22:12" />Anye amaakaa iso adịbe ye ammọ ke tembịd Abasi ke isua itiokeed ke idaha ini Atalia akekarake abio.<verse eid="2CH 22:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2CH 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 23:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua itiaba Yehoiyada amaawọt adudu amọ. Anye amaadʌk edioomo ye mme adaiso udịmekọñ ke mme ikpeghe ikie ikie (100): Asaria ayịn Yeroham, Ismeel ayịn Yehohanan, Asaraiya ayịn Obed, Maaseiya ayịn Adaiya, ye Elisafad ayịn Sikri. <verse eid="2CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 23:2" />Ammọ emaekaa ke afịd Yuda enyʌñ ekebon mme Lifai ye mme adaiwuod ke mme ufọk ke Isrel ke afịd mme abio ke itie keed. Ke ini ammọ ekedieghe Yeruselem, <verse eid="2CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 23:3" />afịd esob emaenam edioomo ye adidem ke tembịd Abasi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 23:3">Yehoiyada amaabo ammọ, “Ayịn awodeen adidem adiikara, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọ abaña ubon Defid. <verse eid="2CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 23:4" />Idahami se ana nte ndufo enam ado ami: mbakka keed ke itie ita ke atu mme aku ye mme Lifai e-ebaaha ke utom ke Sabad eyaeda ukpeme ke mme usʌñ, <verse eid="2CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 23:5" />mbakka keed ke itie ita ndufo eba ke akwere abọọñ ndin mbakka keed ke itie ita eyaeda ke Inuaatob Itiad idakisọñ, ndin afịd mbon mfen ana nte eba ke anwa tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 23:6" />Awo ndomokeed inaaha nte adʌk tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke imiibọhọke mme aku ye mme Lifai ebaññake ke utom; ammọ ekeme edidʌk sia ammọ esana, ado afịd mbon mfen ana nte ekpeme ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> editre edidʌk esịd tembịd. <verse eid="2CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 23:7" />Ana nte mme Lifai eda ekanna adidem ekʌk, keedekeed ye ñkpọekọñ amọ ke ubọk. Awo ndomokeed a-adʌkkọ tembịd ana nte ewot anye. Ida ikpere adidem itie nte anye akaka.”<verse eid="2CH 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 23:8" />Mme Lifai ye afịd ideen ke Yuda emaenam kpa ukem-ukem naña aku Yehoiyada akenọọ uyio. Etubom keedekeed amaaben ideen amọ, mbon e-ekekaahaka utom ke Sabad ye mbon ekenyọñọkenyọñọ ke utom, sia aku Yehoiyada ikisuanna mme ikpeghe ndomokeed. <verse eid="2CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 23:9" />Ndin aku Yehoiyada amaanọ mme adaiso ekọñ ke mme ikpeghe ikie keed (100) mme eduad ye mme ñkpoon ye mme ntək atuekọñ a-adidem Defid akenieghe, e-ekenyʌññọ ebono ke tembịd Abasi. <verse eid="2CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 23:10" />Anye amaadaaha afịd mme ideen, keedekeed akama ñkpọekọñ amọ ke ubọk, ekanna adidem, ekpere akpokoro uwa ye tembịd, ke ñkañ usuuk-usuuk tutu ke ñkañ adoro-adoro tembịd.<verse eid="2CH 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 23:11" />Yehoiyada ye nditọ ideen amọ emaesio ayịn adidem ewuọ edi enyʌñ eyat anye anyanya; ammọ emaenọ anye ñwed edioomo enyʌñ esọọñọ etañ ke anye ado adidem. Ammọ emaeyet anye adan enyʌñ ekpọk ukịbe ete, “Itọñ uwem asọñ adidem!”<verse eid="2CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 23:12" />Atalia akekop uyom mbon awo ekefeeñeke enyʌñ edaara adidem, anye amaadakka abịne ammọ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 23:13" />Anye amaase, anyʌñ akịt adidem, nte ada adiana abai amọ ke anyenusʌñ. Mme adaaha ye mme afịd adukpoñ emaeda ke ñkañ adidem, ndin afịd awo ke abio ekesʌk edaara enyʌñ efịt mme adukpoñ, ye mme akwọikwọ ye mme ñkpọ ubre ikwọ ammọ ekesʌk edat usʌñ ke itooro. Ndin Atalia amaawai afọñidem amọ amaanyʌñ asio ñkpo, “Abiaña! Abiaña!”<verse eid="2CH 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 23:14" />Aku Yehoiyada amaadọñ mme adaiso udịmekọñ ke mme ikpeghe ikie keed (100), e-ekeseeghe ñkpọ ebaña mme udịmekọñ ewuọ, amaanyʌñ abo ammọ: “Imʌm anye isio ke ufọọd udịmekọñ ndin iwot ke akañkañ awo akeedodo a-akeeneke anye.” Sia aku amaabo, “Ikiiwot anye ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.” <verse eid="2CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 23:15" />Ndin ammọ emaemʌm anye ke idaha anye akekesịmme inuausʌñ ke Inuaatob Enañ ke anwa akwere ufọk adidem, ndin emaenyʌñ ewot anye ke itie ado.<verse eid="2CH 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 23:16" />Ndin Yehoiyada amaanam edioomo ke imọ, mbon awo ye adidem eyaedo ikọd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 23:17" />Afịd awo emaekaa tembịd Baal enyʌñ ekewuut ebono. Ammọ emaeboom mme akpokoro uwa ndem ye mme ubobodñkpọ enyʌñ ewot Matan aku Baal ke iso mme akpokoro uwa.<verse eid="2CH 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 23:18" />Akem Yehoiyada amaanam mme aku Lifai ese ñkpọ ebaña utom ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nte mbon ake Defid akesioho anịm ke tembịd, nọ ammọ enam ufọfọb uwa ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> naña ekewet ke mbed Moses, ke idaara ye ikwọ, naña Defid aketemme. <verse eid="2CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 23:19" />Anye amaadaaha mbon ukpeme ke inuaatob tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mbaak awo ndomokeed ake imiisanake adikan adʌk.<verse eid="2CH 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 23:20" />Anye amaaben mme adaiso udịmekọñ ikie, mme mbọọñ, mme andikara mbon awo ye afịd mme awo ke abio nọ esaña ye anye, enyʌñ ekeben adidem esọiyọ eto ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ammọ ekesaña eto Anyọñ-Anyọñ Inuaatob edʌk ufọkadidem enyʌñ eketem adidem ke ebekpo ubọọñ. <verse eid="2CH 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 23:21" />Afịd awo ke isọñ emaedaara, ndin abio amaadobo, sia emaewot Atalia ke akañkañ.<verse eid="2CH 23:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2CH 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yoas Adiọñ Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 24:1" />Yoas akedo isua itiaba idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua aba. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Sibia; eka amọ aketo Beeseba. <verse eid="2CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 24:2" />Yoas amaanam se inen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke afịd isua a-Yehoiyada akedooho aku. <verse eid="2CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 24:3" />Yehoiyada amaamek ibaan ndọ iba anọ anye, anye amaanyʌñ anie nditọ ideen ye ibaan.<verse eid="2CH 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 24:4" />Ke anyan ini amaakeboiyo Yoas amaabiide adidiọñ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nọ amaana afọn. <verse eid="2CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 24:5" />Anye amaakoot mme aku ye mme Lifai abon itie keed anyʌñ abo ammọ, “Ikaa ke mme abio ke Yuda inyʌñ ibọ akʌk a-anaaha nte enọ kwa isua ke afịd Isrel, idat inam tembịd Abasi ndufo afọn. Inam ado idahami.” Ado mme Lifai ikinamma ke ini.<verse eid="2CH 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 24:6" />Ke ntoro adidem amaakoot Yehoiyada akwa aku anyʌñ abo anye, “Ntak a-afo umuubịppe mme Lifai yak ammọ eben etịbe a-atooho Yuda ye Yeruselem ake Moses isʌñutom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye esob Isrel ekedotto yak edat edi ke atayad mbed edioomo?”<verse eid="2CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 24:7" />Ndin nditọ ideen awonwaan ibak ado Atalia emaebom edʌk tembịd Abasi enyʌñ ekekoono ndisana ñkpọ ekenọ mme Baal.<verse eid="2CH 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 24:8" />Ke uyio adidem, emaenam akebe ekenịm ke anwa, ke inuaatob tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 24:9" />Akem emaenọ uyio ke Yuda ye Yeruselem ke ana nte ammọ eben utịb ake Moses awo Abasi akeyemme ato Isrel ke anaan esọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 24:10" />Afịd mme adaaha ye afịd awo emaeben etịbe ammọ edi ke idadesịd, esịn ammọ ke akebe tutu anye ayọhọ. <verse eid="2CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 24:11" />Ini akeedodo ake mme Lifai ekebenne akebe esọk mme adaaha adidem ndin ammọ emaekekịt ke uwak akʌk amaaba, awedñwed ufọk adidem ye mme adaaha ufọkutom ekamba aku eyaedinwañña akebe enyʌñ etịmme eben anye ekenịm ke itie ammọ. Ammọ emaenam ami ndin-ndin enyʌñ ebọ ataa uwak akʌk. <verse eid="2CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 24:12" />Adidem ye Yehoiyada emaeben anye enọ mbon e-ekenamma utom se akenaa nte enam ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ammọ emaekpe mme akọọkufọk ye mme anam utomusọ yak emaana ediọñ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> yak atịmme afọn, akọrọ ye mbon unam utom ukwak ye ake brọns nọ ediọñ tembịd afọn.<verse eid="2CH 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 24:13" />Mbon ekeseeghe ñkpọ ebaña utom emaesịn ifịk, ndin utom udiọñ tembịd amaasaña afọn ke ubọk ammọ. Ammọ emaetịmme ebọp tembịd Abasi ekeene naña ekemịñ anye ke akpa emaenyʌñ enam anye asọñ idem. <verse eid="2CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 24:14" />Ke ini ammọ emaekekweeñe, ammọ emaeben akʌk se ikiyọhọ isʌhọ esọk adidem ye Yehoiyada, ndin emaedat anye enam mme ñkpọ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: mme ñkpọ unam utom ye ake edatta enam mme ufọfọb uwa, akọrọ ye mme usan ye mme ñkpoduoho ake kold ye silfa. Adaña nte Yehoiyada akeduuho uwem, emaekaka iso enọ ufọfọb uwa ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="2CH 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 24:15" />Idahami Yehoiyada amaasọñ anyʌñ akpon ke isua, ndin anye amaakpa ke amaakesịm isua ikie mme edịb mme duob. <verse eid="2CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 24:16" />Emaebuuk anye ye mme ndidem ke abio Defid, ke ntak nti ñkpọ ake anye akenamma ke Isrel anọ Abasi ye tembịd amọ.<verse eid="2CH 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibak Ido Yoas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 24:17" />Ke Yehoiyada amaakekpa, mme adaaha ke Yuda emaedi edituak iwuod enọ adidem, anye amaanyʌñ akpañ utọñ anọ ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 24:18" />Ammọ emaesịn tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ, enyʌñ ekpono mme abai Asera ye mme ndem. Ke ntak ndudue ammọ, iyadesịd Abasi amaadidoro Yuda ye Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 24:19" />Akpesʌkado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakedọñ mme ekamba aku anọ mbon ado nọ etịmme edat ammọ esọk anye, ñko akpesʌkado ammọ ekesuaha enọ ammọ, ammọ ikikpañña utọñ.<verse eid="2CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 24:20" />Akem Sịbidịd Abasi amaadidoro Sakaraiya ayịn aku Yehoiyada. Anye amaada ke iso mme awo anyʌñ abo, “Ami ado se Abasi atañ: ‘Ntak ake ndufo esọññọ iwuod ye ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ọ? Ndufo idiiforoke. Sia ndufo emaekesịn <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye isịn ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 24:21" />Ado ammọ emaedʌk edioomo ebaña anye, ndin ke uyio adidem ammọ emaetọọñ anye ke itiad ewot ke anwa tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 24:22" />Adidem Yoas ikitoiyoke mfọn ake Yehoiyada ete Sakaraiya akenamma anọ anye ado amaawot ayịn amọ, a-akebooho ke ini anye akenaaha ke ñkpa, “yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akịt ami anyʌñ anam afo abọọrọ mbuume.”<verse eid="2CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 24:23" />Ke isua amaakekanna idi, mbon ekọñ Aram emaedi anwan ye Yoas; ammọ emaedʌk esuan Yuda ye Yeruselem enyʌñ ewot afịd mme adadusʌñ mme awo. Ammọ emaenọ afịd mbịme esọk adidem ammọ ke Damaskọs. <verse eid="2CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 24:24" />Akpesʌkado mbon ekọñ Aram ekedieghe ye ibad-ibad mbon awo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayaak ekamba udịm ekọñ asịn ammọ ke ubọk. Sia Yuda amaasịn <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ, ikpe amaabiom Yoas. <verse eid="2CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 24:25" />Ke ini mbon Aram eketịmmeke edem, ammọ emaekpọñ Yoas ye ekamba unan. Mme adaaha amọ emaedʌk idiọọk edioomo ebaña anye ke ntak anye adikiwot ayịn aku Yehoiyada, ndin ammọ emaewot anye ke ñkpana nnaa ammọ. Ke ntoro anye amaakpa enyʌñ ebuuk anye ke Abio Defid, ado ikidooho ke udi mme mbọọñ.<verse eid="2CH 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 24:26" />Mbon e-ekedʌkkọ idiọọk edioomo ebaña anye ekedo Saabad, ayịn Simied awonwaan Amọn, ye Yehosabad, ayịn Simrid awonwaan Mọb. <verse eid="2CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 24:27" />Mbʌk a-abañake nditọ ideen amọ, uwak prọfesi a-abañake anye, ye ñwed a-abañake utom adinam tembịd Abasi atịmme afọn emaewet esịn ke ñwed adinam anwaña ke ñwed mme ndidem. Ndin Amasaiya ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2CH 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2CH 25" />
  <para style="s1">Amasaiya Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 25:1" />Amasaiya akedo isua edịb mme ition idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua edịb mme usʌkkeed. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Yehoadan; eka amọ aketo Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 25:2" />Anye amaanam se ikinen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado ikidooho ke afịd esịd. <verse eid="2CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 25:3" />Ke anye amaakesọọñọ amʌm itie ukara akama, anye amaawoot mme adaaha e-ekewotto ete amọ adidem. <verse eid="2CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 25:4" />Kpayeado anye ikiwotto nditọ ammọ, akeene naña ekewet ke Mbed, ke Ñwed Moses, itie ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ ewʌhọ ate: “Mme ete ye mme eka idiikpaaha ke ntak nditọ ammọ, nditọ ñko idiikpaaha ke ntak mme ete ye mme eka ammọ; awo keedekeed adiikpa ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ amọ.”<verse eid="2CH 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 25:5" />Amasaiya amaakoot mbon Yuda abon atọ keed anyʌñ anọ ammọ utom naña asaña ke mme ufọk ammọ nte mme adaiso ekọñ ke mme tọsịn (1,000) ye mme adaiso ekọñ ke mme ikie (100) ke afịd Yuda ye Benyamin. Akem anye amaasịññe mbon ake ekesọññọ isua edịb me akponno akan ado anyʌñ akịt ke emaesịm awo tọsịn ikie ita (300,000) ekemekke aditop ekọñ, esọññọ idem adikama eduad ye atu ekọñ. <verse eid="2CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 25:6" />Anye amaanyʌñ akpe mbon unwana ekọñ tọsịn ikie (100,000) akọrọ e-eketooho Isrel ke talen silfa ikie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 3 3/4 me metrịk tọọn 3.4</char></note> (100).<verse eid="2CH 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 25:7" />Ado awo Abasi keed amaadi abịne anye anyʌñ abo, “Ke ukpono Adidem, mme udịm ekọñ e-etooho Isrel inaaha nte esaña ye afo, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idaha ye Isrel, inyʌññọ ida ye awo ndomokeed ke Ifrem. <verse eid="2CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 25:8" />Akpekọm afo akaaka anyʌñ akenwana ke ata akpọsọñ ubọk ke ekọñ ado, Abasi ayaanam afo aduọ ke iso asua, sia Abasi anie adudu adinwam ye adinam awo aduọ.”<verse eid="2CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 25:9" />Amasaiya amaabịp awo Abasi abo, “Ndin nsoo ke atañ abaña talen ikie (100) ake ami ñkekpeeghe nnọ udịm ekọñ Isrel?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:9">Awo Abasi amaabọọrọ, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeme adunọọ fiin awak akan ado.”<verse eid="2CH 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 25:10" />Ke ntoro Amasaiya amaasuan mme udịm ekọñ e-eketooho Ifrem ebịne anye anyʌñ anam ammọ enyọñọ idʌñ ammọ. Ammọ emaeyat esịd ye Yuda enyʌñ enyọñọ idʌñ ammọ ke ataa ekamba ifiobesịd.<verse eid="2CH 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 25:11" />Akem Amasaiya amaasọọñọ idem amọ ke adudu anyʌñ adat mbon ekọñ amọ usʌñ akaa ke Abedeñ Inʌñ, itie ake anye akewotto ideen Sei awo tọsịn duob (10,000). <verse eid="2CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 25:12" />Mbon ekọñ Yuda emaemʌm awo tọsịn duob (10,000) ye uwem ekọrọ, emaeben ammọ edọọk ekaa ke anyọñ itiad enyʌñ etoomo ammọ eduọñọ tutu afịd ekekpəho mbai-mbai.<verse eid="2CH 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 25:13" />Ado ke ini ami, mme udịm ekọñ ake Amasaiya akenamma yak etịmme enyọñọ i-imiikiyakka nọ ekeene enwana ekọñ ado emaedʌk esuan mme abio ake Yuda akenieghe tọọñọ ke Sameria tutu ke Bed Họrọn. Ammọ emaewot awo tọsịn ita (3,000) enyʌñ eben ataa uwak mbịme ewuọñọ.<verse eid="2CH 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 25:14" />Ke ini Amasaiya akenyọññọ adiwoot mbon Edọm, anye amaaben mme abasi mbon Sei ato adi. Anye amaawuuk ammọ nte mme abasi amọ, atuak iwuod anọ ammọ anyʌñ afọp uwa anọ mmọ. <verse eid="2CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 25:15" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayat esịd ye Amasaiya, anyʌñ adọñ prọfed anọ anye, a-akebooho anye ate, “Nsoo inam yak afo akeene mme abasi mbon ami, ake imiikikanna inyaaña mbon ammọ usio fiin ke ubọk?”<verse eid="2CH 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 25:16" />Ke ini anye akesʌkkọ atañ ikọ, adidem amaabo anye, “Nte ñnyịn imaumek fiin ado andinọ adidem item? Tre! Nsoo ido ntak a-ayemme yak uwot?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:16">Ke ntoro prọfed amaatre, ado abo, “Ami mmediọọñọ ke Abasi amaabiide adusobo fiin, sia afo amaakenam ami unyʌññọ ukop item mmi.”<verse eid="2CH 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 25:17" />Amasaiya adidem Yuda amaakebịp mme anọitem amọ, anye amaadọñ etob ñnyanubọk anọ Yehoas ayịn Yehoahas, ayịn Yehu, adidem Isrel: “Di, yak ñnyịn inwana emọ-emọ ke ekọñ iso ye iso.”<verse eid="2CH 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 25:18" />Ado Yehoas adidem Isrel amaabọọrọ Amasaiya adidem Yuda: “Mbaraekpe keed ke Lebanọn amaadọñ utom anọ sida ke Lebanọn, ‘Ben ayịn awonwaan mfo nọ ayịn mmi ke ndọ.’ Ndin idiọọk unamikọd ke Lebanọn amaadi adisọnnọ mbaraekpe ke ukod. <verse eid="2CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 25:19" />Afo adọkkọ idem mfo abo ke imọ imikan Edọm ke ekọñ, ndin idahami afo amekokko idem anyʌñ akịt idem. Ado tie ke ufọk! Ntak ake afo ayemme mfịna anyʌñ adat iduọ asọk idem mfo ye Yuda ñko-o?”<verse eid="2CH 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 25:20" />Ado Amasaiya ikiikamma ikpañ utọñ, sia Abasi akenam ntom nọ eyaak ammọ esịn ke ubọk Yehoas, sia ammọ emaekeyem iso mme abasi Edọm. <verse eid="2CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 25:21" />Ke ntoro Yehoas adidem Isrel amaatop ekọñ. Anye ye Amasaiya adidem Yuda emaesoobo keedekeed iso ye iso ke Bed Semes ke Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 25:22" />Isrel amaakan Yuda, ndin afịd awo emaefeeñe enyọñọ ufọk ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 25:23" />Yehoas adidem Isrel amaamʌm Amasaiya adidem Yuda, ayịn Yoas, ayịn Ahasaiya, ke Bed Semes. Akem Yehoas amaaben anye adi Yeruselem akenyʌñ awuut ndibene Yeruselem tọọñọ ke Inuaatob Ifrem tutu akewuọ Inuaatob Inuuk, ikpeghe anyọọñọ ñkpọ nte kubid ikie inaañ (400).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 600 me mita 180</char></note> <verse eid="2CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 25:24" />Anye amaakoono afịd kold ye silfa ye afịd mme ñkpoduoho ekekịtte ke tembịd Abasi ekebaññake ke idak ukpeme Obed-Edom, dian ye mme nsọñudua ñkpọ ke ufọkadidem ye mme mbon ntañmfeb, anyʌñ anyọñ akaa Sameria.<verse eid="2CH 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 25:25" />Amasaiya ayịn Yoas adidem Yuda amaadu uwem isua duob mme ition ke Yehoas ayịn Yehoahas adidem Isrel amaakekpa. <verse eid="2CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 25:26" />Amaado mme ñkpọntịppe mfen ke ini ukara Amasaiya, tọọñọ ke akpa tutu asịm utịd, ado nte ammọ iwereke ke ñwed ndidem ke Yuda ye Isrel? <verse eid="2CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 25:27" />Tọọñọ ke ini Amasaiya akewọññọke akpọñ adikeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ammọ emaedʌk idiọọk edioomo ebaña anye ke Yeruselem ndin anye amaafeghe akaa Lakis, ado ammọ emaedọñ ideen ebịne anye ke Lakis enyʌñ ekewot anye do. <verse eid="2CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 25:28" />Emaeben anye ke anyọñ enañmbakara enyọñ edi enyʌñ edibuuk anye ye mme eteete amọ ke Abio Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="2CH 26" />
  <para style="s1">Usaiya Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 26:1" />Akekem afịd mbon Yuda emaeben Usaiya, a-akedooho isua duob mme itiokeed, enyʌñ enam anye adidem ke itie ete amọ Amasaiya. <verse eid="2CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 26:2" />Anye ado andikitịmme mbọp Elad anyʌñ atịmme aben asịn anọ Yuda ke adidem Amasaiya amaakenie nduọkadudu ye mme eteete amọ.<verse eid="2CH 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 26:3" />Usaiya akedo isua duob mme itiokeed idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua aba mme duob mme iba. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Yekolia, eka amọ aketo Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 26:4" />Anye amaanam se inen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña ete amọ Amasaiya akenam. <verse eid="2CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 26:5" />Anye amaayem Abasi ke ayio Sakaraiya, a-akekpeebe anye ke mbaak Abasi. Adaña nte anye akediọọñọke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi amaanọ anye edikan.<verse eid="2CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 26:6" />Anye amaakaa ekọñ ye mbon Filistia anyʌñ akewuut mme ndibene Kad, Yabne ye Asdọd. Akekem anye amaatịmme abọp mme abio se ikikpere Asdọd ye itie mfen ke atu mbon Filistia. <verse eid="2CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 26:7" />Abasi amaanwam anye nọ akan mbon Filistia anyʌñ akan mbon Arab e-ekedʌññọ ke Kọọ Baal anyʌñ akan mme Meunịm. <verse eid="2CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 26:8" />Mbon Amọn emaeben utịb esọk Usaiya, ndin etob amọ amaasuana tutu asịm adaña Iyib, sia anye amaanie ataa adudu.<verse eid="2CH 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 26:9" />Usaiya amaabọp mme tọwa ke Yeruselem ke Inuaatob Inuuk, ke Inuaatob Abedeñ ye ke ñkpitʌñ ndibene, ndin anye amaasọọñọ ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 26:10" />Anye amaanyʌñ abọp mme tọwa ke anaan anyʌñ atịppe uwak ube mmọọñ, sia anye amaanie uwak ufene ke mme mben abod ye ke unaisọñ. Anye amaanie mbon e-ekenamma utom ke inwañ amọ ye mme inwañ fain ke mme abod ye ke mme nseghe isọñ, sia anye amaama inwañ.<verse eid="2CH 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 26:11" />Usaiya amaanie ekọñ akenekkeke abọ ukpeeb, ke mbeeñeidem adiwuọ ke mme ikpeghe asañake akekem ye mme ibad ammọ nte Yeiyel awedñwed aketịmme ammọ idem ye Maaseiya adaaha ke idak ndadusʌñ Hananaiya, keed ke atu mme adaaha ufọk mbọọñ. <verse eid="2CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 26:12" />Afịd ibad mme adadusʌñ ke mme ufọk ekeseeghe ñkpọ ebaña mbon anwan ekedo tọsịn iba mme ikie itiokeed (2,600). <verse eid="2CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 26:13" />Ke idak ammọ ideen mbon ekọñ tọsịn ikie ita mme itiaba mme ikie ition (307,500) ekesịne se imaikibọ ukpeeb ke ekọñ, udịm a-akenieghe adudu adinọ adidem ibededem nọ akan mme asua amọ. <verse eid="2CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 26:14" />Usaiya amaanọ mme atuekọñ, eduad, itam ukwak, nsiine ekọñ, utịgha ye itiad ikañakpọ esọk afịd mbon ekọñ. <verse eid="2CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 26:15" />Ke Yeruselem anye amaanam usọ e-ekekamake ke mme tọwa ye ke mme inuuk ndibene nọ mbon ekọñ ekeme editop idañ ye mme ikpọ itiad ntọ ke mme ndibene. Etob amọ amaasuana akaa anyan, sia anye amaabọ unwam akekponno tutu anye ado anie adudu.<verse eid="2CH 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 26:16" />Ado ke Usaiya amaakekappa anie adudu, ntañidem amọ amaadat iduọ asọk anye. Anye ikinamma akpanikọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ, amaanyʌñ adʌk ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akefọp insensi ke akpokoro uwa insensi. <verse eid="2CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 26:17" />Aku Asaria ye mme anie esịd aku <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anaañ emaekeene anye edʌk. <verse eid="2CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 26:18" />Ammọ emaeketañ ikọ ye adidem Usaiya enyʌñ ebo, “Idooho ke unen mfo, Usaiya, adifọp insensi nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Utom anye ado anie mme aku, mme nditọ Erọn, ake emaekekpọnnọ enịm enọ adifọp insensi. Kpọñ adisana itie, sia afo umuukunamma akpanikọ; ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi iduunọọhọ fiin ukpono.”<verse eid="2CH 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 26:19" />Usaiya, a-akekamake usan insensi ke ubọk amọ, abeeñe idem adifọp insensi, amaayat esịd. Ke ini anye akesʌkkọ akpot ikọ ye mme aku ke iso ammọ ke iso akpokoro uwa ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akpamfia amaatịbe awuọñọ anye ke akoiso. <verse eid="2CH 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 26:20" />Ke ini Asaria ekamba aku ye afịd mme aku mfen ekeseeghe anye, ammọ emaekịt ke anye amaanie akpamfia ke akoiso, ntoro ke ammọ ekesọsọp esio anye. Ke aditịm ntañ, anye ke idem amọ amaanie udọñ adikpọñ, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaafiime anye ye udọñọ.<verse eid="2CH 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 26:21" />Adidem Usaiya amaanie udọñọ akpamfia tutu usen anye akekpaaha. Anye akedʌñ ke isio-isio ufọk, ye udọñọ akpamfia, enyʌñ enọ anye ikpan adika tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Yọtam ayịn amọ awodeen akese ñkpọ abaña akwere adidem anyʌñ akara mbon awo ke idʌñ.<verse eid="2CH 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 26:22" />Mme ñkpọntịppe mfen ke ini ukara Usaiya, ke ntọọñọ tutu awuọ utịd, ado se prọfed Aisaiya ayịn Emọs akewet. <verse eid="2CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 26:23" />Usaiya amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ, emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ekpere ammọ ke itie ubuuk akpo ake mme mbọọñ ekenieghe, sia mbon awo ekebo, “Anye amaanie akpamfia.” Ndin Yọtam ayịn amọ awodeen amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2CH 26:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="2CH 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yọtam Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 27:1" />Yọtam akedo isua edịb mme ition idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua duob mme itiokeed. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Yerusa ayịn awonwaan Sadọk. <verse eid="2CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 27:2" />Anye amaanam se inen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña ete amọ Usaiya akenam, ado anye ikidʌkkọ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> naña ete amọ akenam. Mbon awo, naña akedo, emaekaa iso ke adinam ndiọiñkpọ. <verse eid="2CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 27:3" />Yọtan amaatịmme abọp Inuaatob Anyọñ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ anam akpọsọñ utom ke ndibene abod Ofel. <verse eid="2CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 27:4" />Anye amaabọp mme abio ke abod abio Yuda ye mme ñkpọsọñ itie ye mme tọwa ke mme esịd akai.<verse eid="2CH 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 27:5" />Yọtam amaatịppe ekọñ ye adidem mbon Amọn anyʌñ akan ammọ. Ke isua ado mbon Amọn emaekpe anye talen silfa ikie keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 3 3/4 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 3.4</char></note>, kọọ abakpa tọsịn duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 1,800 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn wiid 1,600</char></note> (10,000) ye kọọ baali tọsịn duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 1,500 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn baali 1,350</char></note> (10,000). Mbon Amọn emaekaa iso eben ukem mme ñkpọ ado esọk anye ke ayọhọ isua iba ye ayọhọ ita.<verse eid="2CH 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 27:6" />Yọtam amaakpon ke adudu sia amaasaña ke mbuọdidem ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ.<verse eid="2CH 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 27:7" />Mme ñkpọntịppe mfen ke ukara Yọtam, dian afịd mme ekọñ amọ ye mme ñkpọ mfen anye akenamma, ewet esịn ke ñwed mme ndidem Isrel ye Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 27:8" />Anye akedo isua edịb mme ition idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua duob mme itiokeed. <verse eid="2CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 27:9" />Yọtam amaaduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke Abio Defid. Ndin Ahas ayịn amọ awodeen amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2CH 27:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="2CH 28" />
  <para style="s1">Ahas adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 28:1" />Ahas akedo isua edịb idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua duob mme itiokeed. Ikinamma naña Defid ete amọ akenam, anye ikinamma se inen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 28:2" />Anye amaakeene mme usʌñ ndidem Isrel anyʌñ anam mme ubobodñkpọ adidat ñkpono mme Baal. <verse eid="2CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 28:3" />Anye amaafọp mme uwa ke Itịkke Ben Hinọm anyʌñ awa nditọ amọ ke ikañ ado, asịn ifịk anam mme mbubiam ido mme idịd ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebịneke asioño anọ mbon Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 28:4" />Anye amaanam mme uwa anyʌñ afọp insensi ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie, ke mme anyọñ abod ye ke idak afịd eto a-atarake.<verse eid="2CH 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 28:5" />Ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ amaayaak anye asịn ke ubọk adidem Aram. Mbon Aram emaekan anye enyʌñ emuum uwak awo nte mbon ñkpakọb enyʌñ eben ammọ ekaa Damaskọs.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 28:5">Amaanyʌñ ayaak anye ñko asịn ke ubọk adidem Isrel, a-akenọọhọ anye ukuud ke adiwoot mbon amọ. <verse eid="2CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 28:6" />Ke usen keed Peka ayịn Remalia amaawoot mbon ekọñ tọsịn ikie ye edịb ke Yuda, sia Yuda amaasịn <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 28:7" />Sikri, awo ekọñ a-aketooho ubon Ifrem, amaawot Maaseiya ayịn adidem, Asrikam adaaha a-aseeghe ñkpọ abaña akwere adidem, ye Elkana, udiana adidem. <verse eid="2CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 28:8" />Ideen Isrel emaemuum ibaan ndọ emọ-emọ mbon Isrel e-eketooho Yuda tọsịn ikie iba (200,000), nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ukad. Ammọ ñko emaekoono ataa uwak mbịme, ake ammọ eketañña enyọñ Sameria.<verse eid="2CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 28:9" />Ado prọfed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> keed a-akekereke Oded amaaba do, ndin anye amaawuọ akaa akesoobo ye mbon ekọñ ke ini emaeketịmme enyọñọ Sameria. Anye amaabo ammọ, “Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ndufo, amaayat esịd ye Yuda, anye amaaben ammọ isịn ndufo ke ubọk. Ado ndufo emewot ammọ ke iyadesịd asịmme hefịn. <verse eid="2CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 28:10" />Ndin idahami ndufo eduak edinam mme ideen ye ibaan Yuda ye Yeruselem edoñño mme ifʌn ndufo. Ado nte ndufo ñko idoññoke mbon ndudue ye mme anam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo? <verse eid="2CH 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 28:11" />Idahami ikpañ utọñ innọ miin! Iyaak emọ-emọ mbon Isrel nditọeka ndufo ake ndufo ekemuumọ nte mbon ñkpakọb enyọñọ, sia ikañ-ikañ iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idoro ndufo ke idem.”<verse eid="2CH 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 28:12" />Akekem usʌk mme adaiso ke Ifrem, Asaria ayịn Yehohanan, Berekia ayịn Mesilemod, Yehiskia ayịn Salum, ye Amasa ayịn Hadlai, emaenam ikọ ye mbon ekenyọññọ ekọñ edi. <verse eid="2CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 28:13" />Ammọ emaebo, “Inaaha nte ndufo eben mbon ñkpakọb ado edi mi, imiidooho ntoro ñnyịn iyaido mbon ndudue ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Nte ndufo eduak adidian ke idiọọkñkpọ ye ukwañido ñnyịn? Sia ukwañido ñnyịn amaakekpokpon, ndin ikañ-ikañ iyadesịd amọ adoro ke Isrel.”<verse eid="2CH 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 28:14" />Ke ntoro mbon ekọñ emaesaana mbon ñkpakọb eyaak ye mbịme ke iso mme adaaha ye afịd esob. <verse eid="2CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 28:15" />Mme ideen se ekesioño ke anyịñ enịm emaeben mbon ñkpakọb, ndin ke atu mbịme ammọ emaesiin mbon e-ekesañake ifed afọñ. Ammọ emaenọ ammọ afọñ ye ikpaukod, udia ye ukọd, ye ufiob adan ukọk unan. Afịd mbon se idem akemem emaedoot ammọ ke edem dọñki. Ke ntoro ammọ emaeben ammọ etịmme esọk emọ-emọ mbon Isrel ammọ ke Yeriko, Abio mme Ayob, enyʌñ etịmme enyọñọ Sameria.<verse eid="2CH 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 28:16" />Ke ini ado adidem Ahas amaadọñ ebịne ndidem Asiria ate inọ unwam. <verse eid="2CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 28:17" />Mbon Edọm emaetịmme edinwana ekọñ ye Yuda enyʌñ ekoono mbon ñkpakọb enyọñọ, <verse eid="2CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 28:18" />ke ini mbon Filistia ekedʌkkọ efʌñ mme abio ke mben abod ye ke unaisọñ Nekef ke Yuda. Ammọ emaekan enyʌñ eben Bed Semes, Aiyalọn ye Kederọd, ñkọrọ Soko, Timna ye Kimso, ye mme ñkanñkʌk idʌñ ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 28:19" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasuuhọ Yuda anịm ke ntak Ahas adidem Isrel, sia anye amaanam idiọọk ido atọt ke Yuda anyʌñ akappa ado andinana mbuọdidem ñkan ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 28:20" />Tiklad-Pilesa adidem Asiria amaadi abịne anye, ado anye akedi adinọ anye ntịme ke itie unwam. <verse eid="2CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 28:21" />Ahas amaakoono usʌk mme ñkpọ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ke akwere ubọọñ ye ake mme adaaha anyʌñ aben ammọ anọ adidem Asiria, ado anye ado ikinwamma anye.<verse eid="2CH 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 28:22" />Ke ini ntịme amọ adidem Ahas amaanenekke ado anana mbuọdidem ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 28:23" />Anye amaawa mme uwa anọ mme abasi Damaskọs, e-ekekanna anye; sia anye akekere abo, “Sia mme abasi mme ndidem Aram emaenwam ammọ, ami ñyaawa uwa nnọ ammọ nọ ato do ammọ ediiñnwam miin.” Ado ammọ ekedoñño iduọ amọ ye ake afịd Isrel.<verse eid="2CH 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 28:24" />Ahas amaakoono mme ñkpoduoho mbana ke tembịd Abasi abon atọ keed anyʌñ akpok ammọ ñkeñe-ñkeñe. Anye amaakọp mme usʌñ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ adaaha mme akpokoro uwa ke afịd inuuk usʌñ ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 28:25" />Ke afịd abio ke Yuda anye amaabọp mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie adidat ñwaa uwa nnọọ mme abasi mfen, anyʌñ ademme iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete amọ.<verse eid="2CH 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 28:26" />Mme ñkpọntịppe mfen ke ukara amọ ye afịd mme usʌñ amọ, ke ntọọñọ tutu awuọ utịd, ewet esịn ke ñwed ake mme ndidem Yuda ye Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 28:27" />Ahas amaaduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke abio Yeruselem, ado awo ikinịmme anye ke udi mme mbọọñ Isrel. Ndin Hesikaiya ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2CH 28:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="2CH 29" />
  <para style="s1">Hesikaiya Anam Tembịd Asana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 29:1" />Hesikaiya akedo isua edịb mme ition idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua edịb mme usʌkkeed. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Abiya ayịn awonwaan Sakaraiya. <verse eid="2CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 29:2" />Anye amaanam se inen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña ete amọ Defid akenam.<verse eid="2CH 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 29:3" />Ke akpa afiọñ ke akpa isua ke ukara amọ, anye amaabeere mme usʌñ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ adiọñ ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 29:4" />Anye amaakoono mme aku ye mme Lifai, atañ ammọ abok ke anwa ke ñkañ usakkautịn <verse eid="2CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 29:5" />anyʌñ abo, “Ikpañ utọñ innọ miin, Lifai! Inam idem ndufo esana idahami inyʌñ inam tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ndufo asana. Isioño mme ndedeghe ñkpọ ke adisana itie. <verse eid="2CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 29:6" />Mme ete ñnyịn ikinamma akpanikọ; ammọ emaenam idiọọk ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn enyʌñ esịn anye. Ammọ emaewọññọ iso ammọ ekpọñ itie idʌñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ ewọññọ edem ammọ ewọt anye. <verse eid="2CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 29:7" />Ammọ emaekʌk mme usʌñ ñko ke ntondʌk ufọk enyʌñ eniime mme utuenikañ. Ammọ ikifọppọ insensi inyʌññọ inam ufọfọb uwa ke adisana itie inọ Abasi Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 29:8" />Ke ntoro, iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaduọ afʌk Yuda ye Yeruselem; anye amaanam ammọ edo ñkpọ ñkpaidem ye ndịk ye ntuuninua, nte ndufo ekịtte ke anyen ndufo. <verse eid="2CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 29:9" />Ami ado ntak ake mme ete ñnyịn ekeduọññọke ke ikwa ye ntak ake etañña mme nditọ ideen ye ibaan ñnyịn ndin etañ ibaan ndọ ñnyịn nte ifʌn ekọñ. <verse eid="2CH 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 29:10" />Idahami ami mmeduak adinam edioomo ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, nọ ato do ikañ-ikañ iyadesịd amọ atịmme ikpọñ ñnyịn. <verse eid="2CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 29:11" />Nditọ mmi, ikiisịn adinam ñkpọ idahami, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaimek ndufo eda ke iso amọ enam utom amọ, enam utom ke iso amọ enyʌñ efọp insensi.”<verse eid="2CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 29:12" />Akekem mme Lifai ami emaetọọñọ utom:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 29:12" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">ke Kohad:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Mahad ayịn Amasai ye Yuel ayịn Asaria;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">tọọñọ ke mbon Merari:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Kisi ayịn Abdi ye Asaria ayịn Yehalele;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">ke ubon Kesọn:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:12">Yoa ayịn Sima ye Idịn ayịn Yoa;<verse eid="2CH 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 29:13" />ke ubon Elisafan:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:13">Simri ye Yeiyel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:13">ke ubon Asaf:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:13">Sakaraiya ye Matania;<verse eid="2CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 29:14" />ke ubon Heman:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:14">Yehiel ye Simei;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:14">ke ubon Yedutun:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 29:14">Semaiya ye Usiel.<verse eid="2CH 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 29:15" />Ke ini ammọ emaekesoobo ye emọ-emọ mbon Lifai nditọeka ammọ emaekenyʌñ enam idem ammọ asana, ammọ emaedʌk ekaa ekenam tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asana, naña adidem akenọọ uyio, akeene uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 29:16" />Mme aku emaedʌk ke adisana itie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adikinam anye asana. Ammọ emaesịññe afịd ñkpọ i-imiikisanake se ekekịt ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ebon ke anwa tembịd. Mme Lifai emaeben anye enyʌñ esio anye ekaa Abedeñ Kidrọn. <verse eid="2CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 29:17" />Ammọ eketọọñọ adinam asana ke akpa usen ke akpa afiọñ, ndin ke ayọhọ usen itiaita ke afiọñ ado ammọ emaesịm ntondʌk ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ke usen itiaita mfen ammọ emaenam tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke idem amọ asana, ekweeñe ke ayọhọ usen afiọñ duob mme itiokeed ke akpa afiọñ.<verse eid="2CH 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 29:18" />Akekem ammọ emaekaa ebịne adidem Hesikaiya enyʌñ ekenọ mbʌk: “Ñnyịn iminam afịd tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asana, itie ufọp uwa ye afịd ñkpoduoho, ye akpokoro udood adisana ndidia, ye afịd ñkpọ. <verse eid="2CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 29:19" />Ñnyịn imaitịm inyʌñ inam asana afịd mme ñkpọ ake adidem Ahas akesịññeke ke unana mbuọdidem idaha anye akedooho adidem. Ammọ mmọdo idahami ke iso akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="2CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 29:20" />Ke ubak usiere edem usen adidem Hesikaiya amaakoono mme adaaha ke abio abon itie keed anyʌñ adọọk akaa ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 29:21" />Ammọ emaeben ayaaraenañ itiaba, akukịmedọñ itiaba, ñyịn edọñ itiaba ye akpoebod itiaba nte uwa idiọọkñkpọ ake abio adidem, ake adisana itie ye ake Yuda. Adidem amaanọ mme aku uyio, ubon Erọn, ate ewa ammọ ke akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 29:22" />Ndin ammọ emaewot mme ñyaaraenañ, ndin mme aku emaeben iyiib esiime ke akpokoro uwa; mfen ammọ emaewot mme akukịmedọñ enyʌñ esiime iyiib ammọ ke akpokoro uwa; akekem ammọ emaewot mme ñyịn edọñ enyʌñ esiime iyiib ammọ ke akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="2CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 29:23" />Emaeben mme ebod ake uwa idiọọkñkpọ edi ke iso adidem ye ke esob, ndin ammọ emaedoot ubọk ke ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 29:24" />Akekem mme aku emaewot mme ebod enyʌñ enịm iyiib ammọ ke akpokoro uwa nte enọ idiọọkñkpọ yak akpeubọk anọ afịd Isrel, sia adidem amaanọ uyio ate enam ufọfọb uwa ye uwa idiọọkñkpọ enọ afịd Isrel.<verse eid="2CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 29:25" />Anye amaanịm mme Lifai ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye mme simbal, mme ekpa ye mme ndidoudʌk akeene usʌñ ake Defid ye Kad akịdñkukịd adidem ye prọfed Natan eketemmeke; ami akedo ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ ke ubọk mme prọfed. <verse eid="2CH 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 29:26" />Ntoro ke mme Lifai ekeda ke mbeeñeidem ye mme ñkpọ mbre Defid; ye mme aku ye mme adukpoñ ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 29:27" />Hesikaiya amaanọ uyio ate enam ufọfọb uwa ke akpokoro uwa. Eketọọñọ adiwa uwa, ukwọ ikwọ nnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatọọñọ ñko, adiana ye mme adukpoñ ye mme ñkpọ mbre Defid adidem Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 29:28" />Afịd esob emaetuak iwuod ke ukpono, ke ini mbon ubre ikwọ ekebreke ndin mme adukpoñ emaenyʌñ esioño uyio. Afịd ami amaakaa iso tutu ufọfọb uwa akweeñe.<verse eid="2CH 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 29:29" />Ke ini ekekweeñeke adiwa uwa, adidem ye afịd awo ekebaaha ye anye emaetọọñọ edọñ enyʌñ enọ ukpono. <verse eid="2CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 29:30" />Adidem Hesikaiya ye mme adaaha emaenọ mme Lifai uyio ete etooro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke mme ikọ Defid ye ake Asaf akịdñkukịd. Ntoro ke ammọ ekekwọ itooro ke inemesịd enyʌñ etuak iwuod enyʌñ ekpono.<verse eid="2CH 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 29:31" />Akekem Hesikaiya amaabo, “Ndufo emeyaak idem ndufo enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Idi inyʌñ iben mme uwa ye uwa ekọọm idi ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.” Ke ntoro esob emaeben mme uwa ye uwa ekọọm, ndin afịd mbon se esịd ammọ ekenyịmme emaeben ufọfọb uwa edi.<verse eid="2CH 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 29:32" />Ibad ufọfọb uwa e-esob akebenne adi akedo ñyaaraenañ ata mme duob, akukịmedọñ ikie ye ñyịn akukịmedọñ ikie iba, afịd ammọ ekedo adiben mfọp uwa nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 29:33" />Mme unam se ekesio enịm nte mme uwa emaesịm ñyaaraenañ ikie itiokeed, edọñ tọsịn ita ye ebod tọsịn ita. <verse eid="2CH 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 29:34" />Ado mme aku emaenekke esịp ke ibad ekan se ekpekan eyaara afịd ikpa ufọfọb uwa; ke ntoro mme nditọete ammọ mme Lifai emaenwam ammọ tutu utom ado akweeñe tutu enyʌñ enam mme aku mfen esana, sia mme Lifai ekedoñño mbon ekesịnne ifịk enen ke edinam idem ammọ esaana ekan naña mme aku ekenam. <verse eid="2CH 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 29:35" />Ufọfọb uwa amaawak eti-eti, adiana ye akpọñ uwa emem ye uwa ndidia a-akesañake ye ufọfọb uwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 29:35">Ke ntoro utom ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatịmme atọọñọ. <verse eid="2CH 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 29:36" />Hesikaiya ye afịd mme awo emaedaara ke se Abasi akenam anọ mbon amọ, sia ekenam anye ata usọp-usọp.<verse eid="2CH 29:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="2CH 30" />
  <para style="s1">Hesikaiya Anam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 30:1" />Hesikaiya amaadọñ utom anọ afịd Isrel ye Yuda anyʌñ awet mme ñwedetob anọ Ifrem ye Manase, akoot ammọ edi ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Yeruselem edinam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 30:2" />Adidem ye mme adaaha amọ ye afịd esob ke Yeruselem emaenyịmme nọ edia Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ke ayọhọ afiọñ iba. <verse eid="2CH 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 30:3" />Ammọ ikikanna adikidia usọrọ ami ke ini amọ sia uwak mme aku ikinamma idem ammọ asana ndin mme awo ikisooboke ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 30:4" />Akikere ado amaatie nte anen anọ adidem ye afịd esob. <verse eid="2CH 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 30:5" />Ammọ emaenyịmme adinọ etob ke afịd Isrel, tọọñọ ke Beeseba tutu ke Daan, ekoot mme awo nọ edi ke Yeruselem enyʌñ edidia Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel. Awo ikisidiaha anye ye uwak awo akeene se ekewet.<verse eid="2CH 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 30:6" />Ke uyio adidem, mme asuanetob emaesaña ke afịd Isrel ye Yuda ye mme ñwedetob aketooho adidem ye mme adaaha, akewette ntom:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 30:6">“Mbon Isrel, itịmme ikeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Ebraham, Aisik ye Isrel, nọ anye akpetịmme ikeene ndufo e-esʌhọke, e-ekebọkkọke ke ubọk mme ndidem Asiria. <verse eid="2CH 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 30:7" />Ikiiba nte mme ete ndufo ye emọ-emọ mbon Isrel ndufo, i-imiikinamma akpanikọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ, ke ntoro anye amaanam ammọ edo ñkpọ ndịk, nte ndufo ekịtte. <verse eid="2CH 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 30:8" />Ikiisọñ aboditọñ, naña mme eteete ndufo ekenam; isuuk idem inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Idi ke adisana itie amọ, ake anye amaakenam asana ke nsi-nsi. Inam ñkpọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, nọ ato do ikañ-ikañ iyadesịd amọ atịmme ikpọñ ndufo. <verse eid="2CH 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 30:9" />Adieke ndufo etịmmeke ekeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, mbon e-ekemʌmmọ emọ-emọ mbon Isrel ye nditọ ndufo eyaenie mbọm ebaña ammọ, ndin eyaenyʌñ etịmme enyọñọ edi ke isọñ ami, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo a-anie mfọn ye mbọm. Anye idiikannake iso amọ ikpọñ ndufo adieke ndufo etịmmeke ekeene anye.”<verse eid="2CH 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 30:10" />Mme asuanetob emaekaa ke abio ke abio ke Ifrem ye Manase, tutu asịm Sebulọn, ado mme awo emaesak ammọ nsaha enyʌñ enọ ammọ ñyọ. <verse eid="2CH 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 30:11" />Akpesʌkado akebaaha ntoro, usʌk e-eketooho Asaa, Manase ye Sebulọn emaesuuk idem ammọ enyʌñ ekaa ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 30:12" />Ñko ubọk Abasi amaatuuk mme awo ke Yuda anyʌñ anọ ammọ esịd keed adinam se adidem ye mme adaaha ammọ ekewuuk, akeene ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="2CH 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 30:13" />Ataa ekamba atu awo emaesoobo ke Yeruselem adinam Usọrọ Uyo ake imiinieghe Yiis ke ayọhọ afiọñ iba. <verse eid="2CH 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 30:14" />Ammọ emaesịññe mme akpokoro uwa ke Yeruselem enyʌñ ekwọọk mme akpokoro uwa insensi enyʌñ etoomo ammọ edọñ ke Abedeñ Kidrọn.<verse eid="2CH 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 30:15" />Ammọ emaewot ayịnedọñ uwa Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ke ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ ke ayọhọ afiọñ iba. Abuud amaamʌm mme aku ye mme Lifai ndin ammọ emaenam idem ammọ asana enyʌñ eben mme ufọfọb uwa edi ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 30:16" />Akem ammọ emaedat mme itie se ammọ esidak eda kpa naña ekenịm ke Mbed Moses awo Abasi. Mme aku emaesiime iyiib a-mme Lifai ekeyaaha enọ ammọ ke akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="2CH 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 30:17" />Sia uwak awo ekebaaha ke atu ikinamma idem ammọ asana, akena nte mme Lifai ewot mme edọñ uwa Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo enọ mbon i-imiikisanake inyʌññọ ikan isio edọñ uwa inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 30:18" />Akpesʌkado ataa uwak awo e-eketooho Ifrem, Manase, Isaka ye Sebulọn edi ikinamma idem ammọ esana, ado ammọ ekesʌk etata unam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, a-adooho amaawọññọ akpọñ se ekewet. Ado Hesikaiya amaabọñ akam anọ ammọ, abo, “Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-afọnnọ ido, afeen anọ afịd awo <verse eid="2CH 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 30:19" />e-enịmme esịd ammọ ke adiyem Abasi, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ; akpesʌkado ake ammọ imiisanake ikikem ke mbed adisana itie.” <verse eid="2CH 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 30:20" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakop anọ Hesikaiya anyʌñ akọk mme awo.<verse eid="2CH 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 30:21" />Mbon Isrel e-ekebaaha ke Yeruselem emaedia Usọrọ Uyo ake Yiis miisịneke ke usen itiaba ye ekamba idaara, ke ini mme Lifai ye mme aku eketooroke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> afịd usen ye mme nsọñuyio ñkpọ mbre e-ekeyaaha enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="2CH 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 30:22" />Hesikaiya amaatañ ikọ nsọọñọukod anọ anyʌñ akọọm mme Lifai, e-ekewọttọ eti iwuod ke utom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ke usen itiaba ado ammọ emaedia usọrọ udeeme ndidia ammọ enyʌñ enam uwa ewuana ndidia enyʌñ etooro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 30:23" />Afịd esob emaenyịmme ndin adidia usọrọ ke usen itiaba mfen; ntoro ke usen itiaba mfen ammọ emaedia usọrọ ke idaara. <verse eid="2CH 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 30:24" />Hesikaiya adidem Yuda amaanọ esob ñyaaraenañ tọsịn keed (1,000) ye edọñ ye ebod tọsịn itiaba (7,000), mme adaaha emaenyʌñ enọ ammọ ñyaaraenañ tọsịn keed (1,000) ye edọñ ye ebod tọsịn duob (10,000). Ata uwak mme aku emaenam idem ammọ esana. <verse eid="2CH 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 30:25" />Afịd esob mbon Yuda emaedaara, ye mme aku ye mme Lifai ye afịd mbon se ikito Isrel idisoobo, ñkọrọ mme isenawo e-eketooho Isrel edi ye mbon e-ekedʌñọke ke Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 30:26" />Idaara amaakpon ke Yeruselem eti-eti, sia tọọñọ ke mme usen Sọlọmọn ayịn Defid, adidem Isrel ñkpọ ntom ikidatta itie ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 30:27" />Mme aku ye mme Lifai emaeda ediọñ mme awo, Abasi amaanyʌñ akop anọ ammọ, sia akam ammọ amaasịm anyọñ, adisana itie idʌñ amọ.<verse eid="2CH 30:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="2CH 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 31:1" />Ke ini afịd ami amaakekweeñe, mbon Isrel e-ekebaññake do emaewuọñọ ekaa ke mme abio Yuda, ewuut mme adaaha itiad enyʌñ ekpok mme abai Asera. Ammọ emaebiat mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ye mme akpokoro uwa ke afịd Yuda ye Benyamin ye ke Ifrem ye Manase. Ke ammọ emaekebiat afịd ammọ, mbon Isrel emaetịmme enyọñọ mme abio ammọ ye inie ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Etịbe ke abaña Ukpono Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 31:2" />Hesikaiya amaadeeme mme aku ye mme Lifai adọñ ke mme ikpeghe akeene mme utom ammọ, nọ enam ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ewuana keed, enam utom, enọ ekọọm enyʌñ ekwọ itooro ke mme inuaatob itie idʌñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 31:3" />Ke atu inie amọ, adidem amaatịp ñkpọ ufọfọb uwa ake ubakusen ye ndubiayio ye ake mme Sabad, ke mme Ufa Afiọñ ye ke mme adimek usọrọ naña ewet ke Mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 31:4" />Anye amaanọ mbon e-edʌñọke ke Yeruselem uyio yak enọ mme aku ye mme Lifai se ido udeeme a-anieghe ammọ nọ ammọ ekeme ediyaak idem ammọ nnọọ Mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 31:5" />Kpa ke idaha uyio ado akewuọhọ, mbon Isrel emaenọ uwak-uwak akpa mfịd ammọ ye abakpa ke ntadubọk, ufa mmịn, adan ọlif ye adanakwọọk ye afịd se ekedat ke inwañ. Ammọ emaeben uwak ñkpọ, mbaak keed ke itie duob ke afịd ñkpọ edi. <verse eid="2CH 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 31:6" />Mbon Isrel ye Yuda ekedʌñọke ke mme abio Yuda emaenyʌñ eben mbaak keed ke itie duob ke mme ufene ye edọñ ammọ ye mbaak keed ke itie duob ke atu ndisana ñkpọ e-eyaaha enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ, enyʌñ eneeñe ammọ ebono ke mme eboho. <verse eid="2CH 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 31:7" />Ammọ eketọọñọ adinam ami ke ayọhọ afiọñ ita enyʌñ ekweeñe ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba. <verse eid="2CH 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 31:8" />Ke ini Hesikaiya ye mme adaaha amọ ekedieghe edikịt mme eboho ado, ammọ emaetooro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ ediọñ Isrel mbon amọ.<verse eid="2CH 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 31:9" />Hesikaiya amaabịp mme aku ye mme Lifai abaña mme eboho ado, <verse eid="2CH 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 31:10" />ndin Asaria, akwa aku, aketooho ubon Sadọk, amaabọọrọ, “Sia mme awo eketọọñọ eben mme enọ ammọ edi ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ñnyịn iminie se ikem ke ndidia ye uwak adinọ mme awo, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadiọñ ikọd amọ, ndin ekamba atu ami ado se isʌhọ.”<verse eid="2CH 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 31:11" />Hesikaiya amaanọ uyio ate enam mme ubeed unịm ñkpọ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin emaenam ami. <verse eid="2CH 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 31:12" />Akem ammọ emaenam akpanikọ ke adikoono mme enọ nnịm, mbaak keed ke itie duob ye mme asaña-asaña enọ. Konania, awo Lifai, akedo adaiwuod akese mme ñkpọ ami, ye ayịneka amọ Simei a-akedooho udiana ke idaha. <verse eid="2CH 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 31:13" />Yehiel, Asasia, Nahad, Asahel, Yerimọd, Yoosabad, Eliel, Ismakia, Mahad ye Benaiya ekedoñño mbon ekenwamma Konania ye Simei ayịneka amọ. Afịd ammọ ekedoñño mbon ake adidem Hesikaiya ye Asaria, adaaha akeseeghe ñkpọ abaña tembịd Abasi ekemekke.<verse eid="2CH 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 31:14" />Kore ayịn Imna awo Lifai, akpeme Inuaatob ñkañ Usakkautịn, akedo ase ñkpọ mbaña enọ imaesịd ekesinọọhọ Abasi, asideeme mme enọ ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye mme asaña-asaña enọ ñko. <verse eid="2CH 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 31:15" />Idịn, Miniamịn, Yesua, Semaiya, Amaria ye Sekanaiya emaenwam anye mfọn-mfọn ke mme abio mme aku, edeeme enọ mme emọ-emọ aku ammọ nte asañake akekem ke mme ikpeghe ammọ, ikpọ ye ntək ukem-ukem.<verse eid="2CH 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 31:16" />Ke adidian do, ammọ emaedeeme enọ mme ideen ekesọññọ isua ita me akanna ado ake anyịñ akesịneke ke ñwed emana ubon, afịd mbon a-anaaha nte edʌk ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adinam mme nsio-nsio utom a-akenaaha anọ ammọ ke usen ke usen, nte asañake akekem ke utom ammọ ye ke ikpeghe ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 31:17" />Ndin ammọ emaedeeme enọ mme aku ekesịneke ke ubon ammọ akeene mme ñwed emana ubon ye ukem ado ye mme Lifai ekesọññọ isua edịb me akanna ado, nte asañake akekem ke utom ammọ ye ikpeghe ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 31:18" />Ammọ emaesịn afịd ntəkayịn, mme ibaan ndọ, ye ñkparawa ye ubọikpa ke afịd idʌñ ekesịneke ke mme ñwed emana ubon. Sia ammọ emaenam akpanikọ ke adinam idem ammọ esana.<verse eid="2CH 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 31:19" />Amaado mme aku, mbon ubon Erọn, e-ekedʌññọ ke mme isọñ inwañ e-ekpereke mme abio ammọ me ke mme abio mfen, emaenịm ideen ke anyịñ edinọ udeeme esọk afịd ideen ke atu ammọ ye afịd e-ekesịneke ke mme ñwed emana ubon ake mme Lifai.<verse eid="2CH 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 31:20" />Ami ado se Hesikaiya akenam ke afịd Yuda, anam se ikido eti ye unen ye akpanikọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ. <verse eid="2CH 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 31:21" />Ke afịd ñkpọ se anye akenam ke utom ke tembịd Abasi ye ke nsuukiwuod nnọọ mbed ye mme ewʌhọ, anye amaayem Abasi anyʌñ anam utom ke afịd esịd. Ndin ke ntoro anye amaaforo.<verse eid="2CH 31:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="2CH 32" />
  <para style="s1">Senakerib Anam Ikọ ye Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 32:1" />Ke Hesikaiya amaakenam afịd ñkpọ ke akpanikọ ye ke afịd esịd ama, Senakerib adidem Asiria amaadika ekọñ ye Yuda. Anye amaanam nnaaekọñ akanna mme ñkpọsọñ abio, akere adikan ammọ ndat nnọọ idem amọ. <verse eid="2CH 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 32:2" />Ke ini Hesikaiya akekịtte ke Senakerib amaadi ndin ke anye akeduak adinwana ekọñ ye Yeruselem, <verse eid="2CH 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 32:3" />anye amaadʌk adu ye mme adaaha amọ ye mme anam utom ekọñ abaña adisiit usʌñ mmọọñ a-atooho mme idịm e-ebaaha ke esiin abio, ndin ammọ emaenwam anye. <verse eid="2CH 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 32:4" />Ammọ emaebon ekamba atu awo e-ekesiide afịd idịm ye mmọọñ ekefegheke ke afịd isọñ. Ammọ emaebo, “Ntak a-anaaha mme ndidem Asiria edi enyʌñ edikịt uwak mmọọñ-ọ?” <verse eid="2CH 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 32:5" />Ndin anye amaasịn idem ke aditịmme ndiọñ mme ñwuudo itie ke ndibene anyʌñ abọọp mme tọwa adoot ke ammọ. Anye amaabọp ndibene mfen ke edem anye añko anyʌñ asọọñọ mme ndibene ke Abio Defid. Anye ñko amaanyʌñ anam uwak ibad ñkpọ ekọñ ye mme atuekọñ.<verse eid="2CH 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 32:6" />Anye amaamek mme ikpọawo ekọñ anọ mme awo anyʌñ asoobo ye ammọ ke anwa ke inuaatob abio anyʌñ asọọñọ ammọ idem ke mme ikọ ami: <verse eid="2CH 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 32:7" />“Isọñ idem inyʌñ isọñ esịd. Ikiikop ndịk me iduọesịd ke ntak adidem Asiria ye akpa-akpa udịm ekọñ e-ebaaha ye anye, sia adooho adudu a-akponno akan mmọdo ye ñnyịn akan andiba ye anye. <verse eid="2CH 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 32:8" />Andiba ye anye ado ñkpọ ekọñ ubọk awo kpọd, ado andiba ye ñnyịn ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn adiinwam ñnyịn anyʌññọ adiinwana ekọñ ñnyịn.” Ndin mme awo emaebọ nsọọñọidem eto ke se Hesikaiya adidem Yuda aketañ.<verse eid="2CH 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 32:9" />Akemaana koo, ke idaha Senakerib adidem Asiria ye afịd udịm ekọñ amọ e-ekenamma nnaaekọñ ekanna Lakis, anye amaadọñ mme etubom amọ eben etob eka Yeruselem esọk Hesikaiya adidem Yuda ye afịd awo Yuda e-ekebaaha do:<verse eid="2CH 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 32:10" />“Ami ado se Senakerib adidem Asiria abo: Uko mfo ami asọọñọ ada ke nsoo, yak afo atie ke Yeruselem ke idak nnaaekọñ ekannake ekʌk? <verse eid="2CH 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 32:11" />Ke ini Hesikaiya abooho, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn ayainyaaña ñnyịn asio ke ubọk adidem Asiria,’ anye idat ndufo atịn usʌñ, nọ ndufo ekpañña abiọọñ ye nsaditọñ. <verse eid="2CH 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 32:12" />Idooho kpa Hesikaiya ke idem amọ akewuuñọ mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie abasi ami ye mme akpokoro uwa, abo Yuda ye Yeruselem, ‘Ana nte ndufo ekpono Abasi ke iso akpokoro uwa keed enyʌñ efọp uwa ke ndo’?<verse eid="2CH 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 32:13" />“Nte ndufo idiọọñọke se ami ye mbon ekembemme miin iso nte ndidem Asiria ekenam ye mbon idʌñ mfen? Nte mme abasi mme idịd ado emaekan efak idʌñ ammọ ensio miin ke ubọk? <verse eid="2CH 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 32:14" />Anie ke atu afịd mme abasi ke mme idịd ake mbon ekembemme miin iso esobo akenie ukeme adinyaaña mbon amọ insio miin ke ubọk? Die ndin ke abasi ndufo akeme adifak ndufo nsio ke ubọk mmi? <verse eid="2CH 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 32:15" />Ndin ikiiyak Hesikaiya ibiaaña ndufo anyʌñ idat ndufo atịn usʌñ ntom. Ikiinịm anye ke akpanikọ, sia ibaaha abasi ndomokeed ke idịd me ke abio adidem ndomokeed a-akekanna adifak mbon amọ nsio ke ubọk mmi me ke ubọk mbọọñ ekembemme miin iso eba. Die ndin ke abasi ndufo adiifak ndufo isio ke ubọk mmi!”<verse eid="2CH 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 32:16" />Ikpọawo Senakerib emaekaa iso etañ ikọ edian <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi enyʌñ edian Hesikaiya. <verse eid="2CH 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 32:17" />Adidem amaanyʌñ awet ñwed adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel ñnyọọ, anyʌñ atañ ikọ ami adian anye: “Kpa naña mme abasi mbon idʌñ mfen imiikinyaañake mbon ammọ isio ke ubọk mmi, kpa ntoro abasi Hesikaiya idiinyaañake mbon amọ isio ke ubọk mmi.” <verse eid="2CH 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 32:18" />Akem ammọ emaekama usem Hibru ekoot mbon Yeruselem e-ekedoroke ke ndibene, adinam ammọ ekop ndịk enyʌñ enyeñ idem ma ammọ edʌk edat abio. <verse eid="2CH 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 32:19" />Ammọ emaetañ ebaña Abasi Yeruselem kpa naña eketañ ebaña mme abasi mbon idʌñ mfen, e-edoññoke mme utom ubọk awo.<verse eid="2CH 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 32:20" />Adidem Hesikaiya ye prọfed Aisaiya ayịn Emọs emaeseeme ke akam enọ anyọñ ebaña ñkpọ ami. <verse eid="2CH 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 32:21" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọñ enyere, akesoboke afịd mbon ekọñ ye mme adaiso ekọñ ye mme adaaha ke itie nnaaekọñ adidem Asiria. Ke ntoro anye amaawuọ anyọñ idʌñ amọ ke abuud. Ndin idaha anye akekaaha akedʌk tembịd abasi amọ, usʌk nditọ ideen amọ, kpa abʌk ye iyiib amọ, emaekpi anye ewot ke akañkañ.<verse eid="2CH 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 32:22" />Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenyaaña Hesikaiya ye mbon Yeruselem asịññe ke ubọk Senakerib adidem Asiria ye ke ubọk afịd mbon mfen. Anye amaakpeme ammọ ke afịd usʌñ. <verse eid="2CH 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 32:23" />Uwak awo emaeben enọ edi ke Yeruselem edinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye mme nsọñudua enọ esọk Hesikaiya adidem Yuda. Ndin tọọñọ ke ini ado afịd mme idịd emaese anye nte andikpon ñkan.<verse eid="2CH 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkokkoidem, Ñwuọnda ye Ñkpa Hesikaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 32:24" />Ke ini ado Hesikaiya amaadọñọ anyʌñ akpere ñkpa. Anye amaabọñ akam anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-akebọọrọke anye anyʌñ anọ anye utịppe idiọọñọ. <verse eid="2CH 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 32:25" />Ado esịd Hesikaiya amaakokko ndin anye ikibọọrọke mfọn ekefọnnọ ye anye; ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayat esịd ye anye ye Yuda ye Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 32:26" />Akekem Hesikaiya amaatua ñkpọfiọk abaña ntañidem esịd amọ, kpa naña mbon Yeruselem ekenam; ke ntoro iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikisịmme ammọ ke ini ukara Hesikaiya.<verse eid="2CH 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 32:27" />Hesikaiya amaanie uwak inie ye ukpono, ndin anye amaanam mme ufọk ubonoñkpọ ake silfa amọ ye kold ye mme nsọñudua itiad amọ, anem ufịk mfiọññọ, mme atuekọñ ye afịd mme nsọñudua ñkpọ. <verse eid="2CH 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 32:28" />Anye ñko amaabọp mme ufọk ekebonno abakpa idọk, ufa mmịn ye adan ọlif; anye amaanyʌñ anam mme aba anọ mme nsio-nsio enañ, ye aba anọ mme udịmedọñ. <verse eid="2CH 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 32:29" />Anye amaabọọp mme idʌñ anyʌñ anie uwak ibad edọñ ye ufene, sia Abasi amaanọ anye ataa uwak inie.<verse eid="2CH 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 32:30" />Akedo Hesikaiya akesiit iso iwuod idịm Kihọn anyʌñ asio mmọọñ ado yak afeghe akaa ñkañ usobutịn Abio Defid. Anye amaakịt unen ke afịd ñkpọ se anye aketuuk anam. <verse eid="2CH 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 32:31" />Ado ke ini mme isʌñutom ekebenne etob mme adaukara Babilọn nọ edibịp anye ebaña utịppe idiọọñọ aketịppeke ke idʌñ, Abasi amaakpọñ anye ke idem amọ adidomo anye ñnyʌñ ndiọọñọ afịd se ikisịne ke esịd amọ.<verse eid="2CH 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 32:32" />Mme ñkpọ mfen se ikitịppe ke ukara Hesikaiya ye mme utom ñwaidem amọ ewet esịn ke ñkukịd prọfed Aisaiya ayịn Emọs ke mme ñwed mbʌkutom ndidem Yuda ye Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 32:33" />Hesikaiya amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke abod ake mme udi mbon ubon Defid ebaaha. Afịd Yuda ye mbon Yeruselem emaenọ anye ukpono ke ini ñkpa amọ. Ndin Manase ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2CH 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="2CH 33" />
  <para style="s1">Manase Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 33:1" />Manase akedo isua duob mme iba idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua aba mme duob mme ition. <verse eid="2CH 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 33:2" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akeene mme abʌd-abʌd mbubiam ido ake mme idịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebịnne asio anọ mbon Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 33:3" />Anye amaamaana abọp mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ake ete amọ Hesikaiya amaakewuut; anye amaanyʌñ awui mme akpokoro uwa anọ mme Baal anyʌñ anam mme abai anọ Asera. Anye amaatuak iwuod anọ afịd udịmanyọñ anyʌñ akpono ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 33:4" />Anye amaabọp mme akpokoro uwa ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-adooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabobo, “Anyịñ mmi adiiba ke Yeruselem ke nsi-nsi.” <verse eid="2CH 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 33:5" />Ke naña akwere iba ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye amaabọp mme akpokoro uwa anọ afịd mme udịmanyọñ. <verse eid="2CH 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 33:6" />Anye amaawa nditọ amọ ke ikañ ke Abedeñ Ben Hinọm, abre idiọñ ye ifọd, aduuñọ ñkpọ, anyʌñ akaa abịne mbon useñkpọ ye mbiamfa. Anye amaanam uwak mbubiam ndiọiñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anam iyadesịd amọ ademme.<verse eid="2CH 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 33:7" />Anye amaaben ukakab ñkpọ a-anye akenamma akewuuk ke esịd tembịd Abasi, a-adooho Abasi amaabo Defid ye ayịn amọ Sọlọmọn, “Ke tembịd ami ye ke Yeruselem, ake ami mmekke nsio ke atu mme esiin Isrel, ke ndiinịm Anyịñ mmi ke nsi-nsi. <verse eid="2CH 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 33:8" />Ami ndiinamma aba ñkpad mbon Isrel akpọñ isọñ ake ami ñkemekke nnọ mme eteete ndufo, adieke ammọ ediikpeme edinam afịd ñkpọ se ami ñkewuuk nnọ ammọ ke abaña afịd mbed, mme ewʌhọ ye mme item añkenọọhọ nto Moses.” <verse eid="2CH 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 33:9" />Ado Manase amaadat Yuda ye mbon Yeruselem atịn usʌñ, ke ntoro ammọ emaenam ndiọiñkpọ a-akekanna ake mme idịd ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akesoboke mbemiso mbon Isrel.<verse eid="2CH 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 33:10" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatañ ikọ anọ Manase ye mbon amọ, ado amọ ikikpañña utọñ. <verse eid="2CH 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 33:11" />Ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadat mme adaiso ekọñ ake adidem Asiria, e-ekebenne Manase nte awo ñkpakọb, esịn ekọb ke iwuo amọ, ebọp anye ke akpoho ubọbubọk enyʌñ eben anye enyọñ Babilọn. <verse eid="2CH 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 33:12" />Ke nnananyen amọ anye amaayem mfọn ato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ anyʌñ anekke asuukidem amọ ekamba-ekamba ke iso Abasi mme eteete amọ. <verse eid="2CH 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 33:13" />Ndin ke ini anye akebọññọ akam anọ anye, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanie mbọm abaña aseeme amọ anyʌñ akop ñkpeubọk amọ; ntoro ke anye akeben anye atịmme anyọñ Yeruselem ye ubọọñ amọ. Ndin Manase amaadiọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado Abasi.<verse eid="2CH 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 33:14" />Ami amaakeboiyo anye amaatịmme abọp iso ndibene Abio Defid, ke usobutịn idịm Kihọn ke abedeñ, tutu akesịm inuausʌñ ke Inuaatob Iyak anyʌñ akanna abod Ofel akʌk; anye ñko amaanam anye akoñño akan akpa. Anye amaanịm mme adaiso ekọñ ke mme abio ndibene ke Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 33:15" />Anye amaasịññe mme isen abasi anyʌñ akesio mbid usioidem ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa ye afịd akpokoro uwa a-anye akebọppọ ke tembịd ye ke Yeruselem; anyʌñ asịññe ammọ ke abio atoomo aduọọñọ. <verse eid="2CH 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 33:16" />Anye amaatịmme abọp akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ awa uwa ewuana keed ye uwa ekọọm do, amaanyʌñ adọkkọ Yuda ate yak enam ñkpọ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 33:17" />Kpayeado, mme awo emaekaa iso adiwa uwa ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie, ado ekenam enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ kpọd.<verse eid="2CH 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 33:18" />Mme ñkpọ mfen se ikitịppe ke ukara Manase, diana ye akam anye akebọññọ anọ Abasi amọ ye mme ikọ ake mbon ñkukịd eketañña enọ anye ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, ado se ewet esịn ke mme ñwed mbʌkutom ndidem Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 33:19" />Akam amọ ye naña Abasi akebenne idem ke eseeme amọ, ukem ye afịd mme idiọọkñkpọ ye unana mbuọdidem, ye mme itie a-anye akebọppọ mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie anyʌñ awuuk mme abai Asera ye mme usọsọi ñkpọ mbemiso anye asuuk idem amọ, afịd ami emaewet ke mme ñwed mme akịdñkukịd. <verse eid="2CH 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 33:20" />Manase amaaduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke ufọkubọọñ amọ. Ndin Amọn ayịn amọ awodeen amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2CH 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amọn Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 33:21" />Amọn akedo isua edịb mme iba idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua iba. <verse eid="2CH 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 33:22" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña ete amọ Manase akenam. Amọn amaakpono anyʌñ awa mme uwa anọ afịd ndem ake Manase akenamma. <verse eid="2CH 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 33:23" />Anye ikisuuhọke idem amọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nte ete amọ Manase; Amọn amaanam ndudue amọ atọt.<verse eid="2CH 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 33:24" />Mme adaaha Amọn emaedʌk idiọọk adu ebaña anye enyʌñ ewot anye ke ufọkubọọñ amọ. <verse eid="2CH 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 33:25" />Akem mbon abio emaewot afịd mbon se ikidʌk idiọọk adu ibaña Adidem Amọn, ndin ammọ emaenam Yosaiya ayịn amọ adidem ke itie amọ.<verse eid="2CH 33:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="2CH 34" />
  <para style="s1">Uneeñe Ñkpọ Mbono Yosaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 34:1" />Yosaiya akedo isua itiaita idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua edịb mme duob mme keed. <verse eid="2CH 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 34:2" />Anye amaanam se inen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ akeene mme usʌñ ete amọ Defid, iwọññọke idʌk nnasia me ufiin.<verse eid="2CH 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 34:3" />Ke ayọhọ isua itiaita ke ukara amọ, ke ini anye akesʌkkọ ado etəkayịn, anye amaatọọñọ adiyem Abasi ete amọ Defid. Ke ayọhọ isua duob mme iba amọ anye amaatọọñọ adinam Yuda asana ke adisịññe mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ye mme abai Asera ye mme ubobodñkpọ ke Yuda ye Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 34:4" />Ke idak ndadusʌñ amọ emaewuut mme akpokoro uwa Baal; anye amaakpok mme akpokoro uwa insensi e-ekebañake ke anyọñ ammọ ñkeñe-ñkeñe, anyʌñ aboom mme abai Asera ye mme ubobodñkpọ. Anye amaaboom ammọ ñkeñe-ñkeñe anyʌñ asuan ke anyọñ udi mbon e-ekesiwaaha ñkpọ enọ ammọ. <verse eid="2CH 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 34:5" />Anye amaafọp mme akpọ mme aku ke mme akpokoro uwa ammọ, ntoro ke anye akenam Yuda ye Yeruselem esana. <verse eid="2CH 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 34:6" />Ke mme abio Manase, Ifrem ye Simiọn, tutu akesịm ke Naftali, ye ke mme ndoon akannake ammọ akʌk, <verse eid="2CH 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 34:7" />anye amaawuut mme akpokoro uwa ye mme abai Asera anyʌñ asọnnọ mme ubobodñkpọ eforo ntọñ anyʌñ akpok ñkeñe-ñkeñe afịd mme akpokoro uwa insensi ke afịd Isrel. Akem anye amaatịmme anyọñ Yeruselem.<verse eid="2CH 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 34:8" />Ke ayọhọ isua duob mme itiaita ke ukara Yosaiya, ke adinam idʌñ ye tembịd asana, anye amaadọñ Safan ayịn Asalia ye Maaseiya andikara abio, ye Yoa ayịn Yohas, awedñwed, nọ ediọñ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ.<verse eid="2CH 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 34:9" />Ammọ emaekaa ebịne ekamba aku Hilkia ekenọ anye akʌk e-ekebenne edi ke tembịd Abasi, ake mme Lifai ekedoññoke mme akpeme usʌñ ekebọọhọ mbon Manase, Ifrem ye afịd mbon Isrel se ikisʌhọ ye se ikito afịd mbon Yuda ye Benyamin ye mbon se idʌñọ ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 34:10" />Akem ammọ emaeyaak anye enọ mbon e-ekemekke yak ese anyen ke utom tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ideen ami emaekpe mbon e-ekenamma utom adidiọñ ye uneeñe ñkpọ mbono ke tembịd. <verse eid="2CH 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 34:11" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ enọ mme anam utomusọ ye mme abọbufọk akʌk nọ edat edep itiad se emaediọñ, ye adukpọk ubọp ufọk se ekama edot abom ufọk ake mme ndidem Yuda emaekeyaak nọ aduọ ana ñwuudo.<verse eid="2CH 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 34:12" />Mbon utom emaesịn ifịk enam utom ke afịd esịd akpanikọ. Emaemek mme adaiwuod adinọ ammọ ndadusʌñ, e-ekedoññoke Yahad ye Obadaiya, mme Lifai e-eketooho ubon Merari, ye Sakaraiya ye Mesulam, e-eketooho ubon Kohad. Mme Lifai, afịd ammọ e-ekedoññoke nta ke udiọọñọ ubre ndido ikwọ, <verse eid="2CH 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 34:13" />ekese ñkpọ ebaña mme anamutom enyʌñ edo mme adaaha ese afịd mbon utom ke nsio-nsio utom. Usʌk mme Lifai ekedoñño mme awedñwed, mme akpeikpe ye mme akpemeusʌñ.<verse eid="2CH 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emaekịt Ñwed Mbed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 34:14" />Idaha ammọ ekesịññeke akʌk e-ekebenne edi ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, aku Hilkia amaakịt Ñwed Mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ ato Moses. <verse eid="2CH 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 34:15" />Hilkia amaabo Safan awedñwed, “Ami mmekịt Ñwed Mbed ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.” Anye amaayaak anọ Safan.<verse eid="2CH 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 34:16" />“Akem Safan amaaben ñwed ado asọk adidem amaanyʌñ adọkkọ anye ate: Mme adaaha mfo esʌk enam afịd se ekenọọ ammọ nọ enam. <verse eid="2CH 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 34:17" />Ammọ e-ekpe akʌk a-akenaaha nte ekpe ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin eyaak enọ mme aseutom ye mme anamutom.” <verse eid="2CH 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 34:18" />Akem Safan awedñwed amaadọkkọ adidem abo, “Aku Hilkia amannọ miin ñwed.” Ndin Safan amaakoot anye ke iso adidem.<verse eid="2CH 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 34:19" />Ke ini adidem akekoppo mme ikọ Mbed ado, anye amaawai afọñ amọ. <verse eid="2CH 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 34:20" />Anye amaanọ Hilkia, Ahikam ayịn Safan, Abdọn ayịn Maika, Safan awedñwed ye Asaiya andise ñkpọ mbaña adidem mme ewʌhọ emi: <verse eid="2CH 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 34:21" />“Ikaa inyʌñ ikibịp <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> innọ miin ye nsʌhọ Isrel ye Yuda ibaña se ewet ke ñwed e-ekịtte mi. Iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> se enwañña ifʌk ñnyịn akpon sia mbon e-ekeboiyoke iso inọọ ñnyịn ikinịmme ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; ammọ ikinamma nọ asaña akekem ke se ewet ke ñwed ami.”<verse eid="2CH 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 34:22" />Hilkia ye mbon ake adidem akedọññọ ye anye emaekaa eketañ ye prọfed Hulda, a-akedooho anwaan Salum ayịn Tokhad, ayịn Hasra, akpeme itieubono afọñ. Anye akedʌñ ke Yeruselem, ke Ufa Efaak.<verse eid="2CH 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 34:23" />Anye amaabo ammọ, “Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, abo: Dọkkọ awodeen a-akudọññọ fiin annọọ miin, <verse eid="2CH 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 34:24" />‘Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: Ami ñyaaben nsobo nsọk itie ami ye mbon amọ, afịd mme isuuñọ e-ewette ke ñwed e-ekoodo ke iso adidem Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 34:25" />Sia ammọ emaensịn miin enyʌñ efọp insensi enọ mme abasi mfen enyʌñ edemme ifiobesịd mmi ke afịd se ubọk ammọ enam, eyaenwañña ifiobesịd mmi eduọk ke itie ami ndin idiinịmeke.’ <verse eid="2CH 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 34:26" />Idọkkọ adidem Yuda, a-akidọññọ ndufo edibịp eto <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ‘Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, atañ abaña mme ikọ se afo akekop: <verse eid="2CH 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 34:27" />Sia afo amaanyịmme ke esịd mfo amaanyʌñ asuuk idem mfo ke iso Abasi idaha afo akekoppo se anye aketañ abaña itie ami ye mbon amọ, ndin afo amaasuuk idem ke iso mmi anyʌñ awai mme afọñ mfo anyʌñ atua ke iso mmi, ami mmukop fiin, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. <verse eid="2CH 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 34:28" />Ndin ñyauben fiin nsọk mme eteete mfo, ndin eyaubuuk fiin ke emem. Anyen mfo idiikịtte afịd nsobo ake ami ndiiben ndi ke itie ami ye mbon e-edʌñọke mi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 34:28">Ndin ammọ emaeben ibọọrọ amọ esọk adidem.<verse eid="2CH 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 34:29" />Ndin adidem amaakoot afịd mme ñkpisọñ ake Yuda ye Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 34:30" />Anye amaadọọk akaa tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye mbon Yuda, mbon se idʌñ ke Yeruselem, mme aku ye mme Lifai, afịd mbon awo tọọñọ ke andisịb ñkan tutu awuọ andikpon ñkan. Anye amaakoot afịd ikọ Ñwed Edioomo e-ekekịtte ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ammọ ekop. <verse eid="2CH 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 34:31" />Adidem amaada ke mben abai amọ amaanyʌñ amaana ademme edioomo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, adikeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñnyʌñ nnịm mme ewʌhọ amọ, mme item ye mme mbed ke afịd esịd ye ke afịd ukpọñ, ñnyʌñ nsuuk iwuod nnọọ mme ikọ edioomo e-ekewette ke ñwed ami.<verse eid="2CH 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 34:32" />Akem anye amaanam afịd awo ke Yeruselem ye Benyamin enwọñọ ke idem ammọ; mbon Yeruselem ekenam ami nte asañake akekem ye edioomo Abasi, kpa Abasi mme eteete ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 34:33" />Yosaiya amaasịññe afịd mbubiam ubobodñkpọ ke afịd idʌñ a-anieghe mbon Isrel, anye amaanyʌñ anam afịd mbon Isrel e-ekebaaha do enam ñkpọ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ. Ke afịd ayio uwem Yosaiya, mbon Isrel ikiwọññọke ikpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa Abasi mme eteete ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 34:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="2CH 35" />
  <para style="s1">Yosaiya Anam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 35:1" />Yosaiya amaanam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Yeruselem, ndin emaewot ayịnedọñ Nsaña Mboiyo ke ayọhọ usen duob mme inaañ ke akpa afiọñ. <verse eid="2CH 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 35:2" />Anye amaamek mme aku anọ mme utom ammọ anyʌñ asọọñọ ammọ idem adinam utom ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 35:3" />Anye amaabo mme Lifai, e-ekenọọhọ mbon Isrel ukpeebñkpọ e-ekenyʌññọ enịm asaña-asaña enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: “Inịm adisana akebe edioomo ke tembịd ake Sọlọmọn ayịn Defid adidem Isrel akebọppọ. Inaaha nte edot anye ke afara ndufo ekama esaña. Idahami inam ñkpọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ye mbon amọ Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 35:4" />Inam mbeeñeidem ke mme ufọk ke mme ikpeghe ndufo, nte asañake akekem ke mme ukpeeb ñkpọ ake Defid adidem Isrel akewette ye ayịn amọ Sọlọmọn.<verse eid="2CH 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 35:5" />“Ida ke adisana itie ye atu mme Lifai ke ikpeghe keedekeed ke mme ufọk ake nditọete ndufo mbon Isrel, ñkaña awo. <verse eid="2CH 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 35:6" />Iwoot mme ñyịn edọñ Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, inịm idem ndufo asaña-asaña inyʌñ idiọñ ñyịn edọñ inịm inọ mbon Isrel nditọete ndufo, inam ewʌhọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ ato Moses.”<verse eid="2CH 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 35:7" />Yosaiya amaanọ afịd mbon abio se ikiba do ñyịn edọñ tọsịn edịb mme duob (30,000) ye mme ebod ke enọ Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, ye enañ tọsịn ita (3,000), afịd eketo inie adidem.<verse eid="2CH 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 35:8" />Mme adaaha amọ emaenyʌñ etịp ñkpọ ke imaesịd enọ mme ñkaña awo ye mme aku ye mme Lifai. Hilkia, Sakaraiya ye Yehiel, mme adaaha eseeghe ñkpọ ebaña tembịd Abasi, emaenọ mme aku enọ Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ikie edịb mme itiokeed (2,600) ye enañ ikie ita (300). <verse eid="2CH 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 35:9" />Konania, ñkọrọ ye Semaiya ye Netanel, nditọeka amọ, ye Hasabaiya, Yeiyel ye Yoosabad, mme adadusʌñ mme Lifai, emaenọ mme Lifai enọ Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo tọsịn ition (5,000) ye enañ ikie ition (500).<verse eid="2CH 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 35:10" />Emaenam ndutʌm ado ndin mme aku emaeda ke mme itie ammọ ye mme Lifai ke ndaha ikpeghe ammọ naña adidem akenọọ uyio. <verse eid="2CH 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 35:11" />Emaewot nditọ edọñ ake Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo, ndin mme aku emaesiime iyiib ekenọọhọ ammọ ke akpokoro uwa, ke ini mme Lifai ekeyaarake ikpa mme unam ado. <verse eid="2CH 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 35:12" />Ammọ emaesio ufọfọb uwa enịm nọ enọ mme ikpeghe ake mme ufọk mme awo nọ ammọ ewa enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nte ekewette ke Ñwed Moses. Ammọ emaenam ukem ado ye mme enañ. <verse eid="2CH 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 35:13" />Ammọ emaefọp mme unam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ke ikañ naña ekenịm, enyʌñ etem mme ndisana uwa ke mme ako, aketịd ye mme ako ufrañ ñkpọ enyʌñ eben enọññọ mme awo usọp-usọp. <verse eid="2CH 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 35:14" />Ke ami amaakeboiyo, ammọ emaenam mbeeñeidem enọ idem ammọ ye mme aku ñko, sia mme aku e-eketooho ubon Erọn, ekesʌk enam ufọfọb uwa ye udeeme akpọñ tutu ayio akịm. Ke ntoro mme Lifai emaenam mbeeñeidem enọ idem ammọ ye mme aku ubon Erọn.<verse eid="2CH 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 35:15" />Mbon ukwọ ikwọ, mbon ubon Asaf, ekeba ke itie Defid, Asaf, Heman ye Yedutun akịdñkukịd nnọọ adidem ekenịmme enọ ammọ. Mme akpeme inuaatob ikinaaha nte edakka ekpọñ itie utom ammọ, sia Lifai nditọete ammọ emaenam mbeeñeidem enọ ammọ.<verse eid="2CH 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 35:16" />Ntoro ke ini ado ke ekenam afịd adinam <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ye adinọ ufọfọb uwa ke akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña adidem Yosaiya akenọọ uyio. <verse eid="2CH 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 35:17" />Mbon Isrel e-ekebaaha do emaedia Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ke ini ado enyʌñ enam Usọrọ Uyo ake Yiis imiisịneke ke usen itiaba. <verse eid="2CH 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 35:18" />Kpaanam awo ikinamma Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo a-akebaaha ntoro ke Isrel tọọñọ ke ayio prọfed Samwel; ñko ibaaha adidem ke Isrel a-akenamma utọ Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo naña Yosaiya akenam, ye mme aku, mme Lifai ye afịd Yuda ye Isrel e-ekebaaha do ye mbon Yeruselem. <verse eid="2CH 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 35:19" />Emaenam Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ami ke ayọhọ isua duob mme itiaita ke ukara Yosaiya.<verse eid="2CH 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Yosaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 35:20" />Ke afịd ami amaakeboiyo, ke ini Yosaiya amaakeneeñe ñkpọ ibono ke tembịd nọ afọn, Neko adidem Iyib amaadọọk akaa adinwana ekọñ ke Kaakemis a-abaaha ke Yufretis, ndin Yosaiya amaawuọ akaa adisoobo ye anye ke ekọñ. <verse eid="2CH 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 35:21" />Ado Neko amaadọñ isʌñutom anọ anye abo, “Nsoo utọk iba do, adidem Yuda, ke ufọọd mmi ye afo? Idooho afo ke ami ñnwana ekọñ ke ini ami, ado ufọk ake ami ñnwanake ekọñ. Abasi andọkkọ miin abo yak nsọp idem; ke ntoro tre adinam ikọ ye Abasi, a-abaaha ye ami, imiidooho anye ayausobo fiin.”<verse eid="2CH 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 35:22" />Yosaiya, naña akeba, ikitịmmeke edem ikpọñ anye, ado amaakpuhọ idem amọ akenwana ekọñ ye anye. Anye ikikpañña utọñ inọ se Neko aketañ ke ewʌhọ Abasi, ado amaakaa akenwana ye anye ke unaisọñ Mekido.<verse eid="2CH 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 35:23" />Mbon utịgha emaetịgha adidem Yosaiya, ndin anye amaadọkkọ mme adaaha amọ, “Imben miin isio; ennọ miin unan idiọọk-idiọọk.” <verse eid="2CH 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 35:24" />Ndin ammọ emaeben Yosaiya esio ke sariọd amọ, esịn anye ke sariọd amọ mfen emaenyʌñ eben anye edi Yeruselem, do ke anye akekpa. Emaebuuk anye ke udi mme eteete amọ, ndin afịd Yuda ye Yeruselem emaefʌhọ anye.<verse eid="2CH 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 35:25" />Yerimaiya amaawet mme aseeme anọ Yosaiya, ndin tutu usen mfịn ami afịd ideen ye ibaan ukwọ ikwọ esitoiyo Yosaiya ke mme aseeme ado. Afịd ado amaakappa ado ido unam ñkpọ ke Isrel ndin ewet ammọ ke mme Aseeme ado.<verse eid="2CH 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 35:26" />Mme ñkpọ mfen se ikitịppe ke ini ukara Yosaiya ye mme adinam ñwaidem amọ nte asañake akekem ye se ekewet ke Mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, <verse eid="2CH 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 35:27" />afịd ñkpọntịppe, tọọñọ ke ntọọñọ tutu utịd, ewet ke ñwed mme ndidem Isrel ye Yuda.<verse eid="2CH 35:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="2CH 36" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 36:1" />Ndin mbon isọñ abio emaeben Yehoahas ayịn Yosaiya enam anye adidem ke Yeruselem ke itie ete amọ.<verse eid="2CH 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoahas Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 36:2" />Yehoahas akedo isua edịb mme ita idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem afiọñ ita. <verse eid="2CH 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 36:3" />Adidem Iyib amaadooro anye ke ebekpo ukara ke Yeruselem anyʌñ adot isob talen silfa ikie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 3 3/4 me ñkpọ nte metrịk tọọn 3.4</char></note> (100) ye talen kold keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 34</char></note> anọ Yuda. <verse eid="2CH 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 36:4" />Adidem Iyib amaanam Eliakịm, ayịneka awodeen Yehoahas adidem ke Yuda ye Yeruselem anyʌñ akpəho anyịñ Eliakịm anọ anye Yehoiyakịm. Ado Neko amaaben Yehoahas ayịneka awodeen Eliakịm anyọñ Iyib.<verse eid="2CH 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoiyakịm Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 36:5" />Yehoiyakịm akedo isua edịb mme ition idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua duob mme keed. Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ. <verse eid="2CH 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 36:6" />Nebukadnesa adidem Babilọn amaanwana ye anye anyʌñ abọp anye ke ñkpọnọ adiben anye ñkaa Babilọn. <verse eid="2CH 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 36:7" />Nebukadnesa amaanyʌñ aben mme ñkpoduoho ufọk tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aka Babilọn anyʌñ akedọñ ke tembịd amọ ke udo.<verse eid="2CH 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 36:8" />Mme ñkpọ ntịppe mfen ke ukara Yehoiyakịm, mme mbubiam ñkpọ anye akenamma ye afịd se ekekịt ebaña anye, ewet esịn ke ñwed ndidem Isrel ye Yuda. Ndin Yehoiyakịn ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="2CH 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehoiyakịn Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 36:9" />Yehoiyakịn akedo isua duob mme itiaita idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem afiọñ ita ye usen duob. Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 36:10" />Ke ini ekebeeñeke idem aditọ inwañ, adidem Nebukadnesa amaadọñ ekoot anye anyʌñ anam ekeben anye edi Babilọn, akọrọ ye mme nsọñudua ñkpoduoho ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin anye amaanam ayịneka ete<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru ayịneka ete akeme ido ayakka (se ñko ke 2 Nd 24:17)</char></note> Yehoiyakịn, Sedekaiya, adidem ke Yuda ye Yeruselem.<verse eid="2CH 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sedekaiya Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 36:11" />Sedekaiya akedo isua edịb mme keed idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua duob mme keed. <verse eid="2CH 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 36:12" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ ndin ikinyʌññọ isuuk idem amọ ke iso prọfed Yerimaiya, a-aketañña ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2CH 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 36:13" />Anye amaanyʌñ asọñ iwuod ye adidem Nebukadnesa, a-akenamma nọ anye ata unwọñọ ke anyịñ Abasi. Anye amaasọñ aboditọñ anyʌñ asọñ esịd amọ, inyʌññọ itịmme ikeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel. <verse eid="2CH 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 36:14" />Ndin ñko, afịd mme adadusʌñ ke atu mme aku ye mme awo ekappake mbon awo ekappa edo mbon unana mbuọdidem, ekeene afịd mbubiam mme idịd enyʌñ esappa tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-anye akesioho anịm asaña-asaña ke Yeruselem.<verse eid="2CH 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iduọ Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 36:15" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ, amaadọñ mme isʌñutom amọ utom anọ ammọ ke ubọk ke ubọk, sia anye amaakop mbọm abaña ikọd amọ ye itie idʌñ amọ. <verse eid="2CH 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 36:16" />Ado ammọ emaesak mme isʌñutom Abasi nsaha, esịn ikọ Abasi ke ndek enyʌñ esueñ mme prọfed tutu iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ademme abaña ammọ ndin ukọk ikibaaha. <verse eid="2CH 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 36:17" />Anye amaaben adidem mbon Babilọn nọ adinwana ye ammọ, a-akewotto mme ñkparawa ammọ ke adisana itie, ikisʌhọke mme ñkparawa ye ubọikpa, ñkpisọñ ye mbon mmemidem udọñọ. Abasi amaayaak afịd ammọ asịn ke ubọk Nebukadnesa. <verse eid="2CH 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 36:18" />Anye amaaben afịd ñkpoduoho ufọk ke tembịd Abasi anyọñ Babilọn, ñkpoon ye ntək, ye mme ñkpọuto ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye mme ñkpọuto adidem ye ake mme adaaha. <verse eid="2CH 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 36:19" />Ammọ emaekịm ikañ esịn ke tembịd Abasi enyʌñ ewuut ndibene Yeruselem ebon; ammọ emaefọọmọ afịd mme ufọkadidem enyʌñ ebiat afịd mme nsọñudua ñkpọ do.<verse eid="2CH 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 36:20" />Anye amaakoono mme nsʌhọ akaa Babilọn, mbon e-ekebọkkọke akañkañ, ndin ammọ emaekappa edoñño nditọufọk enọ anye ye mbon ekedatta itie amọ tutu ukara Pesia adida ubọọñ. <verse eid="2CH 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 36:21" />Ke afịd ini ammọ ekekpọññọ idʌñ, isọñ amaanie nduọkadudu Sabad, tutu isua ata mme duob adiboiyo nọ asaña akekem ke ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañña ato inua Yerimaiya.<verse eid="2CH 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 36:22" />Nọ asaña akekem ye ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañña ke inua Yerimaiya, ke akpa isua Sairọs adidem Pesia akedaaha ukaara, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịn ke esịd Sairọs adidem Pesia anam anye anọ ewʌhọ ke afịd itie a-anye akekarake anyʌñ awewet ewʌhọ ado asịn ke ñwed:<verse eid="2CH 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 36:23" />“Ami ado se Sairọs adidem Pesia atañ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2CH 36:23">“ ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi anyọñ, annọ miin afịd mme abioubọọñ ke ederimbod anyʌñ ammek miin adibọp tembịd nnọọ anye ke Yeruselem ke Yuda. Ikọd amọ akeedodo a-abaaha ke atu ndufo akeme adidọọk ñkaa, ndin yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ aba ye ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="2CH 36:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 36" />
</usx>